<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Shanjo</book>
  <para style="h">Bitendantu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bit</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bitendantu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bitendantu byo batumigwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bitendantu byo batumigwa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Inkuluwizi jo Moya go Kucena</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Mwibuka lyangu lyetanzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndibuka lya Luka ka ta, u mu na ga mu ñolela byo ku bonigwa no bumi bwa Jesu ku twala aa na ga indilwa kwigulu.</char></note>, Teofile, se ndi ku ñolela i bintu byonse ibi sa tangila uku tenda Jesu mane ne bi sa ziga byonse, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />ku twala mwijuba ili sa indilwa kwigulu uku sa la mani uku laga ko Moya go Kucena a batumigwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A batumigwa kampa a baapositola mu Cigelike. Onse aa sa ka mu gwane ijwi lyo batumigwa mu mabuka gamwinya go nzumininano impya, mu zibe buti mba apositola ba tegwa.</char></note> aba na ga shala. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Mu majuba go makumi gone ku zwa a ku pengisigwa kwakwe no ku yagigwa ka li bonaazanga kwabo mu nako no nako, na bonisa buti ka li mumi wawa. Ka kwesi uku ba gambaguza byo mubuso gwa Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Ijuba limwinya ili sa li gwana nabo, kale ga lya i bilyo nabo mi kale ga ba ta buti, “Na mu leke ku zwa tanzi mu munzi gwa Jelusalema mbwita aa sa ka na mi tumine Tata inkuluwizi jo Moya go Kucena, ubu se ndi mi tela etanzi. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Kakuli Joani ka kolobezanga ko menzi kono inwe kuti na mu kolobezigwe ko Moya go Kucena mu majuba a mace.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ja kwigulu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />A batumigwa aa ka ba si kele no Jesu bulyao, kale ba mu buza buti, “Mfumwetu, aano so la bogoza u mubuso ku bantu ba Isilaele?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Jesu kale ga ba ta buti, “Tata genke ndege a kwesi inguzu jo ku gamba a nako no lusiku, ta li mbyenu buti mu bi zibe aano. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Kono kuti na mu tambule inguzu u Moya go Kucena aa na gu keze kwenu, mi kuti na mu be a bampaki bangu mu malonga gonse ku tatikila mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, no mwilonga lya Judeya lyonse, mwilonga lyo Masamaliya mane no ku twala mu malonga gonse ga ansi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Jesu aa sa la gambi bulyao, kale ga indilwa kwigulu bonse na ba mu lolelele mi ijoba kale lya mu vwika mi kale ba kangwa uku mu bona. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Aa ka ba si lolelele bulyao kwigulu, wangu-wangu bulyo a bankosi bo bile aba ka ba zwesi i bizwato byo ku tuba lwini kale ba keza ku ba zimana ambali. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Kale ba ba ta buti, “Inwe mwe bankosi ba kwa Galileya, ncinzi aa mu zimene na mu lolelele kwigulu? Joju Jesu uju a la mi leki ku ja kwigulu, ijuba limwinya kuti na ka bogole bulyao mu la mu boneni a jila kwigulu.”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus ascends to heaven" file="gt00105.jpg" size="col" loc="Act 1:9-11" ref="1:9-11">Jesu aa kambamina kwigulu</figure><verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matiyasi aa jobola Judasi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />A batumigwa kale ba zwa Elundu lya Olive ku bogola mu munzi gwa Jelusalema ugu ka gu li afuwi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">U lujendo ka lu sika a lujendo lwejuba lyo Nsabata.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Aa ba ka sika, kale ba ka ngina mu kampetu ka egulu lyo njugo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa Isilaele ka ba kwesi a majugo go bitina aga ka ba jakilanga egulu lya gamwinya majugo. Mi a batumigwa kale ba ngina mu njugo ja kwigulu.</char></note> umu ka ba kalanga. A mazina gabo mba Pitolosi, Joani, Jakobo, Andileya, Filipi, Tomasi, Bbatolome, Mateu, Jakobo mwana Alufeyasi, Simoni uju ka ba kuganga Ziloti no Judasi mwana Jakobo.<verse eid="ACT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Bonse kale ba li gwana mi ka ba zundamine mu ku lapela mane no Maliya nyina gwa Jesu no banakazi bamwinya no bancegwe ba Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Momo mu majuba a bazumini se ka ba shaka uku sika a 120 mi aa ka ba gwanene antu-onke, Pitolosi kale ga zimana no ku ba ta buti, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Bakwangu, a Mañolo ga li botele uku vumbilizwa go bintu sa gamba Deviti ko Moya go Kucena ku kale bya Judasi uju sa twala a kagugi ko bantu ka kwata Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Judasi ka li go kagugi ketu uju ka tu tenda nage u musebezi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Ko ntifo na ga tambula Judasi a mutendelo gwakwe u mubi, kale ga gula igwa umu na ga ka fwila ko ku gwila ansi no ku ñatuka ivumo mi i mila jakwe jonse kale ja juulukila anze. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />A bantu bonse ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema kale ba shugwa byo lufu lwa Judasi mi kale ja ba i ñambagulo jabo. Kale ba gulika lelyo igwa izina lya Akeldama mu mushobo gwabo, ku toloka Igwa lyo Malowa.<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Pitolosi kale ga ta nage, “Mwibuka lyo Nimbo mbuti ku ñolelwe buti, ‘Injugo jakwe ji be itongo mi na ku leke ku ba no muntu a kalamo.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:25">Nimbo 69:25</ref>.</char></note> Kame mbuti ku ñolelwe buti, ‘Jumwinya na jobole a kaito kakwe ko butumigwa.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 109:8">Nimbo 109:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Cwale nkwa butokwa aa tu shala jumwinya ku bankosi aba ka ba sebeza neswe inako jonse u Mfumu Jesu aa ka si joja mukati ketu. <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />Ku tatikila ku nkolobezo ja Joani ku twala ku lusiku na ga indilwa Jesu kwigulu, buti nage a be umpaki go mbuko ja Jesu, sinagwe ndiswe.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Aobulyo, kale ba shala a bankosi bo bile ba Josefa uju ka kugigwa Bbasabbasi (uju ka kugigwa kame buti ndi Jasitasi) no Matiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Kale ba lapela buti, “Gwe Mfumwetu, igwe u zekelele i myojo jo bantu bonse, u tu sunde shunu buti ndini kwa baba bo bile uju u la shali, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />buti a jobole Judasi mu musebezi go butumigwa ugu na ga leka, uju sa li yaga gemwini no ku lijila uku ka botele.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Kale ba tenda iñeela mi Matiyasi kale ga ji tunga, mi kale ba mu gwanika ku batumigwa aba se ka ba li be kumi no genke.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Uku keza ko Moya go Kucena</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Mwijuba lyo Pentekota,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ijuba ka ba tendanga u Mukiti a Majuda uku se ku la iti a majuba ga 50 ku zwa a Mukiti go Mpaseka ugu ka gu julika kame a lufu lwa Jesu.</char></note> a bazumini bonse kale ba gwanana mu cibaka conke. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Aobulyo kale ba shugwa inkuli ka ji keza bu junga mwigulu sinagwe nkaungwe-ungwe a kashanshu no keza ku shugwaala mu njugo monse umu ka ba kele. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Kale ba bona i bintu ka bi bonaala sinagwe ni ndimi jo mulilo ji mwagala no ku kala a mutwi go muntu no muntu. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Bonse kale ba vumbigwa ko Moya go Kucena mi kale ba tatika uku gamba mu ndimi ji andene-andene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I mishobo jo bantu ba ku malonga ga kungi iji ta ba la shugwa no ku gamba. Kono u Moya go Kucena kale gwa ba wa inguzu jo ku gamba i mishobo ta be zi, iji ta ba la li ziga.</char></note> ubu ka gu ba goliseza u Moya.<figure style="fig" alt="Tongues of fire on disciples" file="cn01890b.jpg" size="col" loc="Act 2:1-4" ref="2:1-4">Indimi jo mulilo a mitwi jo bazigigwa</figure><verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Momo mu munzi gwa Jelusalema mo ka ku kele a Majuda aba ka ba zwa mu malonga ga andene-andene ga ansi, aba ka ba jogete Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />A bantu a bangi aa ba shugwa lelyo ijaba, kale ba gwanana antuonke bu komoketwe, kakuli u muntu no muntu gense ka shugwa u mushobo gwakwe gu gambigwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Kale ba gamba bu komoketwe mi kale ba buza nabo, “Bonse baba ba gamba ta li Magalileya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Mbuti elu u muntu gense gwetu aa shugwile ba gamba mu mushobo gwetu? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Iswe twe Mapalatiya, Mamede, Maelami, mane na ba ba zwa ku malonga ga Mesopotamiya. Ba kwa Judeya no Kapadosiya, ba kwa Ponto no Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Filijiya no kwa Pamfiliya, kwa Egepita no mbazu ja Libbiya afuwi no Silene, no bapoti ba zwa kwa Loma <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />(a Majuda mane na ba na ba sigulukila ku Cijuda), a Makileta no ba kwa Alabbiya. Twense tu li ba li shugwile ba gambagula mu ndimi jetu, i bintu bi komokwisa bya Nyambe.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Kale ba komokwa no ku zielea, mi kale ba li buzagula mwalyabo nabo, “Mbinzi bi toloka byebi?”<figure style="fig" file="SHJ_175wbt - Pentecost [bwf-dark].indd" size="span" ref="2:5-11" /><verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Bamwinya nanganceciba, kale ba ba nyungulula no ku ta nabo, “Mbucwala ba dakwite.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi aa tandaza a bantu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Cwale Pitolosi kale ga zimana mane no batumigwa be kumi no genke, mi kale ga gamba ko ku gongoza kwijwi lyakwe ku gambaguza a bantu a bangi nage, “Mwe bagenzangu a Majuda mane nenwe mwense mu joja mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, mu leke ndi mi tansulwile byebi, mu tegeleze nenja ibi ndi gamba. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Baba a bantu ta ba dakwite, sinagwe ubu mu gajila kakuli ku si li 9 jo masiku-siku! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Kono mbebyo sa gamba u muboni gwa Nyambe Juwele buti,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Mbuti ndi co nde Nyambe buti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">mu majuba go mamaninino, kuti na ndi sintile u Moya gwangu a bantu bonse.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">A banenu bo baninzana no bakazana kuti na ba gambe <optbreak />ko buboni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">A bankosana benu kuti na ba bone i bibonwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">A bankosi benu a bakulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">kuti na ba lotange a maloto.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Nanga mpa baika bangu, a bankosi no banakazi bonse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">kuti na ndi sintile u Moya gwangu mwa gago a majuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">mi kuti na ba gambange ko buboni.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Kuti na ndi bonise i bintu bi komokwisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">kwigulu mane no bijuliko ansi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">a malowa no mulilo no cusi.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Ijuba kuti na li zoligwange a kansindwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">no kwezi ku subila sinagwe malowa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">na li sini ku sika ijuba inene ili li pazima lyo Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Mi u muntu gense uju na kuge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">ezina lyo Mfumu Nyambe kuti na jojeswe.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Juwele 2:28-32</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Mwe bantu ba Isilaele, mu tegeleze ibi. Nyambe sa bonisa buti ndege sa tuma Jesu gwa kwa Nanzaleta uju ka tenda i bintu bi komokwisa no bijuliko mukati kenu sinagwe inwe wawa aa mwi zi bulyao. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Nyambe sa tambika joju u muntu kwenu ko bu ka gajile etanzi, mi inwe no ko ntuso jo bantu a babi, kale mwa mu yaga ko ku mu kankamina a cifapaano. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Kono Nyambe kale ga mu busa ku bafu, ku mu lukulula ku ntalu jo lufu, kakuli u lufu ta ka lu gola uku mu gunzilila. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Deviti sa gamba bya Jesu buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 2:25" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Ndi liwene u Mfumu Nyambe ambali neme inako jonse.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Kakuli nku mulyo gweganja lyangu a li, ta na ndi ukuswe.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Cwale u mojo gwangu gu li jangele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">no lulimi lwangu lwa sa nyanguluka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">no mubili gwangu nago kuti na gu wise mu nsepo,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kakuli ta no ndi lekelele mu cibaka co bafu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwibita kampa Hades mu Cigelike.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">ta no zumine buti ndi bole ime go kucena gwako.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Na gwa ndi sunda inzila jo bumi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">kuti no ndi jangaze na ndi kele afuwi negwe.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Nimbo 16:8-11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Mwe Maisilaele bagenzangu, ndi la gola uku mi lugwila ko bundume buti sukuzetu Deviti sa fwa mi sa zikigwa, mi ibita lyakwe nko lili no shunu-aano. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Kono ka li muboni gwa Nyambe uju ka zekelele buti Nyambe sa mu kuluwiza ko ku konka buti ka botele uku tula jumwinya go bewe aba ka ba si keza a cikalo cakwe co bumfumu. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Ko ku bona ibi ka bi si keza, kale ga gamba byo mbuko jo Mushaligwa, buti ta na ga mu lekelela mu cibaka co bafu, kampa buti u mubili gwakwe gu bole.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />“Nyambe sa busa joju Jesu ku bafu, mi twense tu li bampaki ba jeji intaba. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Na ga nanwinwa kwiganja lyo mulyo lya Nyambe, mi na ga tambula u Moya go Kucena ugu sa kuluwiza Isi mi na ga sinta ici mu wene aano no ku shugwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Kakuli Deviti ige ta sa kambamina kwigulu, kono kame sa ta buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 2:34" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Nyambe sa ta kwa Mfumwangu buti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">“U kale ku mulyo gweganja lyangu<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />ku twala aa na ndi tende aba ba ku zimbite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">sinagwe malyatilo go cikalo co matende gako.” ’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Nimbo 110:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Cwale a bantu bonse ba Isilaele, mu zibe wawa buti, Nyambe sa tenda joju Jesu, u Mfumu no Mushaligwa uju na mwa kankamina a cifapaano.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />A bantu aa na ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba shugwa uku shisha ku myojo mi kale ba ta Pitolosi mane no batumigwa bamwinya nabo, “Bakwetu, mbizi tu botele uku tenda?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Pitolosi kale ga taba nage, “Mu siguluke mi mu kolobezigwe, mwense, mwizina lya Jesu Kilesite kebaka lyo bitendantu i bimangoju byenu buti bi kwatilwe. Mi kuti na mu tambule impo jo Moya go Kucena. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kakuli inkuluwizi njenu no banenu no babo ba si ka li u kule, bonse babo na kuge u Mfumu Nyambe gwetu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Pitolosi kale ga ba nanguza ko majwi a mangi, mi kale ga ba indikiza nage, “Mu li jojese mwebeni ku zwa kwa lolu u luasi u lubi.”<verse eid="ACT 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Babo na ba tambula a majwi gakwe kale ba kolobezigwa, mi impalo ji shaka uku sika a 3,000 kale ja gwanikigwa ku mpalo jo bazumini lelyo ijuba.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">I ngwanano jo bazumini</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Ka ba zundamine ku nzigo jo batumigwa no mu ngwanano, no mu ku komagulwa ko binkwa no mu ntapelo.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Bonse kale ba joga kebaka lyo bintu bi komokwisa no bijuliko ibi ka ba tenda a batumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />A bazumini bonse ka ba kele antu-onke mi ka ba li taila i bintu byonse. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Ka ba gulisa i bintu ka ba kwesi no bimunantu no ku wa a masheleñi kwa babo ka ba bulite. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Mwijuba-mwijuba ka ba zundamine uku gwanananga antu-onke mu tumpetu to tempele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I tempele ni njugo inene ja Nyambe iji ka ji gwanaala bulyo mu munzi gwa Jelusalema u mu ka ba lapelelanga a Maisilaele. Ka ba zuminanga buti Nyambe mwali momo mu njugo.</char></note> no mu majugo gabo no ku lila antu-onke ko myojo ji jangele no ku nyanguluka. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Ka ba lumba Nyambe na ba likola i cisemo co bantu bonse. Mi mwijuba-mwijuba u Mfumu Nyambe ka gwanika ku mpalo jabo ko bantu aba ka ba jojeswa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Pitolosi aa oza u mulwele uju ta ka jenda</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Ijuba limwinya a kamwi ko nako ja 15, Pitolosi no Joani kale ba ja ku tempele mu nako jo ku lapela. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Mi nko ka li unkosi uju ta ka jenda ga li ku bonenwa, uju ka ba twalanga mwijuba-mwijuba no ka mu tula a cizi co tempele, ici ka ci kugigwa Icilotu buti a kumbile ku bantu aba ka ba ngina mu tumpetu to tempele. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Aa bona Pitolosi no Joani na ba shaka uku ngina, kale ga ba kumbila a masheleñi.<verse eid="ACT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Pitolosi no Joani kale ba mu lolelela lwini, mi Pitolosi kale ga mu ta nage, “U tu lole.” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Cwale jojo unkosi kale ga ba lola na sepete buti kuti a gwane cimwinya kwabo. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Cwale Pitolosi kale ga ta buti, “Ta ndi kwesi a masheleñi, kono ici ndi kwesi nda sa ci ku wa. Mwizina lya Jesu Kilesite gwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta, u jende!”<verse eid="ACT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Pitolosi kale ga mu kwata kwiganja lyo mulyo, ku mu zimika, mi aobulyo a matende no ñongo ja jojo unkosi kale bya gongola. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Kale ga shotauka no ku tatika uku jenda mi kale ga ka ja nabo mu tumpetu to tempele, na jenda no ku shotauka na lumbeka Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />A bantu bonse aa ba mu bona na jenda no ku lumbeka Nyambe, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />kale ba mu ziba buti ndege julya ka kalanga a cizi Icilotu co tempele na kumbila, mi kale ba komokwa lwini kwe bi na bya tendaala kwakwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Jojo unkosi aa ka si gunzilile ku ba Pitolosi no Joani, a bantu bonse kale ba komokwa mi kale ba keza bu tigila kwabo mu cibaka ci kugigwa a Malibela ga Solomoni.<verse eid="ACT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Intandazo ja Pitolosi ku bantu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Pitolosi aa bona bulyao, kale ga ba ta nage, “Mwe bagenzetu a Maisilaele, ncinzi aa mu komokwa kwe ci ci la tendaali? Ncinzi aa mu tu lolelele lwini sinagwe mu nguzu no nzumino jetu aa tu la goli buti joju unkosi a jende? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Nyambe gwa Abbulaama, Isaka no Jakobo Nyambe gu basukuzetu, na ga wa impazimo ku muika gwakwe Jesu. Na mwa mu wa buti a yagigwe, no ku mu tambika kwa Pilato, jebo ige ka shakite uku mu lukulula. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Na mwa kana go Kucena no ku Lulikila no ku kumbila buti ba mi lukulwile u muyagi. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Na mwa yaga u muwi go bumi, kono Nyambe na ga mu busa ku bafu. Tu li bampaki ba jeji intaba.<verse eid="ACT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />“Ko nzumino mwizina lya Jesu, joju unkosi mu wene no ku ziba a la gongoli. Ndizina lya Jesu no nzumino ji zwa kwakwe bi la mu ozi wawa, sinagwe aa mu gola uku bona mwense.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Cwale, mwe bagenzangu a Maisilaele, ndi li zi buti ta ka mwi zi i bintu na mwa tenda inwe no bajendesi benu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Kono Nyambe na ga vumbiliza ibi sa gamba etanzi ko baboni bakwe bonse, ku ta buti u Mushaligwa gwakwe ka botele uku penga. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Mu siguluke elu, mu sigulukile kwa Nyambe, izo buti i bitendantu i bimangoju byenu bi singulwe, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Buti ku keze a manako go ku ezuluka aga ga zwa ku Mfumu Nyambe, no ku mi tumina u Mushaligwa, uju na ga mi shalila, mi ndi Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Jesu a li botele uku kalilila kwigulu ku twala inako aa na ji sike Nyambe aa na zole i bintu byonse u buya, sinagwe ubu sa kuluwiliza kale-kale ko baboni bakwe bo kucena. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Kakuli Mushe sa ta buti, ‘U Mfumu gwenu Nyambe kuti na mi tumine u muboni sinagwe ndime ku zwa mukati ko bakwenu, mu li botele uku tegeleza ku bintu byonse ibi a mi lugwila. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />U muntu gense uju na kane uku mu tegeleza kuti na kosholwe wawa ku bantu bakwe.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Mulao 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:19">19</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />“Mi ku tatikila kwa Samuele, a baboni ba Nyambe bonse aba na ba gamba se ba lugula etanzi bya gaga a majuba. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Nenwe mu li bajoboli bo baboni ba Nyambe no bo nzumininano iji sa tenda Nyambe no basukuzenu. Sa ta kwa Abbulaama buti, ‘Ko maasi gako a bantu bonse ansi kuti na ba gwane imfwijaguzi.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Matatikilo 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:18">22:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Nyambe aa sa shala u muika gwakwe, kame sa mu tuma tanzila kwenu buti a mi we imfwijaguzi ko ku mi sigulula mwense ku mi zwisa mu mazila genu a mabi.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Pitolosi no Joani aa ba shuminigwa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Pitolosi no Joani aa ka ba si gambagula bulyao ku bantu, a Mapulisiti no mujendesi go bamameli bo tempele mane no Basaduki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A Basaduki ka ba li bantu aba ta ka ba zumina ku mañiloi kampa ku mbuko jo bafu. </char></note> kale ba ba kezela. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Kale ba lunguka wawa kakuli a batumigwa kame ka ba ziga a bantu, na ba gamba buti Jesu sa buka ku bafu mi nko ku ta buti nko ji li imbuko jo bafu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Kale ba kwata Pitolosi no Joani, mi kakuli se ka ga li matengu, kale ba ba tula mu ntolongo ku twala ijuba ili na lya nungako. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Kono a bantu a bangi aba na ba shugwa a majwi gabo kale ba zumina, mi impalo jo bantu aba na ba zumina kale ja shaka uku sika a 5,000.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Aa na bwaca a bajendesi no bakulu no bazigi bo mulao kale ba gwanana mwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Ana u mupulisiti u mukulu nko ka li koko, mane no Kayafa, Joani, Alekizanda mane no bamwinya bo luasi lo mupulisiti u mukulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Kale ba leta ba Pitolosi no Joani afuwi nabo mi kale ba tatika uku ba buzagula nabo, “Nka nguzu ja buti kampa nkezina lyani aa na mwa gola uku tenda bulyao?”<figure style="fig" alt="Peter and John in the Jewish Council" file="cn01901b.jpg" size="col" loc="Act 4:5-10" ref="4:5-10">Pitolosi no Joani mu nkuta jo Majuda</figure><verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Cwale Pitolosi, ko ku vumbigwa ko Moya go Kucena, kale ga ba taba nage, “Mwe bajendesi nenwe mwe bakulu bo bantu! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Ati kame tu la kugigwa uku li tabilila shunu kebaka lyo citendantu co cisemo ci la bonisigwa ku nkosi uju ta ka jenda no ku buzagula ubu a la ozekezwi, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />cwale elu mu zibe, inwe mane no bantu bonse ba Isilaele buti, joju unkosi sa zimene afuwi nenwe bu lwalukite, nkezina lya Jesu Kilesite gwa Nanzaleta, uju na mwa kankamina kono Nyambe kale ga mu busa ku bafu. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Jesu,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 4:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">‘ndebwe ili na mwa kana inwe mwe bajaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ili na lya ba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">lyo nsumpo.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Nimbo 118:22</ref>.</char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibwe ndya ku koza sinagwe ncishamu co ku sumpisa injugo. Kakuli a majugo getu no bishamu tu ga sumpisanga ta li mabwe. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Injojeso nkwakwe genke bulyo ji gwanaala, kakuli takuli izina limwinya ansi ili na lya wegwa ku bantu ili tu botele uku jojeswa kalyo.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Aa ba bona u bundume bu ba Pitolosi no Joani no ku ziba buti ta ka ba lizigite no ku ta buti ka ba li bantu bulyo, kale ba komokwa mi kale ba nangula buti baba a bankosi ka ba kalanga no Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Kono ko ku ta buti ka ba gola uku bona jojo unkosi na ga ozwa na zimene ao nabo, takuli ici ka ba gola uku gamba. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Cwale kale ba ba zwisa mu nkuta mi kale ba li gambaguza mukati kabo.<verse eid="ACT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Kale ba buza nabo, “Mbuti tu botele uku tendela kwa baba a bankosi? Kakuli a bantu bonse aba ba joja mwa Jelusalema ba li zi buti na ba tenda i cijuliko ci zibaala, mi ta tu goli uku ci shampula. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Kono uku kangwisa jeji intaba uku janduluka lwini mukati ko bantu, tu li botele uku ba nanguza buti ba leke uku gamba ku muntu gense mwa leli izina kame.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Cwale kale ba ba kugila mu nkuta kame no ku ba lugwila buti na ba leke uku gamba kampa uku ziga mwizina lya Jesu kame.<verse eid="ACT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Kono ba Pitolosi no Joani kale ba taba nabo, “Inwe mu be a baatuli, ici ci lulikile mu mensho ga Nyambe ncibo, nku tegeleza kwenu kampa nku tegeleza kwa Nyambe? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kono iswe ta tu goli uku ombelela a bintu na twa bona no ku shugwa.”<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Aa se ba la mani uku ba nanguza wawa kale ba ba ta buti ba ka li jile. Ta na ba gaja ubu ka ba botele uku ba bangisiza, kakuli a bantu bonse kame ka ba lumbeka Nyambe kwe ci na ca tendaala. Kale ba ba leka na ba ka li jila bulyo. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Kakuli unkosi uju na ga ozwa ko cijuliko ici ci makaza se ka kwesi i myaka ka ji itilila a makumi gone.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">A bazumini aa ba lapela</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Ba Pitolosi no Joani aa se ba la zwisigwa, kale ba bogola ku basele babo no ka lugula byonse ibi na ba gamba kwabo a mapulisiti a bakulu no manduna. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />A bazumini aa se ba la shugwi bulyao, kale ba gongoza ku majwi gabo antu-onke mu ntapelo kwa Nyambe nabo, “Gwe Mfumu Nyambe go Nguzu, igwe so bumba igulu nelonga newate mane no bintu byonse ibi bi limo. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />So gamba ko Moya go Kucena ko ku litusisa a kanwa ko muika gwako, isetu Deviti buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 4:25" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Ncinzi a bantu bo malonga aa ba nyegele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Ncinzi a bantu aa ba jonena inako a ku gaja i bintu ta bi kwesi intuso?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />A bamfumu belonga ba sa zimana no bajendesi ba sa gwanana antu-onke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">ku lwisa u Mfumu Nyambe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">no ku lwisa u Mushaligwa gwakwe.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mushaligwa gwakwe, kampa Mesiya mu Ciebelu, Kilesite mu Cigelike.</char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Nimbo 2:1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />“Mbyaconse ba Eloda no Ponso Pilato se ba gwanana no bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda no bantu ba Isilaele mwa gogu u munzi ku lwisa u muika gwako uju a cenete Jesu, uju so shala. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Na ba tenda ibi ko shaka no ku gaja ku kale ko nguzu jako buti bi li botele uku tendaala. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Aano, gwe Mfumu Nyambe, u vuluke a maingila gabo no ku golesa a baika bako uku gamba ijwi lyako ko bundume wawa. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Golola iganja lyako u oze no ku tenda i bijuliko no bintu bi komokwisa kezina lyo muika gwako Jesu go kucena.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Aa se ba la mani uku lapela, i cibaka umu ka ba gwananine kale ca ukuta. Mi bonse kale ba vumbigwa ko Moya go Kucena mi kale ba gamba ijwi lya Nyambe ko bundume.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">U bumi u bulotu bo bazumini</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />A bazumini bonse ka ba li bo mojo gonke no mugajalo gonke. Takuli uju ka gaja buti i bintu a munite mbyakwe genke bulyo, kono ka ba li taila i bintu byonse ka ba kwesi. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />A batumigwa ka ba zundamine uku paka ko nguzu inene byo mbuko jo Mfumu Jesu. Mi i cisemo ca Nyambe ka ci sebeza mwabo bonse ko nguzu <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />ta ka ku li uju ka bulite i cintu mukati kabo. Kakuli inako jonse aba ka ba kwesi u lugwa kampa a majugo ka ba ga gulisa, no ku leta a masheleñi aga ga zwa a bigulisantu <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />no ku ga wa ku batumigwa, mi ka ga tailwa ku muntu gense uju ka bulite.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Josefa, u Mulivi gwa mwilonga lya Sipela, uju ka ba kuganga a batumigwa izina lya Bbanabbasi (ku toloka “mwana ñongozo”), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />sa gulisa igwa ka kwesi no ku leta a masheleñi ku batumigwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiyasi no Safila</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Cwale nko ka li unkosi gwezina lya Ananiyasi no mukazi gwakwe Safila, nabo se ba gulisa igwa lyabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Ko ku zumininana no mukazi gwakwe kale ga li bikila a masheleñi gamwinya, no ku leta aga na ga sigalao ku batumigwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Pitolosi kale ga ta nage, “Ananiyasi, mbuti a la nginini Satani mu mojo gwako buti u ome u Moya go Kucena ko ku li bikila a masheleñi gamwinya na gwa gwana egwa? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Igwa na li sini uku gulisigwa ka li li lyako, mane naa se li la gulisigwa, a masheleñi galyo ta ka ga li gako? Ncinzi na ca leta buti u gaje uku tenda i cintu ca bulyao? Ntali muntu na gwa oma kono ndi Nyambe.”<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananiyasi aa shugwa bulyao, kale ga gwila ansi no ku fwa. A bantu bonse aba na ba shugwa ibi na bya tendaala, kale ba joga lwini. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Cwale a bankosana bamwinya kale ba keza no ku vunga i citupu cakwe no ku mu inda ka mu zika.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Aa se ku la iti inako imfuwi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Inako ka ji shaka uku kwana a maola go tatwe.</char></note> u mukazi gwakwe kale ga ngina, uku ta zekelele ici na ca tendaala. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Pitolosi kale ga mu buza nage, “Ngo ndi lugwile, buti jeji ne ngulo iji na mwa gulisa igwa igwe no Ananiyasi?” Safila kale ga ta nage, “Ee, ne ngulo jejo.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Pitolosi kale ga mu ta nage, “Ncinzi aa u la zumini uku jeleka u Moya go Mfumu Nyambe? Ngo tegeleze! A bankosana aba ba la ka ziki unkosi gwako mpa cizi ba li, mi kuti ba keze ku ku inda negwe bulyao!”<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Mwa jejo inako Safila kale ga gwila ansi no ku fwa. Cwale a bankosana kale ba ngina no keza ku gwana buti, ngwa ku fwa, kale ba mu inda no ka mu zikila ambali no nkosi gwakwe. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />A kagugi konse ko bazumini no bantu bonse aba na ba shugwa byebyo i bintu kale ba joga lwini.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">A batumigwa aa ba oza a bantu a bangi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />A batumigwa ka ba tenda i bijuliko i bingi no bintu bi komokwisa mukati ko bantu. Mi a bazumini bonse ka ba gwanananga antu-onke mu Malibela ga Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Takuli u muntu jumwinya uju ka gola uku jeleka uku gwanana nabo, jebo ka ba lumbigwa wawa ku bantu. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Nanganceciba bulyao, a bankosi no banakazi a bangi ka ba zumina ku Mfumu Jesu mi ka ba gwanikigwa ku mpalo jabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Mi ko ku tenda bulyao, a bantu ka ba leta a balwele mu mazila no ku ba lalika a malo no a mashasha buti nanga munzule bulyo gwa Pitolosi aa ita, gu gwile bamwinya babo. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />A bantu a bangi ka ba gwanananga na ba zwa mu minzi ka ji bambene no munzi gwa Jelusalema, na ba letanga a balwele babo no babo ka ba pengisigwa ku myoya iji ta ji cenete, mi bonse ka ba ozwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">A mapenzi go batumigwa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Cwale u mupulisiti u mukulu no bagenze, aba ka ba li bo kagugi ko Basaduki kale ba fwila a batumigwa u muna. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Kale ba shumina a batumigwa no ku ba tula mu ntolongo jo bantu a bangi. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Kono a masiku iñiloi lyo Mfumu kale lya galula i bizi byo ntolongo no ku ba zwisikiza anze mi kale lya ba ta na lyo, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Mu jende, mu ka zimane mu tumpetu to tempele, mi mu ka gambaguze a bantu bya bobu u bumi u buya bonse.”<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />A masiku-siku a batumigwa kale ba ka ngina mu tumpetu to tempele, ku ja ubu na ba telwa, mi kale ba tatika uku ziga a bantu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">U mupulisiti u mukulu no bagenze kale ba sika, mi kale ba kuga inkuta antu-onke no ngwanano jonse jo bakulu ba Isilaele no ku tuma a bantu ku ntolongo buti ba ka inde a batumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Kono aa ba ka sika a ntolongo, babo na ba tumigwa ta na ba ka gwana a batumigwa koko. Cwale kale ba bogola ka lugula nabo, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Tu la ka gwani intolongo na ji atitwe nenja mane no bamameli na ba zimene a bizi, kono aa se tu la bi galuli, ta tu la gwani u muntu mukati.”<verse eid="ACT 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />U mujendesi go bamameli bo tempele mane no mapulisiti a bakulu aa ba shugwa bulyao kale ba bula co ku tenda, bu komoketwe buti byebyo i bintu kwibo ka bi tungulwize. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Cwale u muntu jumwinya kale ga keza ku ta nage, “Nga mu lole! A bankosi aba na mwa tula mu ntolongo se ba li ka zimene mu tumpetu to tempele na ba ziga a bantu.”<verse eid="ACT 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Aa ba shugwa bulyao, u mukulu go bamameli no bagenze kale ba leta a batumigwa. Ta na ba ba indikiza, kakuli kame ka ba jogete buti a bantu mane ba ba sobagule ko mabwe. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />A batumigwa kale ba letigwa mukati buti ba bonaale a nkuta no ku buzaguligwa ku mupulisiti u mukulu. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Kale ga ta nage, “Na twa mi binda wawa buti mu leke uku ziga kame mwizina lya joju u muntu. Kono inzigo jenu se ji li vumbite u munzi gwa Jelusalema mi se mu li zundamine wawa buti tu gwane u mulandu go lufu lwa joju unkosi.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Pitolosi no batumigwa bamwinya kale ba taba nabo, “Tu li botele uku kutika Nyambe ku ita uku kutika a bantu! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Nyambe gu basukuzetu sa busa Jesu ku bafu, uju na mwa yaga ko ku mu kankamina a cifapaano. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Nyambe kale ga mu nanwina ku mulyo gweganja lyakwe buti a be u Mujendesi no Mujojesi izo a we a bantu ba Isilaele insiguluko no nkwatilo jo bitendantu i bimangoju byabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Iswe tu li bampaki ba byebi i bintu, mane no Moya go Kucena bulyao, ugu na ga wa Nyambe ku bantu aba ba mu kutika.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />A bakulu bo nkuta aa ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba nyegela mi kale ba shaka uku yaga a batumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Kono u Mufalisi gwezina lya Gamaliele, uju ka li muzigi go mulao, uju ka kutikigwa ku bantu bonse, kale ga zimana mu nkuta mi kale ga ta buti ba zwisikize a batumigwa anze mu nako imfuwi bulyo. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Cwale kale ga lugwila inkuta nage, “Mwe bankosi ba Isilaele mu mamele wawa ibi mu gaja uku tenda kwa baba a bankosi. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Mu majuba na ga mana se ku keza u muntu ka kugigwa Teudasi, uju ka litunta buti munene, mi ka kwesi a baumpilili ka ba sika a 400. Nage sa yagigwa, a baumpilili bakwe bonse kale ba mwagala. Byonse ibi ka tenda kale bya shwauka. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Mwishule lyakwe, mu nako jo cibalo co bantu kale kwa keza Judasi gwa kwa Galileya kale ga ba u mutangilili go bantu bo nkondo. Nage kale ga yagigwa, mi a baumpilili bakwe bonse kale ba mwagala.<verse eid="ACT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />“Cwale, mwa jeji intaba nda sa mi laga, mu leke baba a bankosi! Mu ba leke ba ka li jile! Kakuli ati u mugajalo gwabo kampa i bintu ba tenda nku bantu bi zwa, kuti na bi mane. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Kono ati nkwa Nyambe bi zwa nta na mu gole uku ba binda, kuti na mu li gwane mwebeni se mu lwisa Nyambe.”<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />I bintu ka gamba Gamaliele kale bya ba logwisa. Kale ba kugila a batumigwa mukati no ku ba shapa. Cwale kale ba ba lugwila buti na ba leke uku gamba mwizina lya Jesu, mi kale ba ba leka buti ba ka li jile.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />A batumigwa kale ba zwa mu nkuta bu jangele lwini kakuli ka ba baligwa buti ba li botele uku penga no ku fwiswa inshoni kebaka lyezina lya Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Mwijuba-mwijuba, mu tumpetu to tempele no mu majugo, a batumigwa ta ka ba leka uku ziga no ku lugula a majwi a malotu buti Jesu nde Mushaligwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Aa ku shaligwa a bankosi ba 7</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mwa gago a majuba impalo jo bazigigwa aa ka ji ja bu ngiya, kale kwa keza intongausi ku bazumini bo mushobo go Cigelike aba ka ba tongauka a bazumini bo mushobo go Ciebelu, kakuli a bamfwilwa babo ta ka ba tailwa nenja ku matuso ga mwijuba-mwijuba.<verse eid="ACT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />A batumigwa be kumi no bo bile kale ba gwanika a bazigigwa bonse no ku ta nabo, “Ta li mbobo iswe uku leka u musebezi gweejwi lya Nyambe no ku taa i bilyo a matafule. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Cwale bakwetu, mu shale a bankosi ba 7 mukati kenu aba ba zibaala buti ba li vumbite u Moya no magano. Kuti tu ba we gogu u musebezi <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />mi iswe tu twalikize ingana jetu ku matapelo no musebezi gweejwi.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />A bantu bonse kale ba jangala aa ba shugwa gogo u mugajalo. Kale ba shala Setefani, unkosi uju ka vumbite inzumino no Moya go Kucena, mane kale ba shala no Filipi, no Pulokolo, no Nikanole, no Timoni, no Pamena mane no Nikolasi uju ka zwa mu munzi gwa Antioki, uju ka zumine ku nzigo co Cijuda. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Kale ba leta baba a bankosi ku batumigwa, aba na ba ba lapelela no ku ba kambika a maganja gabo.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ijwi lya Nyambe kale lya janduluka. Impalo jo bazigigwa kale ja ngiya wangu mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, mi a mapulisiti a bangi se ka ba kutika inzumino.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Setefani aa shuminigwa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Cwale Setefani, unkosi uju ka vumbite i cisemo ca Nyambe no nguzu, ka tenda i bintu i binene bi komokwisa no bijuliko mukati ko bantu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Nanganceciba bulyao, kale kwa buka inkokani ku zwa ku bantu bo kagugi ko njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Injugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, ni njugo u mu ka ba gwananinanga a Majuda, ku bala a mabuka ga Mushe no ku kumbila i bintu kwa Nyambe. Mu Cigelike ka ba ji kuganga i cinagoge.</char></note> iji ka ji kugigwa jo Bankosi na ba lukululwa, a Majuda ka ba zwa mu minzi ja Silene no Alekizandiliya, mane no ba ku malonga ga Silisiya no Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Kono ta ka ba gola uku mu kananisa kakuli u Moya ka gu mu wa a magano aa ka kwesi uku gamba.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Kale ba shonga a bankosi bamwinya mu buzinda buti ba te izo, “Tu la shugwi Setefani na gamba a majwi go kashwau aga ga lwisa Mushe no Nyambe.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Cwale kale ba indikiza a bantu no bakulu no bazigi bo mulao. Kale ba kwata Setefani no ku mu leta a nkuta.<verse eid="ACT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Kale ba leta a bampaki bo manya, aba na ba paka buti, “Joju u muntu ta lekete uku gamba na lwisa ceci i cibaka ci cenete no mulao. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Kakuli na twa mu shugwa na ta buti, joju Jesu gwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta kuti na jone ceci i cibaka no ku cinca i mijojelo iji na ga tu wa Mushe.”<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Bonse aba ka ba kele mu nkuta kale ba conkokela Setefani, mi kale ba bona buti inkumo jakwe ka ji kozete je ñiloi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Setefani aa zekisigwa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Cwale u mupulisiti u mukulu kale ga buza Setefani nage, “Ibi i bintu ba ku shangeza mbyaconse?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Setefani kale ga taba nage, “Mwe bakwangu no ba tata, mu ndi tegeleze! Nyambe go mpazimo sa li bonaaza kwe setu Abbulaama aa ka sili mwilonga lya Mesopotamiya, na sini ka joja mwilonga lya Alani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Nyambe kale ga mu ta buti, ‘U zwe mwilonga lyako no ku bakwako, u ka je mwilonga na ndi ku sunde.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Matatikilo 12:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Cwale Abbulaama kale ga zwa mwilonga lyo Makalade no ka sumpa mwilonga lya Alani. Isi aa sa la fwi, Nyambe kale ga mu leta mwa le lino ilonga u mu mu joja inwe aano.<verse eid="ACT 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />“Nyambe ta na ga mu wa leli ilonga buti a li jobole, nanga ndivu aa li gola uku lyata itende lyakwe. Kono kame sa mu kuluwiza buti ige no bane no bewe kuti na ba mune ilonga uku ige sa la fwi, nanganceciba buti mwa jejo inako Abbulaama ka sini uku ba no mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Nyambe kale ga gamba kwakwe buti, ‘Bano no bewo kuti na ba be a banyenda mwilonga ili ta li li lyabo, mi kuti na ba ka be a baika no ku pengisigwa mu myaka ja 400.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Nyambe kale ga ta nage, ‘Kuti na ndi bangise a bantu ba lelyo ilonga u mu na ba ka sebeze ko ku ba a baika mi ku zwao kuti na ba zwe momo mwilonga no keza ku ndi lapela mo muno mu cibaka.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Matatikilo 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 15:14">14</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />“Cwale Nyambe kale ga wa inzumininano kwa Abbulaama jo mukanda. Mi Abbulaama kale ga ba isi gwa Isaka mi kale ga mu twala ku mukanda mwijuba lyo bu 8 ku zwa a ku bonigwa kwakwe. Ku zwao Isaka kale ga ba isi gwa Jakobo, mi Jakobo kale ga ba isi go maasi ge kumi no go bile go bana ba Isilaele.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Babo a bana ba Jakobo kale ba fwila Josefa u muna, kale ba mu gulisa buti aka be u muika mwilonga lya Egepita. Kono Nyambe ka kele nage <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />no ku mu lamwina mu makababu gakwe gonse. Kale ga wa Josefa a magano no ku mu golesa uku gwana u lushako lwa Falo u mfumu gwelonga lya Egepita. Cwale Falo kale ga mu wa u bujendesi bwelonga lya Egepita no munzi gwakwe gonse go bumfumu.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />“Cwale kale kwa ba no njala inene mwilonga lyonse lya Egepita no mwilonga lya Kanana, mi kale ja leta a mapenzi a manene, mi basukuzetu kale ba kangwa uku gwana i bilyo. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Cwale Jakobo aa shugwa buti mwa Egepita mo bu li u bweke, kale ga tumako basukuzetu mi ndolo ka lu li u lujendo lwabo lwetanzi. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Mu lujendo lwabo lwa bili, Josefa kale ga li zibaaza ku bakulwe, mi Falo kale ga ziba bo luasi lwa Josefa. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Bebyo aa se bi la mani, Josefa kale ga ba ta buti ba ka inde isi no luasi lwakwe lonse, mi ka ba sika a mpalo jo makumi ga 7 no 5 bonse. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Cwale Jakobo kale ga ja kwilonga lya Egepita, uku na ga ka fwila ige no basukuzetu. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />I bitupu byabo kale bya letigwa mwa Sikemi no ku zikigwa mu mabita aga sa gula Abbulaama ku bana ba Amoli gwa mwa Sikemi ko masheleñi.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Inako aa se ka ji ja bu senena buti Nyambe a vumbilize inkuluwizi jakwe kwa Abbulaama, impalo jo bantu betu mwa Egepita se ka ji ngiite wawa. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Cwale ‘u mfumu u muya, uju ta ka zekelele Josefa, kale ga tatika uku busa ilonga lya Egepita.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:8">Lujendo 1:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Kale ga talula a bakwetu no ku lyatilila basukuzetu ko ku ba indikiza buti ba showe a bacece babo buti ba li fwile.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />“Mwa jejo inako Mushe kale ga bonigwa, mi ka li mucece u mulotu. Bo luasi lwakwe kale ba mu babalela mu myezi jo tatwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabibele ga mwinya kame ga ta buti, “Ka li mucece u mulotu mu mensho ga Nyambe”. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Aa sa la zwisikizwa anze, mwana Falo go mukazana kale ga mu inda no ka mu lilelela sinagwe ndi mwane. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Mushe kale ga zigigwa a magano gonse go bantu ba Egepita mi ka kwesi inguzu mu ku gamba no mu bitendantu.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Mushe aa se ka kwesi i myaka jo makumi gone, kale ga gaja u ka potela a bakwakwe, a bantu ba Isilaele. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Kale ga bona jumwinya go bakwakwe na taluligwa ku Muegepita, cwale kale ga ka mu lamwina ko ku yaga u Muegepita. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Mushe kame ka gaja buti bakwakwe kuti ba nangule buti Nyambe kame ka mu litusisa mu ku ba lamwina, kono ta na ba nangula.<verse eid="ACT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />“Ijuba na lya nungako Mushe kale ga gwana a Maisilaele bo bile aba ka ba lwa. Kale ga jeleka uku ba shugwanisa ko ku ta buti, ‘Mwe bankosi, mu li bo luasi lonke, ncinzi aa mu shaka uku li kubaza mwalyenu?’<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />“Kono jojo unkosi uju ka kwesi uku talula jumwinya kale ga timbila Mushe kumbali no ku ta nage, ‘Ndini na ga ku shala buti u be u mujendesi no muatuli gwetu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Kame u gajite uku ndi yaga sinagwe ubu na gwa yagila u Muegepita ijona?’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Lujendo 2:14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Mushe aa shugwa bulyao, kale ga tiga ku zwa mwa Egepita no ka joja mwilonga lya Midiyani ko ku ba u muzwa-malonga mi kale ga ka ba no bana bo bile bo baninzana.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Aa na kwa mana i myaka jo makumi gone, iñiloi kale lya bonaala kwa Mushe mu ndimi jo mulilo ka gu jakila mu civuna mu mangusu afuwi ne Lundu lya Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Mushe aa bona bulyao, kale ga komokwa kwe ci na ga bona. Aa ka senenako buti a bonisise nenja, kale ga shugwa ijwi lyo Mfumu Nyambe li mu ta buti, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Ndime Nyambe gu basukuzo, Nyambe gwa Abbulaama no Isaka no Jakobo.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Lujendo 3:6</ref>.</char></note> Mushe kale ga tutuma ko bujoge mi ta na ga jeleka nanga nku lolako.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />“Cwale u Mfumu Nyambe kale ga mu ta buti, ‘Zula inshangu ku matende gako, kakuli ao a cibaka u zimene mpa kucena. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Na nda bona wawa a mapenzi go bantu bangu mwa Egepita. Na nda shugwa i citongo cabo mi ndi la sezumuki buti ndi ba lukulule. Cwale u keze, ndi ku tume kwa Egepita.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:5">Lujendo 3:5</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:8">8</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:10">10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Joju nde Mushe julya na ba kana ka gaga a majwi buti, ‘Ndini na ga ku shala buti u be u mujendesi no muatuli gwetu?’ Nyambe ige wawa kale ga mu tuma buti aka be u mujendesi no mulamwini gwabo, ko ku litusisa iñiloi ili na lya li bonaaza kwakwe mu civuna. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Mushe kale ga ba jendesa ku ba zwisa mwa Egepita mi kale ga tenda i bintu bi komokwisa no bijuliko mwa Egepita, Mwiwate lyo ku Subila mane no mu myaka jo makumi gone mu mangusu.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />“Kame a si li Mushe uju sa lugwila a bantu ba Isilaele buti, ‘Nyambe kuti na mi letele u muboni gwakwe go ku koza sinagwe ndime ku zwa mu mukoga gwenu.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Mulao 18:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Mushe kale ga gwanana no bantu ba Isilaele mu mangusu, mane ne ñiloi ili na lya gamba kwakwe Elundu lya Sinai, no basukuzetu, mi kale ga tambula a majwi ga joja no ku ga tu letela.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Kono basukuzetu kale ba kana uku kutika Mushe. Kale ba mu kana mi ka ba gajite mu myojo jabo uku bogola kwa Egepita. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Kale ba lugwila Aloni nabo, ‘U tu bumbile i bibumbantu byo bazimu buti bi tu tangilile. Kakuli ta tu zekelele ici na ca tendaala kwa Mushe uju na ga ka tu zwisa mwa Egepita!’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Lujendo 32:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Momo mu nako kale ba li bumbila i cibumbantu co ku koza sinagwe ni namani. Mi kale ba ci letela i bitagilo mi kale ba jangala kebaka lyo musebezi na ba tenda ko maganja gabo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Kono Nyambe kale ga ba futatila mi kale ga ba wa ijuba, u kwezi no ntungwezi byegulu buti ba bi lapele. Ko ku tenda bulyao kwa sa zumininana ne bi bi ñoletwe mwibuka lyo baboni ba Nyambe buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 7:42" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Se mu ndi letela i bitagilo no biwantu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">mu myaka jo makumi gone mu mangusu, <optbreak />inwe mwe bantu ba Isilaele?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Na mwa inda itente lya Muloke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">no lutungwezi lo muzimu gwenu Lefani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">i cibumbantu ici na mwa tenda buti mu ci lapele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Kuti na ndi mi twale mu ntigilo’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amosi 5:25-27</ref>. </char></note> kwisilya lya Bbabbilona.<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Basukuzetu ka ba kwesi Itente lyo nzumininano mu mangusu. Mushe kale ga li bapula ku ja ubu sa mu sundila Nyambe, ko mutendelo na ga bona. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Basukuzetu aa se ba la tambuli Itente, na ba jendesigwa kwa Joshuwa kale ba li inda no ku ja na lyo aa ka ba inda a malonga ku beni bago, aba na ga tanda Nyambe. Kale lya sigala momo mwilonga ku twala mu nako ja Deviti.<verse eid="ACT 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />“Deviti kale ga likola i cisemo ca Nyambe mi kale ga kumbila buti a jakile Nyambe gwa Jakobo injugo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Kono ndi Solomoni sa ji mu jakila. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Nanganceciba bulyao, Nyambe Sakapanga, ta ka li mu majugo na ba jaka a bantu. Sinagwe ubu sa co u muboni gwa Nyambe buti,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Igulu ncikalo cangu co bumfumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">mi ilonga nga malyatilo go matende gangu.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">U Mfumu Nyambe ga sa ta buti, ‘Ni njugo ja buti na mu <optbreak />ndi jakile?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Kampa i cibaka co mawisikizo gangu nkwibo na ci kalile?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ntali ndi ganja lyangu na lya bumba i bintu byonse byebi?’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Isaya 66:1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Inwe mwe bantu bo ciulu! Mwe bantu ta na mwa lagigwa. Mu li bo ku koza basukuzenu, mwa sa kanina u Moya go Kucena inako jonse! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Muboni jwibo gwa Nyambe uju ta na ba pengisa basukuzenu? Se ba yaga mane no babo ka ba gamba byo keza ko Muika uju a Lulikile. Mi aano na mwa mu legeza no ku mu yaga. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Ndinwe na mwa tambula u mulao ugu na gwa wegwa ko mañiloi kono ta na mwa gu kutika.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aa ba sobagula Setefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />A bantu bo nkuta aa ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba nyegela no ku kweka a meno gabo aa ka ba lolelele Setefani. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Kono Setefani, ka vumbite u Moya go Kucena, mi kale ga ligamina kwigulu, kale ga bona impazimo ja Nyambe, no Jesu na zimene kwiganja lyo mulyo lya Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Mi kale ga ba ta nage, “Nga mu lole, ndi liwene igulu li galukite no Mwana Muntu a zimene ku mulyo gweganja lya Nyambe.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Cwale kale ba fwinka a matwi gabo, mi kale ba mu tigilila bu kumbagana lwini, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />kale ba mu kokela kunze jo munzi no ku tatika uku mu sobagula ko mabwe. A bampaki kale ba lalika i bijabalo byabo ku matende go nkosana ka kugigwa Saule.<figure style="fig" alt="Stephen is stoned to death" file="cn02154b.jpg" size="span" loc="Act 7:54-60" ref="7:54-60">Setefani aa sobaguligwa ko mabwe</figure><verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Aa ka ba si mu sobagula, Setefani kale ga lapela nage, “Mfumwangu Jesu, u tambule u moya gwangu.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Kale ga tongama mi kale ga kumba nage, “Mfumwangu Jesu, u ba kwatile ceci i citendantu i cimangoju.” Aa sa la gambi bulyao, kale ga gwila ansi no ku fwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Mi Saule na ga zuminina aa na ba yaga Setefani.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">A mapenzi go bantu ka ba zumine kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 8:1">Ku zwa lelyo ijuba kale kwa ba no mapenzi a manene ku bantu ka ba zumine kwa Jesu mu munzi gwa Jelusalema. A bazumini bonse kale ba mwagala ku mwagalila mu minzi ja Judeya no Samaliya mi kale kwa sigala bulyo a batumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />A bankosi aba ka ba zumine kwa Nyambe kale ba ka zika Setefani no ku mu lila lwini. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Kono Saule kale ga tatika uku jona a kagugi ko bazumini. Na ja bu ngina mu majugo gonse, na kokela a bankosi no banakazi mu ntolongo.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipi aa tandaza mwa Samaliya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Babo a bazumini na ba mwagala kale ba ja bu tandaza ijwi konse uku ka ba ja. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipi kale ga ja mu munzi gwa Samaliya ka lugula byo Mushaligwa momo. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />A bantu a bangi aa ba shugwa Filipi no ku bona i bijuliko ka tenda, kale ba tegeleza wawa kwe bi ka gamba. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Kakuli i myoya iji ta ji cenete ka ji zwa ku bantu a bangi na ji kumba, mi a bantu a bangi bo ku golomena kampa aba ta ka ba jenda ka ba ozwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Mi kale kwa ba no ku jangala u kunene mu munzi gwa Samaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bya Simoni go mabibo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Cwale mu nako jimwinya nko ka li unkosi ka kugigwa Simoni uju ka tendanga a mabibo mu munzi mi ka komokwisanga a bantu a bangi ba Samaliya. Ka litunta buti ka li muntu u munene, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />a bantu bonse, aba ba kutikigwa no bashwauki, ka ba mu tegeleza no ku komokwa nabo, “Joju unkosi ga sa kugigwa nenja Inguzu Inene ja Nyambe.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Se ka ba mu zumine kakuli na ga ba komokwisa a nako inde ko mabibo gakwe.<verse eid="ACT 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Kono aa se ba la zumini kwa Filipi aa ka kwesi uku lugula byo majwi a malotu go mubuso gwa Nyambe mane ne zina lya Jesu Kilesite, a bankosi no banakazi bonse kale ba kolobezigwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simoni kale ga zumina nage mi kale ga kolobezigwa. Mi kale ga umpilila Filipi konse uku ka ja, mi ka komokwiswa ku bijuliko i binene no mamakazo ka bona.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />A batumigwa mwa Jelusalema aa ba shugwa buti a bantu ba mu munzi gwa Samaliya na ba tambula ijwi lya Nyambe, kale ba tumako ba Pitolosi no Joani. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Aa se ba la ka siki koko, kale ba ka lapelela a bazumini a baya buti ba tambule u Moya go Kucena, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />kakuli u Moya go Kucena ka gu sini uku ngina ku muntu nanga genke gwabo, mbulyo na ba kolobezigwa mwizina lyo Mfumu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Cwale ba Pitolosi no Joani kale ba ba tula a maganja gabo a mitwi, mi kale ba tambula u Moya go Kucena.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simoni aa bona buti u Moya go Kucena ka gu wegwa ku bazumini a batumigwa aa ba ba kambika a maganja gabo, kale ga ba sunda a masheleñi <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />mi kale ga ta nage, “Mu ndi we neme kwa jejo inguzu buti u muntu gense na ndi kambike a maganja gangu na tambule u Moya go Kucena.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Kono Pitolosi kale ga taba buti, “U fwe no masheleñi gako, kakuli kame ko gaja buti u la gola uku gula impo ja Nyambe ko masheleñi! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />To kwesi u lubazu kampa co ku wegwa mwa gogu u musebezi, kakuli u mojo gwako ta gu lulikile kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />U siguluke kebaka lya bobu u bubi mi u lapele ku Mfumu Nyambe no sepete buti bunga kuti a ku kwatile ko ku ba no gogu u mugajalo gwa bulyao mu mojo gwako. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Kakuli ndi liwene buti u muna gwako mubi wawa mi mu mpambo jo bitendantu i bimangoju u li.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Cwale Simoni kale ga taba nage, “Mu ndi lapelele ku Mfumu Jesu buti na ku leke uku tendaala i cintu nanga conke kwangu ku bintu mu la gambi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Ba Pitolosi no Joani aa se ba la mani uku gamba ijwi lya Nyambe mu bunokele no ku paka bya Jesu, kale ba bogola kwa Jelusalema, na ba ja bu tandaza a majwi a malotu mu minzi i mingi jo Masamaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipi no nduna gwa kwilonga lya Isopiya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Cwale iñiloi lyo Mfumu Nyambe kale lya ta Filipi na lyo, “U je ku mbogela ku nzila jo mangusu iji ji zwa kwa Jelusalema ku ja kwa Gaza.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Cwale Filipi kale ga funduka, mi mu nzila kale ga li gwana no nduna go nkosi, u mubabaleli go butokwa go lubono lwa Kandase (ku toloka “u mfumu go mwanakazi go bantu belonga lya Isopiya”). Joju unkosi nkwa Jelusalema na ga ja ku ku lapela, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />mi se ka bogola ku munzi gwakwe bu kele mu cikocikala cakwe na bala ibuka lyo muboni gwa Nyambe Isaya.<figure style="fig" alt="Philip meets the Ethiopian eunuch" file="wa03956b.jpg" size="span" loc="Act 8:26-30" ref="8:26-30">Filipi no nkosi gwa kwa Isopiya</figure><verse eid="ACT 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />U Moya kale gwa lugwila Filipi nago, “U jende kwa ce cilya i cikocikala mi u ka jendele afuwi naco.”<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Cwale Filipi kale ga tigilila ku cikocikala mi kale ga shugwa jojo nkosi na bala mwibuka lyo muboni gwa Nyambe Isaya. Mi Filipi kale ga buza nage, “U la shugwilisa ibi u bala?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Jojo unkosi kale ga ta nage, “Mbuti ndi gola uku bi shugwilisa uku takuli u muntu uju a bi ndi tansulwila?” Cwale kale ga kumbila Filipi buti a longame mu cikocikala no ku kala nage.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Iñolo ka bala jojo unduna mbuti ka li ñolelwe buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 8:32" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Na ga jendesigwa sinagwe ningu ji twaligwa ku ku yagigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">mi kale ga ombelela sinagwe ni ngu-gana ji li afuwi no mukululi gwajo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">cwale takuli ici na ga gamba.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Kale ga shwaukiswa mi intaba jakwe ta na ja atuligwa nenja.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ndini a gola uku gamba byo bane no bewe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Kakuli u bumi bwakwe na bwa zwisigwa mwilonga.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Isaya 53:7-8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Jojo unduna kale ga buza Filipi nage, “Ngo ndi lugwile, ndini a tegwa kwa joju u muboni gwa Nyambe, ndege a li ta gemwini kampa muntu jumwinya a ta?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Cwale Filipi kale ga tatika ka lelyo Iñolo mi kale ga mu lugwila a majwi a malotu ga Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Aa ka ba jenda bulyao mu nzila, kale ba sika aa ka kuli a menzi mi jojo unduna kale ga ta nage, “Ngolole, aga nga menzi. Ncinzi ci gola uku ndi kangwisa uku kolobezigwa?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipi kale ga mu ta nage, “Aa u zumina ko mojo gwako gonse, u la gola uku kolobezigwa.” Ige kale ga taba nage, “Ndi la zumina buti Jesu ndi Mwana Nyambe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 37.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Mi kale ga zimika i cikocikala. Cwale Filipi no jojo unduna kale ba sezumukila mu menzi mi Filipi kale ga mu kolobeza.<verse eid="ACT 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Aa se ba la zwi mu menzi, u Moya go Kucena go Mfumu Nyambe aobulyo kale gwa inda Filipi, mi jojo unduna ta na ga mu bona kame, kono kale ga ka li jila mu nzila bu jangele. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Nanganceciba bulyao, Filipi, kale ga ka li gwana mu munzi gwa Azoto. Kale ga ja bu tandaza a majwi a malotu mu minzi jonse mane na ka sika mu munzi gwa Sesaleya.<figure style="fig" file="SHJ_185wbt - Philips Travels [sm-bwf].indd" size="span" ref="8:4-40" /><verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Insiguluko ja Saule</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Saule ka si zundamine uku li kanya uku yaga a bazigigwa bo Mfumu Jesu. Kale ga ja ku mupulisiti u mukulu <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />kale ga ka mu kumbila a mañolo ga mu zuminina uku ja ku majugo go malapelelo go Majuda mu munzi gwa Damaseka, buti ati na gwana a bankosi kampa a banakazi aba ba umpilila i Nzila jo Mfumu Jesu, aba inde bu shuminwe no ku ba twala kwa Jelusalema.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Aa ka li mu nzila na kokelele u munzi gwa Damaseka, aobulyo ituba ka li zwa kwigulu kale lya mu besekeza ao ka jendela. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Kale ga gwila ansi mi kale ga shugwa ijwi li mu ta buti, “Saule, Saule, ncinzi u ndi pengisiza?”<figure style="fig" alt="Paul on the Damascus Road" file="cn02023b.jpg" size="span" loc="Act 9:1-7" ref="9:1-7">Paulusi mu nzila ji ja kwa Damaseka</figure><verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Saule kale ga buza nage, “Ndigweni, Mfumwangu?” Kale ga taba nage, “Ndime Jesu, uju u kwesi uku pengisa.”<verse eid="ACT 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />“Cwale zimana u je mu munzi, mi kuti u ka gambaguzwe ibi u botele uku tenda.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />A bankosi ka ba jenda no Saule kale ba zimana ao bu bulite co ku gamba, na ba shugwa ijwi kono ta na ba bona u muntu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Saule kale ga zimana, kono aa sa kasula a mensho gakwe kale ga kangwa uku bona. Cwale kale ba mu kwata kwiganja no ku mu twala mwa Damaseka. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Mu majuba go tatwe kale ga ba u muofu, mi ta na ga lya kampa uku nywa cimwinya.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Mwa Damaseka mo ka li u muzigigwa gwezina lya Ananiyasi. U Mfumu Jesu kale ga mu kuga mu cibonwa nage, “Ananiyasi!” Ige kale ga taba nage, “Ime juno Mfumwangu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />U Mfumu Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U jende ku njugo ja Judasi mu Nzila ji Golokete mi u ka buze unkosi a zwa ku munzi gwa Talese gwezina lya Saule, kakuli a li kwesi uku lapela. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Mu cibonwa na ga bona unkosi gwezina lya Ananiyasi a keza ku mu tula a maganja gakwe buti a bone kame.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananiyasi kale ga taba nage, “Mfumwangu, na nda shugwa a maluguzi a mangi ga joju unkosi no bintu i bibi byonse ibi na ga tenda ku bazumini bako mwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Mi na ga keza ko kuno no nzuminino ji zwa ku mapulisiti a bakulu buti a keze a shumine u muntu gense uju a kuga ezina lyako.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Kono u Mfumu Jesu kale ga ta Ananiyasi nage, “U jende bulyo! Joju unkosi na nda mu shala buti a be i cibelekiso cangu mu ku lugula izina lyangu ku bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda no ku ba mfumwabo mane no ku bantu ba Isilaele. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Mi ime kuti na ndi mu sundise ubu a botele uku pengela kebaka lyezina lyangu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Cwale Ananiyasi kale ga ja ku njugo no ka nginamo. Kale ga tula a maganja gakwe a Saule, mi kale ga ka ta nage, “Saule mukwangu, u Mfumu Jesu, uju na ga bonaala kwako mu nzila aa ko keza ko kuno, a la ka ndi tumi buti u bone kame mi u vumbigwe ko Moya go Kucena.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Aobulyo i bintu byo ku koza a majaju kale bya zwa mu mensho ga Saule mi kale ga gola uku bona kame. Kale ga zimana mi kale ga kolobezigwa, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />mi aa sa la mani uku lya i bilyo, kale ga ba no nguzu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Saule mu munzi gwa Damaseka</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 9:19">Saule kale ga kala no bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Damaseka mu majuba a mace bulyo. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Aobulyo Saule kale ga tatika uku tandaza mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda buti Jesu ndi Mwana Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Bonse aba ka ba mu shugwa ka ba komokwa no ku buza nabo, “Uju nkosi ta li ndege ka leta a mapenzi mwa Jelusalema mukati ka babo a bantu ba kuga a leli izina? Mi ta li kame na ga keza ko kuno ku ku shumina a bantu no ku ba twala ku mapulisiti a bakulu?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Kono Saule kale ga gongolekeza uku tandaza buti Jesu nde Mushaligwa mi ka zieza a Majuda aba ka ba joja mu munzi gwa Damaseka. <verse eid="ACT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Mwishule lyo majuba a mangi, a Majuda kale ba gwanana mu buzinda buti ba yage Saule. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Kono Saule kale ga ziba u mugajalo gwabo. A kamwi no masiku ka ba mamela wawa ku bizi byo munzi buti ba mu yage. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Kono a masiku a baumpilili bakwe kale ba mu inda no ku mu tula mu citundu no ku mu itikiza mu kaito mwimota lyo lubaga.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Saule aa sa la ka siki mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, kale ga ka jeleka uku gwanana no bazigigwa, kono bonse ka ba mu jogete, mi ta ka ba zumina buti ka li muzigigwa wawa. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Kono Bbanabbasi kale ga mu inda no ku mu twala ku batumigwa. Kale ga ba gambaguza Saule ubu na ga bonena u Mfumu Jesu mu lujendo lwakwe no Mfumu Jesu ubu na ga gambila kwakwe, mane no bu na ga tandazila mwizina lya Jesu ko bundume mu munzi gwa Damaseka.<verse eid="ACT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Cwale Saule kale ga kala nabo no ku li jenda-jendela mwa Jelusalema bu bugukite, na gamba ko bundume mwizina lyo Mfumu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Ka gambagulanga no ku li buzagula no Majuda aba se ka ba gamba u mushobo go Cigelike, kono abo kale ba jeleka uku mu yaga. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />A bazumini aa se ba la zibi bulyao, kale ba mu twala ku munzi gwa Sesaleya buti a ka je ku munzi gwa Talese.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Cwale a kagugi ko bazumini mwilonga lyonse lya Judeya, mwa Galileya no Samaliya ka ba likola inako jo ku joja nenja mi ka ba gongozwa. Ka ba joja bu jogete Nyambe no ku gongozwa ko Moya go Kucena, mi impalo jo bazumini ka ji ngiya.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bya Eneya no Dokasi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Pitolosi aa ka ja bu jenda mwilonga, kale ga ka ja no ka potela a bazumini bo Mfumu Jesu aba ka ba joja mu munzi gwa Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Momo mu munzi kale ga ka gwanamo unkosi gwezina lya Eneya, uju se ka indite i myaka ja 8 na lele a bulo kebaka lyo ku golomena u mubili. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Pitolosi kale ga mu ta buti, “Eneya, Jesu Kilesite a ku oze. Zimana u vunge ishasha lyako.” Aobulyo Eneya kale ga zimana. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />A bantu bonse aba ka ba joja mu munzi gwa Lida no mu munzi gwa Shaloni kale ba mu bona mi kale ba sigulukila ku Mfumu Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Mu munzi gwa Jopa mo ka li u muzigigwa go mwanakazi gwezina lya Tabita (mu Cigelike ka kugigwa Dokasi). U bungi bo nako ka tenda nenja no ku tusa a bampale. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Momo mu majuba, kale ga lwala mi kale ga fwa, i citupu cakwe kale ca sanzigwa no ka ci tula mu kampetu ka egulu lyo njugo. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />U munzi gwa Lida ka gu li afuwi no munzi gwa Jopa, mi a bazigigwa aa ba shugwa buti Pitolosi mu munzi gwa Lida ka li, kale ba tumako a bankosi bo bile mi kale ba ka mu kumbila nabo, “Ndokweni neswe aano!”<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Pitolosi kale ga ka ja nabo, mi aa ka sika kale ba mu twala ku kampetu ka egulu lyo njugo. A bamfwilwa bonse kale ba tula Pitolosi mukati, na ba lila no ku mu sunda i mikanjo no bizwato bimwinya ibi ka ba suminanga Dokasi aa ka si kele nabo. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Pitolosi kale ga ba ta buti ba anine anze mi kale ga tongama no ku lapela. Kale ga zokela ku citupu, mi kale ga ta nage, “Tabita, buka.” Kale ga tonda, mi aa sa la boni Pitolosi kale ga kala. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Pitolosi kale ga mu kwata kwiganja no ku mu zimika. Kale ga kuga a bazumini, cifwe-cifwe a bamfwilwa no ku mu leta kwabo na joja.<verse eid="ACT 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />A bantu bonse ba mu munzi gwa Jopa kale ba shugwa jejo intaba, mi a bantu a bangi kale ba zumina ku Mfumu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Pitolosi kale ga kala mwa Jopa a majuba a mangi na kele no Simoni uju ka li musuki go mikumba.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Konele aa kuga Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Mu munzi gwa Sesaleya, mo ka li unkosi ka kugigwa Konele, ka li mujendesi go masole bo kagugi ka ka kugigwa Italiya. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Konele no luasi lwakwe lonse ka ba kutika no ku joga Nyambe. Kakuli ka tusanga a bampale lwini no ku lapela kwa Nyambe inako jonse. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ijuba limwinya a kamwi ko nako jo ma 15, kale ga bona i cibonwa. Kale ga bona nenja iñiloi lya Nyambe, ili na lya keza kwakwe no ku mu ta buti, “Konele!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Konele kale ga lolelela lelyo iñiloi bu jogete. Mi kale ga li buza nage, “Ncinzi Mfumwangu?” Iñiloi kale lya taba na lyo, “Nyambe na ga tambula a matapelo no mampo gako u kwesi uku wa bampale. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Cwale u tume a bankosi ku munzi gwa Jopa ba ka kuge unkosi a kugigwa Simoni Pitolosi. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Nkwa Simoni a kele u musuki go mikumba, injugo jakwe nku mbali je wate ji li.”<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Iñiloi ili ka li kwesi uku gambagula nage aa se li la ka ji, Konele kale ga kuga bo bile ku baika bakwe no musole uju ka sepaala uju ka li jumwinya go babeleki bakwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Kale ga ba gambaguza i bintu byonse ibi na bya tendaala mi kale ga ba tuma kwa Jopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">I cibonwa ca Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Mwijuba ili na lya nungako a kamwi aa ka ba li mu lujendo lwabo mi na ba kokelele u munzi gwa Jopa, Pitolosi kale ga lija a cituwa co njugo ka lapela. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Pitolosi kale ga fwa injala mi se ka shaka i cilyo, mi i bilyo aa ka bi si tendigwa, kale ga bona i cibonwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Kale ga bona igulu li galukite no cintu ka ci bonaala sinagwe ndi sila inene ka li nungitwe mu mbazu jone li susikizwa ansi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mukati mbipagu bi andene-andene byo matende gone ka bi limo, mane no bikokobi no bijuni. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Mi ijwi kale lya mu lugwila buti, “Zimana, Pitolosi. U yage mi u lye.”<figure style="fig" alt="The vision on Peter" file="wa03963b.jpg" size="col" loc="Act 10:9-16" ref="10:9-16">I cibonwa ca Pitolosi</figure><verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Pitolosi kale ga taba nage, “Inga, Mfumwangu! Ta nda la lya i cintu conse ici ta ci cenete kampa ce tukuta.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Ijwi kale lya mu ta lyabili buti, “U leke ku kuga i cintu conse buti ta ci cenete ici na ga cenesa Nyambe.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Ceci kale ca tendaala ko tatwe, mi aobulyo isila kale lya indigwa ku bogozwa kwigulu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Pitolosi aa ka si komoketwe ibi ka ci toloka i cibonwa, a bankosi aba na ga tuma Konele kale ba ziba injugo u mu ka li Simoni mi kale ba zimana a cizi. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Kale ba buza nabo, “Buti mwa li mo muno Simoni uju a zibaala buti ndi Pitolosi?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Pitolosi aa ka si gaja byo cibonwa, u Moya kale gwa mu ta nago, “Pitolosi, mbankosi bo tatwe ba ku shaka. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Cwale u zimane u ane mu njugo. U leke uku sita-sita u ka ja nabo, kakuli ndime ndi la ba tumi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Pitolosi kale ga ba jila mi kale ga ba ta buti, “Ndime mu shaka. Mbinzi mu la kezeli?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Babo a bankosi kale ba taba nabo, “Ndi Konele u mujendesi go masole a la ka tu tumi. Ali lulikile mi muntu a jogete Nyambe, mi a la kutikigwa ku Majuda bonse. Iñiloi lyo kucena li la mu lugwili buti a ku kumbile uku ja ku njugo jakwe buti a gole u ka shugwa ibi u botele uku gamba.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Pitolosi kale ga ba kugila mu njugo buti ba be a banyenda bakwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Ijuba na lya nungako, Pitolosi kale ga funduka nabo, mi a bazumini bamwinya ba mwa Jopa kale ba ka ja nage.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Mwijuba ili na lya nungako kale ga ka sika mwa Sesaleya. Konele ka ba shiamine mi se ka kugite a bakwakwe antu-onke no basele bakwe wawa. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Pitolosi aa ngina mu njugo, Konele kale ga li gwana nage mi kale ga gwila ku matende gakwe no ku li gombaaza gemwini. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Kono Pitolosi kale ga mu zimika. Mi kale ga mu ta buti, “Neme ndi li muntu bulyo.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Aa ka si gamba nage, Pitolosi kale ga ngina mu njugo mi kale ga ka gwana a bantu a bangi ba gwanene.<verse eid="ACT 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Kale ga ba ta buti, “Mu li zekelele nenja buti ncintu ci lwisa u mulao gwetu u Mujuda aa gwanana kampa aa potela u muntu uju ta li u Mujuda. Kono Nyambe na ga ndi bonisa buti ta ndi botele uku kuga u muntu gense buti ta cenete kampa ngwe tukuta. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Cwale aa ndi la ka kugigwa, ndi la kezi mi takuli ici ndi la gambi mi ta ndi la kani. Kame ndi shaka uku ziba ibi ka mu ndi kugila.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Konele kale ga taba nage, “Se ku li itite a majuba gone ku zwa aa ka ndi lapela mu njugo jangu ko nako je jino jo kamwi. Aobulyo unkosi uju ka zwesi i bizwato byo ku tuba lwini kale ga keza ku zimana afuwi neme <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />mi kale ga ndi ta buti, ‘Konele, Nyambe na ga shugwa a matapelo gako no ku vuluka a mampo u kwesi uku wa ku bampale. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />U tume a bantu ku munzi gwa Jopa ba ka kuge unkosi a kugigwa Simoni Pitolosi. Nu nyenda uju a li mu njugo ja Simoni u musuki go mikumba, uju a joja kumbali je wate.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Mpaa na nda ku tumina a bantu wangu, mi u la tendi nenja aa u la kezi. Cwale twense mo tu li mo muno mi mpafuwi no Nyambe tu li buti tu tegeleze ku bintu byonse ibi na ga ku lugwila u Mfumu Jesu buti u bi tu gambaguze.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ijwi lya Nyambe ku bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Cwale Pitolosi kale ga tatika uku gamba nage, “Aano kale nda nangula buti mbyaconse Nyambe ta bonisi u mushalo <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />kono mwilonga nelonga ga sa tambula u muntu uju a mu jogete no ku tenda i bintu bi lulikile. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Mu li zi a majwi aga sa tuma Nyambe ku bantu ba Isilaele, ku ba lugwila a majwi a malotu go ku joja nenja ka Jesu Kilesite, uju a li Mfumu go bantu bonse. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mu li zi ne bi na bya tendaala mwilonga lyonse lya Judeya, ku tatikila mwilonga lya Galileya mwishule lyo nkolobezo iji na ga tandaza Joani. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Ubu sa wela Nyambe u Moya go Kucena ne nguzu kwa Jesu gwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta, no bu ka ja bu tendela nenja no ku oza a bantu bonse aba ka ba li mu nguzu ja Satani, kakuli Nyambe ka kele nage.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />“Iswe tu li bampaki bo bintu byonse ibi sa tenda mwilonga lyo Majuda no mu munzi gwa Jelusalema. Kale ba mu yaga ko ku mu kankamina a cifapaano, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />kono Nyambe kale ga mu busa ku bafu mwijuba lya tatu no ku mu bonaaza. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ntali mbantu bonse na ba mu bona, kono aba na ba mu bona ndiswe twe bampaki aba sa shala Nyambe, iswe na twa lya no ku nywa nage uku sa la buki ku zwa ku bafu. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Sa tu lugwila buti tu tandaze a bantu no ku paka buti ndege sa shaligwa kwa Nyambe ko ku ba u muatuli go bantu a bomi no bafu. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />A baboni ba Nyambe bonse na ba paka byakwe buti u muntu gense uju a zumina kwakwe kuti na kwatilwe i bitendantu i bimangoju kezina lyakwe.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">A bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda aa ba tambula <optbreak />u Moya go Kucena</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Pitolosi aa ka si kwesi uku gambagula gago a majwi, u Moya go Kucena kale gwa keza a bantu bonse aba na ba shugwa a majwi. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />A bazumini bo Majuda aba na ba keza no Pitolosi kale ba komokwa aa ba bona impo jo Moya go Kucena buti ja sa sintilwa nanga mpa bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Kakuli na ba ba shugwa na ba gamba mu ndimi jimwinya na ba lumbeka Nyambe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Cwale Pitolosi kale ga ta nage, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Mbyaconse takuli uju a gola uku ba kangwisa uku kolobezigwe ko menzi. Kakuli nabo ba la tambuli u Moya go Kucena sinagwe ubu na twa gu tambwila neswe.” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Cwale Pitolosi kale ga ta buti ba kolobezigwe mwizina lya Jesu Kilesite. Mi kale ba kumbila Pitolosi buti a kale nabo a majuba a mace.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">A Majuda aa ba shwaaguza Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />A batumigwa no bazumini aba ka ba joja mwilonga lyonse lya Judeya kale ba shugwa buti a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda na ba tambula ijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Mi Pitolosi aa sa la ji kwa Jelusalema, a bazumini aba na ba ja ku mukanda kale ba mu shwaaguza <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />kale ba mu ta nabo, “Na gwa ja no ka ngina mu njugo jo bantu aba ta na ba ja ku mukanda no ka lya nabo.”<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Pitolosi kale ga tatika uku ba lugwila i bintu byonse ku tatikila ku matatikilo nage, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Aa ka ndi li mu munzi gwa Jopa na ndi lapela, kale nda bona i cibonwa. Kale nda bona i cintu co ku koza sinagwe ndi sila inene ili ka li susikizwa ansi ku zwa kwigulu bu nungitwe mu mbazu jone ja lyo keza aa ka ndi kele. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Kale nda lolamo mi kale nda bona i bipagu bya ansi byo matende gone, i bikolo-kolo, i bikokobi no bijuni. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Kale nda shugwa ijwi li ndi ta buti, ‘Pitolosi, zimana. U yage mi u lye.’<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />“Kale nda taba neme, ‘Inga, Mfumwangu! Takuli i cintu ta ci cenete kampa ce tukuta ici ca la ngina mu kanwa kangu.’<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />“Kono ijwi kale lya ndi ta lyabili na lyo, ‘U leke ku kuga i cintu conse buti ncetukuta ici na ga cenesa Nyambe.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Ceci i cintu kale ca tendaala ko tatwe, mi kale ca kokelwa kwigulu kame.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />“Mwa jejo inako a bankosi bo tatwe aba na ba tumigwa kwangu aba ka ba zwa ku munzi gwa Sesaleya kale ba keza ku zimana a njugo u mu ka ndi kala. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />U Moya kale gwa ndi ta buti ndi leke uku sita-sita u ka ja nabo. Babo a bakwangu ba 6 kale ba ndi bandika, mi kale twa ka ngina mu njugo ja Konele. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Konele kale ga tu lugwila ubu na ga bonena iñiloi mu njugo jakwe ili na lya mu ta buti, ‘U tume a bantu ku munzi gwa Jopa buti ba ka kuge unkosi uju a kugigwa Simoni Pitolosi. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Kuti na ku gambaguze a majwi aga na ga ku jojese igwe no luasi lwako lonse.’<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />“Mi aa ndi tatika uku gamba, kale ba tambula u Moya go Kucena sinagwe ubu na twa gu tambwila neswe ku matatikilo. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Cwale kale nda vuluka ubu sa tu tela u Mfumu Jesu buti, ‘Joani ka kolobeza ko menzi, kono inwe kuti na mu kolobezigwe ko Moya go Kucena.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Mi ati Nyambe na ga ba wa nabo impo jonke iji sa tu wa neswe, iswe na twa zumina ku Mfumu Jesu Kilesite, cwale ime ndimeni buti ndi kangwise Nyambe?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Aa ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba bula co ku gamba mi kale ba lumba Nyambe nabo, “Wawa Nyambe na ga wa insiguluko iji ji twala ku bumi ku bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba Bbanabbasi no Saule mu munzi gwa Antioki</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Babo a bantu na ba mwagala kebaka lyo mapenzi aga na ga bako mwishule lyo ku yagigwa kwa Setefani kale ba jenda mane na ba ka sika ku malonga ga Fonisiya, Sipela no mwa Antioki, na ba ja bu gamba ijwi ku Majuda bulyo. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Nanganceciba bulyao, bamwinya babo, a bankosi aba ka ba zwa kwa Sipela no kwilonga lya Silene, kale ba ja kwa Antioki no ka ziga a Magelike, ku ba lugwila a majwi a malotu go Mfumu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Inguzu jo Mfumu Nyambe ka ji li kwabo, mi a bantu a bangi kale ba zumina no ku sigulukila ku Mfumu Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Jeji i ñambagulo kale ja ka sika ku kagugi ko bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, mi kale ba tuma Bbanabbasi kwa Antioki. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Aa ka sika mwa Antioki, kale ga ka bona ubu na ga wela Nyambe i cisemo ku bazumini, kale ga jangala no ku ba gongoza bonse buti ba zundamine uku ba no niti ku Mfumu Jesu ko myojo jabo jonse. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Bbanabbasi ka li nkosi ka kele nenja, uju ka vumbite u Moya go Kucena no nzumino, mi a bantu a bangi wawa ka ba letigwa ku Mfumu Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Cwale Bbanabbasi kale ga ja kwa Talese ka shaka Saule, <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />aa sa la ka mu gwani, kale ga mu leta kwa Antioki. Mi u mwaka mukatumbi Bbanabbasi no Saule kale ba kala no kagugi ko bazumini no ku ziga a bantu a bangi wawa. A bazigigwa kale ba tatika uku kugigwa buti mba Kilesite mu munzi gwa Antioki.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Momo mu nako a baboni ba Nyambe bamwinya kale ba zwa mu munzi gwa Jelusalema no ku ja mwa Antioki. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Jumwinya gwabo uju ka kugigwa Agabbusi, kale ga zimana mi kale ga gamba ko Moya mu buboni buti kuti na ku be no njala inene mwilonga lyonse lyo Maloma. (Mi byebi kale bya tendaala mu nako ka busa u mfumu go Maloma Kilaude.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />A bazumini bonse ko bu ka ba golela, kale ba zumininana uku tusa a bazumini ka ba joja mwilonga lya Judeya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Kale ba tenda bulyao, ku tuminikiza a mampo gabo ku bakulu bo kagugi ko bazumini ko ku litusisa ba Bbanabbasi no Saule.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Jakobo aa yagigwa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Mwa jejo inako, u mfumu Eloda kale ga shumina a kagugi ko bazumini bamwinya, na gajite uku ba pengisa. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Kale ga yaga Jakobo (mukulwe gwa Joani) ko kafulo a kanene. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Eloda aa bona buti jeji intaba na ja jangaza a Majuda, kale ga nungako mi kale ga kwata no Pitolosi. Byebi kale bya tendaala mu nako jo Mukiti go Binkwa Ta bi Umelwe. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Aa sa la mu kwati, kale ga mu tula mu ntolongo, no ku mu tambika ku masole buti ba mu mamele mi a kagugi no kagugi ka ka kwesi a masole bone. Eloda kame ka gajite uku mu leta no ku mu zekiseza akati ko bantu bonse aa se gu la mani u Mukiti go Mpaseka. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Cwale Pitolosi kale ga tuligwa mu ntolongo, kono a kagugi ko bazumini ka ka zundamine uku mu lapelela kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi aa zwa mu ntolongo ko makazo</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />A masiku Eloda aa ka gajite uku mu zekisa, Pitolosi kame ka lele mukati ko masole bo bile bu shuminwe ko mawenge gobile, mi a masole bamwinya na ba zimene a cizi co ntolongo na ba mamela. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Aobulyo, iñiloi lyo Mfumu Nyambe kale lya bonaala mi ituba kale lya munika mu ntolongo. Iñiloi kale lya ukusa Pitolosi e shansha no ku mu busa. Mi kale lya mu ta na lyo, “Zimana wangu!” mi a mawenge kale ga gwa ku maboko ga Pitolosi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Cwale iñiloi kale lya mu ta buti, “Zwata i bizwato byako no nshangu jako.” Mi Pitolosi kale ga tenda bulyao. Iñiloi kale lya mu ta kame buti, “U li zinge u mukanjo gwako mi u ndi umpilile.”<figure style="fig" alt="An angel delivers Peter from prison" file="wa03966b.jpg" size="span" loc="Acts 12:6-10" ref="12:6-10">Iñiloi aa li zwisa Pitolosi mu ntolongo</figure><verse eid="ACT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Pitolosi kale ga zwa mu ntolongo bu umpilile iñiloi, kono ta ka zekelele ibi ka li tenda iñiloi mbulyo ka gaja nage ncibonwa a wene. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Iñiloi no Pitolosi kale ba itilila a kagugi ketanzi ko masole mane no kabili mi kale ba sika a cizi co bitale ici ka ci anina mu munzi. Kale ca li galula ico icini ku ba galukila, mi kale ba itilamo. Aa se ba la jendi kace mu nzila, iñiloi kale lya mu leka.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Cwale Pitolosi kale ga ziba ici ka ci tendaala mi kale ga li ta gemwini buti, “Aano kale nda ziba mi ta ndi mamanyi buti u Mfumu Jesu a la tumi iñiloi lyakwe keza ku ndi lamwina ku ntalu ja Eloda mane no bintu byonse ibi ka ba gajite a Majuda buti kuti bi tendaale kwangu.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Aa sa la shugwilisi wawa byebi i bintu kale ga ja ku njugo ja Maliya nyina gwa Joani uju ka kugigwa kame buti ndi Maleka, u mu ka ba gwananine a bantu a bangi na ba lapela. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Pitolosi kale ga ka kokota a cizi co manginino ga kunze, mi u muika go mukazana uju ka kugigwa Loda kale ga ja ku cizi ka taba. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Aa na ga ziba ijwi buti ndya Pitolosi, kale ga jangala lwini mi ta na ga galula i cigalo kono kale ga bogola bu tiga no ka lugwila a bantu buti, “Pitolosi mpa cizi a zimene.”<verse eid="ACT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />A bantu kale ba mu ta nabo, “So la vulumuka.” Kono kale ga indikila buti mbobo ka ku kalile, a bantu kale ba ta buti, “Bunga ndi ñiloi lyakwe.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Kono Pitolosi kale ga zundamina uku kokota, mi aa se ba la galuli i cigalo no ku mu bona, kale ba komokwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Pitolosi kale ga ba ombeleza ko ku litusisa iganja lyakwe mi kale ga ba sukulwila ubu na ga mu zwisikiza u Mfumu Jesu mu ntolongo. Kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu lugwile Jakobo no bakwetu bamwinya byebi i bintu.” Ige kale ga ja ku cibaka cimwinya.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />A masiku-siku, kale kwa ba ne jaba mukati ko masole kebaka lyo bintu na bya tendaala kwa Pitolosi. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Eloda kale ga ba ta buti ba mu shake, kono kale ba kangwa uku mu gwana, mi kale ga zekisa babo a masole no ku ba atwila u lufu. Cwale Eloda kale ga zwa mwa Judeya no ka kala mwa Sesaleya.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">U lufu lwa Eloda</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Eloda ka kwesi uku li kanana no bantu bo minzi ja Taya no Sidoni. Cwale abo kale ba gwanana antu-onke mi kale ba tuma a bantu bamwinya kwa Eloda buti a shugwane nabo. Bbulasito, u mutusi gwa Eloda kale ga zumina ibi ka ba gamba babo a batumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Mwijuba lyo ku gwanana, Eloda kale ga zwata i bizwato byakwe byo bumfumu no ku kala mu cikalo cakwe co bumfumu mi kale ga gamba ku bantu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />A bantu kale ba kugiliza nabo, “Leli ndijwi lya nyambe, ta li ndya muntu.”<verse eid="ACT 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Aobulyo, iñiloi lyo Mfumu Nyambe kale lya kaba Eloda kakuli ta na ga lumba Nyambe, kale ga ligwa ku masene no ku fwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Mi ijwi lya Nyambe kale lya janduluka mi impalo jo bazumini kale ja ngiya.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Bbanabbasi no Saule aa se ba la mani u musebezi gwabo, kale ba bogola ku zwa mwa Jelusalema, mi kale ba itula no Joani uju ka kugigwa kame buti ndi Maleka.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Ba Bbanabbasi no Saule aa ba tumigwa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mukati ko bazumini aba ka ba li mu munzi gwa Antioki, mo ka ba li a baboni ba Nyambe no bazigi, mba Bbanabbasi no Simoni (uju ka kugigwa go ku siya), no Lusiyasi gwa kwa Silene, no Manaene (uju na ga kulila antu-onke no Mfumu Eloda) mane no Saule. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Ijuba limwinya aa ka ba kwesi uku lapela Nyambe no ku li nyima i bilyo, u Moya go Kucena kale gwa ba ta buti, “Mu ndi shalile ba Bbanabbasi no Saule buti ba ka tende u musebezi ugu na nda ba kugila.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Aa se ba la mani uku li nyima i bilyo no ku lapela, kale ba tula a maganja a mitwi ji ba Bbanabbasi no Saule mi kale ba ba tuma.<figure style="fig" alt="Barnabas and Saul are sent out" file="wa03968b.jpg" size="span" loc="Act 13:1-3" ref="13:1-3">Bbanabbasi no Saule aa ba tumigwa</figure><verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">U lujendo lwa Bbanabbasi no Saule</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Ba Bbanabbasi no Saule aa se ba la tumigwa ko Moya go Kucena, kale ba ja kwikamba lya Selusiya no ka longama mu bwato u bunene ku lutila mu cikuli ca Sipela. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Aa ba ka sika mu munzi gwa Salamisi, kale ba ja bu ngina mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda ku ja bu tandaza ijwi lya Nyambe mi Joani Maleka kale ga ka ja nabo na ja bu ba tusa.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Kale ba ja bu ita mu minzi jonse ja mu cikuli mane na ba ka sika mu munzi gwa Pafosi. Kale ba ka li gwanamo no muboni go manya uju ka li Mujuda ka kugigwa izina lya Bba-Jesu, uju kame ka li go mabibo. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Ka li musele gwa Sejiyasi Paulusi uju ka li mubusisi gwa ceco i cikuli mi ka kwesi lwini a magano. U mubusisi kale ga kuga ba Bbanabbasi no Saule buti ba ka mu potele kakuli kame ka shaka uku shugwa ijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Kono jojo unkosi go mabibo, uju ka kwesi kame izina lya Elimasi mu mushobo go Cigelike, kale ga nyungulula ibi ka ba gamba ba Bbanabbasi no Saule na shaka buti u mubusisi a leke uku zumina.<verse eid="ACT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Kono Saule uju se ka kugigwa kame buti ndi Paulusi, kale ga mu lolelela lwini mi ko nguzu jo Moya go Kucena kale ga mu ta buti, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />“Igwe gwe mwana Satani igwe u zimbite i bintu bi lulikile, go bitendantu i bimangoju byonse no manya, ndusiku nzi no leke uku zolagula a mazila ga Nyambe go ku goloka? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Ku zwa aano, Nyambe kuti na ku bangise ko nguzu jakwe, no be u muofu mi to no bone ituba lyejuba a nako ince.” Aobulyo kale ga ba u muofu mi kale ga babatila ku shaka go ku mu kwata kwiganja ku mu jendesa.<verse eid="ACT 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />U mubusisi aa bona ibi na bya tendaala, kale ga zumina mi kale ga komokwa kwijwi lyo Mfumu Jesu ka ba ziga ba Bbanabbasi no Paulusi.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi no Bbanabbasi mwa Antioki gwa Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Paulusi no bagenze kale ba zwa mu munzi gwa Pafosi no bwato mi kale ba ka fugikila ekamba lya Pega mwilonga lya Pamfiliya mi Joani Maleka kale ga ba leka ku bogola ku munzi gwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Paulusi no Bbanabbasi kale ba zwa mu munzi gwa Pega mane na ba ka sika mu munzi gwa Antioki gwa mwilonga lya Pisidiya. Kale ba ngina mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda lyo Nsabata.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ijuba lyo bu 7 mu nsunda, ili ta ka ba sebezanga a Majuda na ba lapela Nyambe mi mu Cishanjo ndya Mukibelo kampa ijuba lyo ku wisa.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />A bajendesi bo njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda aa se ba la bali mwibuka lyo mulao no lyo baboni ba Nyambe, kale ba kumbila ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi buti, “Bakwetu, ati mu li kwesi a majwi aga mu botele uku gongoza baba a bantu, mu ga gambe.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Paulusi kale ga zimana no ku ba ombeleza mi kale ga tatika uku gamba buti, “Mwe bantu ba Isilaele nenwe mwe bantu ta mu li a Majuda inwe mu joga Nyambe, mu ndi tegeleze!<verse eid="ACT 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />“Nyambe go bantu ba Isilaele sa shala basukuzetu, no ku ba ngiisa mu nako ka ba joja mu buika mwilonga lya Egepita. Ko nguzu jakwe kale ga ba zwisamo kame. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Kale ga ba babalela mu mangusu mu myaka jo makumi gone. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Mane kale ga jundisa a bantu bo maasi ga 7 ga mwilonga lya Kanana no ku wa ilonga lyabo ku bantu ba Isilaele buti ba li jobole. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Bebyo byonse kale bya tendaala mu myaka ja 450.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Ku zwao, Nyambe kale ga ba wa a baatuli ku twala ku nako jo muboni gwa Nyambe Samuele. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Kono a bantu kale ba li kumbilila kwa Nyambe buti a ba we u mfumu mi kale ga ba wa Saule mwana Kishi, go luasi lwa Bbenjamine uju sa ba busa a myaka jo makumi gone. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Nyambe kame kale ga indao Saule no ku jobozao Deviti uju sa tegwa kwa Nyambe buti, ‘Ndi la gwani Deviti mwana Jese, unkosi uju na gwa shaka u mojo gwangu. Ndege na tende i bintu byonse ubu ndi shakila.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Samuele 13:14</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />“Nyambe sa kuluwiza buti, ‘Jumwinya go luasi lwa Deviti kuti na keze ku jojesa a bantu ba Isilaele.’ Mi ndi Jesu ka ta. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Jesu na sini ku tatika uku sebeza, ndi Joani ka tandaza a bantu ba Isilaele bonse buti ba leke i bitendantu i bimangoju byabo no ku sigulukila kwa Nyambe buti ba kolobezigwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Mi Joani aa se ka ja ku ku mana u musebezi gwakwe, kale ga ta buti, ‘Mbuti mu ndi gajile? Izo ndime Mushaligwa sa mi kuluwiza Nyambe? Ta li ndime, kono ige a la keza mwishule lyangu uju ta ndi goli nanga nku shumununa u tushuminiso to nshangu jakwe.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Bakwangu, inwe bo mukoga gwa Abbulaama mane nenwe mwe bantu ta mu li a Majuda, inwe mu kutika Nyambe. Nkwetu na ga tumina Nyambe leli ijwi lyo njojeso. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Kakuli a bantu ba joja mu munzi gwa Jelusalema no bajendesi babo, ta na ba ziba buti Jesu ndini mi kale ba mu atula ku vumbiliza a majwi go baboni ba Nyambe aga ga baligwa lyo Nsabata no lyo Nsabata. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />No ku ta na ba gwana ibaka lyo ku mu atwila u lufu, kono kale ba kumbila Pilato buti a mu atwile u lufu.<verse eid="ACT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />“Aa se ba la tendi kwakwe byonse ibi na ba gamba a baboni ba Nyambe byo ku mu yaga, kale ba mu susa a cifapaano no ku mu tula mwibita. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Kono Nyambe kale ga mu busa ku mu zwisa ku bafu. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Mi ko majuba a mangi, Jesu ka li bonaazanga ku bantu a ba ka jendanga nabo ku zwa kwa Galileya ku ja kwa Jelusalema. Mi babo a bantu mbo bampaki bakwe ku bantu ba Isilaele bonse.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />“Mi iswe twa sa mi lugwila a majwi a malotu aga sa kuluwiza Nyambe ku basukuzetu. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Nyambe na ga bi vumbiliza kwetu ko ku busa Jesu ku mu zwisa ku bafu, sinagwe ubu ku ñolelwe mwibuka lyabili lyo Nimbo buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 13:33" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Ndigwe mwanangu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">ku zwa shunu ndime Isho.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Nimbo 2:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />I cintu ci bonisa buti Nyambe na ga mu busa ku mu zwisa ku bafu no mubili gwakwe buti ta na gwa bolela mwibita, se ku gambigwa buti, ‘Kuti na ndi mi we wawa imfwijaguzi jo kucena iji se ndi kuluwiza Deviti.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isaya 55:3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Mi mwibuka lyo Nimbo se ku gambigwa buti, ‘To no lekelele go kucena gwako a bolela mwibita.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Nimbo 16:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Kakuli Deviti mu bumi bwakwe, ka sebeleza Nyambe mi aa sa la fwi kale ba ka mu zika a mabita aa na ba zika basukuze mi kale ga bola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Kono ndi Jesu ka bi julika uju sa busa Nyambe ku mu zwisa ku bafu mi u mubili gwakwe ta se gu bolela mwibita.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />“Cwale bakwetu, twa sa shaka buti mu zibe buti ndi Jesu bulyo a gola uku kwatila i bitendantu i bimangoju byenu sinagwe aa tu mi lugwila. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Kakuli aa mu zumina, ndege bulyo a gola uku mi cenesa ku bintu byonse ibi ta ka gu gola uku mi lukulula kwabyo u mulao gwa Mushe. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Mu nangule buti ibi na ba gamba a baboni ba Nyambe na bi leke ku tendaala kwenu aa na ba ta buti,<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Nga mu lole, inwe mwe bantu mu shwaaguza Nyambe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">mu penge mi mu li fwile bulyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Kakuli kuti na ndi tende i citendantu mu majuba genu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ici na mu kangwe uku zumina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">nanga na ci mi gambaguza u muntu.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">Abakuki 1:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Paulusi no Bbanabbasi aa se ba la zwi momo mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, a bantu kale ba ba kumbila buti na ba ka bogole kame lyo Nsabata ili na li nungeko, buti na ba keze ku ba sukulwila byebyo i bintu kame. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />A Majuda bamwinya no bantu aba ka ba zumine i milao jo Cijuda, kale ba umpilila ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi mi kale ba ba gongoza buti ba zundamine no ku sepa Nyambe kakuli ngwa cisemo.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Lyo Nsabata na lya nungako, u bungi bo bantu ba momo mu munzi kale ba keza ku gwanana no ku tegeleza kwijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Kono a Majuda bamwinya aa ba bona u bungi bo bantu, kale ba fwila u muna ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi mi kale ba shwaaguza Paulusi no ku nyungulula ibi ka gambagula byonse.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Kono ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi kale ba ba lugwila ko bundume nabo, “Ka ku botele tanzi buti tu tandaze ijwi lya Nyambe kwenu mwe Majuda kono kakuli mwa sa li kana mwa sa li atula mwebeni mi ta mu si gwani u bumi ta bu mani, cwale se tu la ja tu ka tandaze ku bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Kakuli mbobo sa tu tela Nyambe buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 13:47" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Na nda ku shala buti u be ituba ku bantu aba ta <optbreak />ba li a Majuda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">bo malonga gonse ga ansi buti ba jojeswe.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:6">Isaya 4:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />A bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda aa ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba jangala mi kale ba lumba Nyambe keejwi lyakwe. Mi bonse aba na ba shalilwa u bumi ta bu mani, kale ba zumina kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Mi a bantu bonse ba momo mwilonga, kale ba shugwa ijwi lyo Mfumu Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 13:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Kono a Majuda kale ba shonga a banakazi aba ka ba zumine no ku kutikigwa mane no bajendesi bo munzi buti ba lwise ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi mi kale ba ba tanda mwilonga lyabo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi kale ba kunkumuna isukwe ku nshangu jabo ku bonisa buti a bantu bo munzi gwa Antioki ba la kani ijwi, mi kale ba ja ku munzi gwa Ikone. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Kono a bazigigwa ba mu munzi gwa Antioki ka ba jangele mi ka ba gongwele ko Moya go Kucena.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi no Bbanabbasi mu munzi gwa Ikone</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Mwa Ikone, Paulusi no Bbanabbasi kale ba ka ngina mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda. Kale ba ka gamba ko nguzu mi a bantu a bangi bo Majuda na ba ta ba li a Majuda kale ba zumina. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Kono a Majuda bamwinya kale ba kana uku zumina mi kale ba shonga a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda no ku ba nyegeza buti ba lwise a bazumini. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Kono ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi ko ku ba a batumigwa kale ba kala bulyao mu munzi gwa Ikone inako inde na ba tandaza ko bundume bya Nyambe go cisemo, mi Nyambe ka ba wa inguzu jo ku tenda i bijuliko no bintu bimwinya bi komokwisa. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Mi a bantu ba mu munzi se ka ba andene. Bamwinya se ka ba zimanina ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi mi bamwinya se ka ba zimanina a Majuda.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Aobulyo, a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda mane no Majuda kale ba gwanana no babusisi babo, buti ba talule ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi no ku ba sobagula ko mabwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Kono abo kale ba nangula mi kale ba zwamo no ku ja mu minzi ja Lisitila no Debbe ja mwilonga lya Likaoniya mane no bibaka ka bi li afuwi. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Mi koko kale ba ka ziga a majwi a malotu.<figure style="fig" file="SHJ_195wbt - Paul journey 1 [bwf-dark].indd" size="span" ref="13:4–14:28" /><verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi no Bbanabbasi mu minzi <optbreak />ja Lisitila no Debbe</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Mu munzi gwa Lisitila, mo ka li unkosi uju ta ka jenda ga li ku bonenwa kakuli a matende gakwe ta ka ga gongwele. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Kale ga tegeleza lwini kwe bi ka gamba Paulusi, mi Paulusi kale ga mu lolelela lwini mi kale ga nangula buti jojo unkosi ka kwesi inzumino buti a la gola uku lwaluka. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Paulusi kale ga mu kuga mu ku gongoza nage, “Igwe, zimana!” Aobulyo, jojo unkosi kale ga zimana no ku tatika uku jenda.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />A bantu bonse aa se ba la boni ibi na ga tenda Paulusi, kale ba kumbagana mu mushobo go Cilikaoniya nabo, “I mizimu ji la kezi shunu kwetu mu cibumbo co buntu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Kale ba gulika Bbanabbasi izina lya Zeyusi, mi Paulusi kale ba mu gulika Elemesi, kakuli ndege ka li mugambi u munene. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Injugo jo malapelelo ja nyambe gwabo Zeyusi nkunze jo munzi ka ji jakilwe, mi u mupulisiti gwa jejo injugo no bantu kale ba leta a bankunzi no bikocela byo mapalisa. Kale ba bi leta a nkanza afuwi no cizi co lubaga lo munzi mi kale ba shaka buti ba tendele ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi i bitagilo.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Kono Paulusi no Bbanabbasi aa ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba ñatula i bizwato byabo no ku welangila mukati ko bantu na ba ja bu kumba nabo, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Bakwetu ncinzi ci mi tendisa bulyao? Neswe tu li bantu sinagwe ndinwe! Majwi a malotu bulyo na twa mi letela buti mu leke jejo i mijojelo jenu iji ta ji kwesi intuso no ku ta buti mu sigulukile kwa Nyambe uju a joja, uju na ga bumba igulu nelonga no mawate mane no bintu byonse bi limo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ku kale, Nyambe sa lekelela a bantu bo malonga gonse buti ba li jojele ubu ba shakila. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Nanganceciba bulyao, Nyambe ka ba tenda nenja no ku ba jangaza ku myojo ko ku ba shokisezanga umvula ku zwa kwigulu mane no ku ba wa u lukau mu manako galo.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Kono nanga na ba tenda bulyao, Paulusi no Bbanabbasi, kale ba kangwa uku kanina a bantu buti ba leke uku ba tendela i citagilo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Bamwinya a Majuda kale ba zwa mu minzi ja Antioki gwa mwilonga lya Pisidiya mane no mu munzi gwa Ikone, keza ku shonga a bantu mi kale ba sobagula Paulusi ko mabwe no ku mu kokela kunze jo munzi na ba gaja buti a la fwi. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Kono a bazumini ba momo mu munzi kale ba keza ku mu bunganina. Paulusi kale ga zimana mi kale ga bogola mu munzi. Aa na bwaca, Paulusi no Bbanabbasi kale ba ja mu munzi gwa Debbe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi no Bbanabbasi mwa Antioki gwa Siliya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Paulusi no Bbanabbasi aa se ba la mani uku ziga a majwi a malotu mu munzi gwa Debbe, kale ba gwana a bazumini a bangi, kale ba bogola ku minzi ja Lisitila, no Ikone no kwa Antioki gwa mwilonga lya Pisidiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Kale ba ja bu gongoza i myojo jo bazumini no ku ba lugwila buti ba zundamine mu nzumino no ku ba ta buti, “Tu li botele uku ita mu mapenzi a mangi buti tu ngine mu mubuso gwa Nyambe.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Paulusi no Bbanabbasi kale ba shala a bajendesi a kagugi no kagugi ko bazumini mu munzi no munzi, aba ba botele uku gongoza no ku laga a bazumini bamwinya. Mi aa se ba la linyimi i bilyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uku li nyima i bilyo mutendelo ba tendanga a bantu ba zumina kwa Nyambe mu nako jimwinya buti ba lapele Nyambe.</char></note> no ku lapela, Paulusi no Bbanabbasi kale ba ba leka na be zi buti Nyambe kuti a ba babalele uju na ba zumina kwakwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Kale ba itila mwilonga lya Pisidiya no ku ja mwilonga lya Pamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Aa se ba la mani uku tandaza ijwi lya Nyambe mu munzi gwa Pega, kale ba sezumukila ku munzi gwa Ataliya.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Aa se ba la mani u musebezi ugu na ba tumigwa, kale ba zwa mu munzi gwa Ataliya mi kale ba ngina mu bwato u bunene no ku luta iwate inene ku bogola ku munzi gwa Antioki gwa mwilonga lya Siliya, u mu na ba ba kumbilila i cisemo ca Nyambe no ku ba tuma. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Aa ba ka sika mu munzi gwa Antioki, kale ba gwanika a bazumini bonse no ku ba gambaguza ubu ka ja bu ba tusikiza Nyambe ko nguzu jakwe no bu na ba sigulukila kwakwe a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda buti ba zumine. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Paulusi no Bbanabbasi kale ba kala no bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Antioki inako inde.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Inkongani jo bazumini mwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi aa ka ba sili mu munzi gwa Antioki, kale kwa keza a bankosi bamwinya aba ka ba zwa mwilonga lya Judeya. Kale ba tatika uku ziga a bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Antioki buti, “Aa ta mu ji ku mukanda ku ja ko bu gu co u mulao gwa Mushe, ta na mu jojeswe.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Paulusi no Bbanabbasi kale ba ba kanina mi kale ba li kanana nabo wawa, mi a bazumini kale ba zumininana buti ba tume ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi mane no bazumini bamwinya ku munzi gwa Jelusalema buti ba ka buze ku batumigwa no bajendesi a bakulu. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />A kagugi ko bazumini aa se ka la ba funduli, kale ba ja bu ita mu minzi ja mwilonga lya Fonisiya no Samaliya na ba ja bu sukulula ubu na ba sigulukila kwa Nyambe a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda. A bazumini bonse aa ka ba shugwa bulyao, ka ba jangala.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Aa ba ka sika mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, a batumigwa no bajendesi a bakulu mane no bazumini bonse, kale ba ka ba tambula nenja mi ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi kale ba ba sukulwila i bintu byonse ibi ka ba ja bu tenda mu nguzu ja Nyambe mu minzi jonse umu na ba ja bu ziga ijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Kono bamwinya a bazumini aba ka ba li bo kagugi ko Bafalisi kale ba zimana no ku ta buti, “A bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda ba li botele uku ja ku mukanda no ku kutika u mulao gwa Mushe.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />A batumigwa no bajendesi a bakulu, kale ba gwanana antu-onke no ku gambagula bya jejo intaba. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Aa se ba la gambaguli inako inde, Pitolosi kale ga zimana no ku ba ta buti, “Bakwangu, mu li zekelele buti Nyambe sa ndi shala mukati kenu mwense buti a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda no bazwa-malonga bonse ba shugwe a majwi a malotu ga Nyambe no ku zumina. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Mi Nyambe uju a zekelele i bigajantu byo bantu bonse, na ga bonisa nenja buti na ga ba tambula ko ku ba wa u Moya go Kucena ubu sa gu tu wela neswe. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ta na ga bonisa u mushalo mukati ketu nabo, kakuli na ga cenesa i myojo jabo kebaka lyo nzumino. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Cwale ncinzi aa mu jeleka Nyambe ko ku ziga a bazumini aba ta ba li a Majuda uku kutika i bintu na ba kangwa basukuzetu mane neswe bulyao? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Mu leke uku zumina bulyao kakuli kuti na tu jojeswe ko cisemo ca Mfumwetu Jesu antu-onke nabo.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />A bantu bonse kale ba ombelela mi kale ba tegeleza ku ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi aa ka ba ba gambaguza i bijuliko no bintu bi komokwisa ibi ka ba ja bu tenda ko nguzu ja Nyambe, ku bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda.<verse eid="ACT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Aa se ba la mani uku gamba, Jakobo kale ga zimana no ku ta buti, “Bakwangu, mu ndi tegeleze. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni Pitolosi a la gambi kwetu ubu sa shakila etanzi Nyambe, a bantu bo malonga gonse ku zwa ku matatikilo, no ku li shalila mukati kabo a bantu bakwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Mi no baboni ba Nyambe se ba ñola ku zumininana no mugambilo tu la gambi buti,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Ku zwao kuti na ndi ka bogole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">no keza ku jaka kame injugo ja Deviti iji se ji gwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Kuti na ndi ji jake kame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">no ku ji tenda nenja ubu ka ji kalile etanzi.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Buti a bantu bonse na ba zumine kwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">mi a bantu bo malonga gonse kuti na ba be bangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">kakuli mbobo sa co Nyambe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">uju na ga tenda i bintu byonse’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:11">Amosi 9:11</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 9:12">12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />no ku bi zibaaza ku zwililila ku nkulu-katanzi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:21">Isaya 45:21</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />“Cwale ime mbuti ndi co buti, tu leke uku kababuisa i bintu, no ku tembeka a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda aba ba sigulukila kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Kono tu ba ñolele bulyo buti ba zile i bilyo byo bitagilo ibi bi wegwa a bazimu, ba leke uku lya inyama jo ku ikisa no malowa, ba leke ku lya no nyama jo bipagu byo ku sinigwa ku bikolo-kolo, ba zwe ku cise. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kakuli ku zwa ku kale, i milao ja Mushe ka ji tandazigwanga mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda no ku bantu bo minzi jonse lyo Nsabata no lyo Nsabata.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iñolo li ja ku bazumini aba ta ba li a Majuda</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />A batumigwa no bajendesi a bakulu no bazumini bonse ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema kale ba gaja uku shala a bankosi bamwinya no ku ba tuma ku munzi gwa Antioki gwa mwilonga lya Siliya, antu-onke no ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi. Kale ba shala Judasi (uju ka kugigwa Bbasabbasi) mane no Silasi aba ka ba li bajendesi mukati ko bazumini. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Kale ba ba wa iñolo u mu ka ku ñoletwe buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 15:23" />
  <para style="mi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Ku zwa ku batumigwa no bajendesi a bakulu a bakwenu, twa sa mi ñolela inwe mwe bazumini aba ta ba li a Majuda ba mu minzi ja Antioki, Siliya no Silisiya Mu joje nenja.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Na twa shugwa buti a bantu bamwinya aba ka ba zwa ko kuno na ba keza ku mi tembeka kwe bi na ba keza ku mi ziga uku ta tu la ba tumi. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Kale twa gwanana no ku shala a bankosi bamwinya buti tu ba tume koko antu-onke no basele betu aba tu shaka ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />a bankosi aba na ba buguka no ku sa joga uku fwila izina lya Mfumwetu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Tu la mi tumini kame ba Judasi no Silasi buti ba keze ba mi gambaguze no ku gongolekeza ibi tu la mi ñoleli mwiñolo.<verse eid="ACT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />U Moya go Kucena na gwa tu bonisa buti ta tu botele uku mi kolekisa u muzigo go ku lema. Mu kutike bulyo byebyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Mu zile i bilyo byo bitagilo ibi bi wegwa ku bibumbantu byo bazimu, mu leke uku lya inyama jo ku ikisa no malowa, mu leke uku lya no bipagu byo ku sinigwa ku bikolo-kolo, mi mu zwe ku cise. Aa mu joga uku tenda byebyo i bintu, mwa sa tenda nenja wawa.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:29">Mu joje nenja.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />A bantu na ba tumigwa, kale ba zwa mu munzi gwa Jelusalema ku ja ku munzi gwa Antioki. Aa ba ka sika, kale ba ka gwanika a bazumini bonse no ku ba tambika iñolo. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />A bazumini kale ba li bala, mi kale ba jangala lwini ko majwi aga ka ga li mwiñolo.<verse eid="ACT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Mi ba Judasi no Silasi kebaka lyo ku ta buti, bonse ka ba li baboni ba Nyambe, kale ba gambagula inako inde no bazumini, buti ba gongolekeze mu ku zumina kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Ba Silasi no Judasi, kale ba kala no bazumini a nako imfuwi bulyo mi a bazumini kale ba ba bogoza kwa ba na ba ba tuma. Kale ba bogwela ku munzi gwa Jelusalema bu jangele. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Kono Silasi kale ga sigala mu munzi gwa Antioki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 34.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Ba Paulusi no Bbanabbasi, kale ba sigala mu munzi gwa Antioki. Kale ba gwanana no bagenzabo bamwinya na ba tandaza ijwi lyo Mfumu Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi no Bbanabbasi aa ba li kanana no ku li taa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Aa se ku la iti inako imfuwi, Paulusi kale ga ta Bbanabbasi nage, “Ndokweni tu bogole tu je bu bona a bazumini mu minzi jonse, u mu na twa ja bu tandaza ijwi lyo Mfumu Jesu, na tu ja bu bona ubu se ba bukila.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Bbanabbasi kale ga zumina mi kale ga shaka buti ba inde Joani Maleka. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Kono Paulusi kale ga gaja buti ba leke uku mu inda kakuli sa ba leka mu lujendo lwetanzi, mwilonga lya Pamfiliya no ku bogola ku munzi gwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Paulusi no Bbanabbasi kale ba li kanana mi ku mamaninino kale ba li taa. Bbanabbasi kale ga inda Joani Maleka no ku lutila mu cikuli ca Sipela. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Kono Paulusi kale ga shala Silasi. A bazumini kale ba ba kumbilila i cisemo ca Nyambe, mi kale ba funduka. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Paulusi kale ga ja mu malonga ga Siliya no Silisiya, na ja bu gongoza a bazumini bonse.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">U lujendo lwa Paulusi lwa bili</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paulusi kale ga tunguluza ku munzi gwa Debbe mane kale ga ka sika no ku munzi gwa Lisitila. Kale ga ka gwanamo u muzumini go nkosi ka kugigwa Timoteya. Nyina ka li Mujuda uju ka zumine, kono isi ka li Mugelike. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timoteya ka lumbigwa lwini ku bazumini ba mu minzi ja Lisitila no Ikone. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulusi kale ga shaka buti Timoteya a mu bandike mu lujendo lwakwe. Aobulyo kale ga mu twala ku mukanda kakuli a Majuda aba ka ba kala momo mu minzi jonse, ka be zi buti isi ka li Mugelike. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Aa ka ba li mu lujendo bulyao, ka ba ja bu ita mu minzi na ba ja bu lugwila a bazumini i milao iji na ba ba tela a batumigwa no bakulu bo tempele ja mu munzi gwa Jelusalema buti ba ji kutike. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Ko ku tenda bulyao, a bazumini ka ba gongola mu nzumino mi ka ba ngiya mwijuba-mwijuba.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi mwilonga lya Masedoniya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Paulusi na ba ka jenda nabo kale ba ja mu malonga ga Filijiya no Galatiya kono u Moya go Kucena kale gwa ba binda uku gamba ijwi mwilonga lya Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Aa se ba la siki a maninja gelonga lya Misiya, kale ba jeleka buti ba ngine mwilonga lya Bbitiniya, kono u Moya gwa Jesu kale gwa ba kanina kame. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Kale ba koshonkanya ilonga lya Misiya mi kale ba ka sezumukila mu munzi gwa Tilowasi ugu ka gu li ekamba lyewate.<verse eid="ACT 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />A masiku, Paulusi kale ga bona i cibonwa. Kale ga bona unkosi gwa kwilonga lya Masedoniya a zimene na mu kumbila nage, “U lutile mwilonga lyetu lya Masedoniya u keze u tu tuse.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Paulusi aa sa la boni ceco i cibonwa, kale twa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leli ijwi lya “twa” lya sa bonisa buti u muñoli gwebuka lyo bitendantu ne nako na ga gwanana a kagugi ka Paulusi no ku jendelela nabo.</char></note> litukiseza u lujendo lo ku ja kwilonga lya Masedoniya, kakuli ka tu zumina buti ndi Nyambe sa tu kugilako, buti tu ka zige a bantu a majwi gakwe a malotu.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Byo nsiguluko ja Lidiya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Aa na twa zwa mu munzi gwa Tilowasi, kale twa ngina mu bwato no ku lutila mu cikuli ca Samotilasi. Mi mwijuba ili na lya nungako, kale twa ka fugikila ekamba lya mu munzi gwa Neyapolisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Ku zwa momo, kale twa ka ngina mu munzi gwa Filipiya, ugu ka gu li gumwinya go minzi i minene ja mwilonga lya Masedoniya, ugu ka gu jendisigwa ku Maloma. Kale twa kalamo a majuba a mace bulyo.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Lyo Nsabata, kale twa zwa mu munzi mi kale twa sezumukila kwikamba lyo lwizi uku ka tu gaja buti a bantu nkoko ba botele uku gwananina ku lapela Nyambe. Kale twa ka kala na tu gambagula no banakazi aba ka ba gwananineko. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Jumwinya gwabo, ka kugigwa izina lya Lidiya uju ka zwa kwilonga lya Tiyatila. Uju ka li mugulisi go masila go mubala go nzilu, mi ka li muntu ka lapela Nyambe. Aa ka tegeleze kwe bi ka tu gambagula, u Mfumu Nyambe kale ga mu wa inshugwiliso buti a zumine ku bintu ka gamba Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Aa sa la kolobezigwa no bantu bonse bo mubanda gwakwe, kale ga tu kumbila buti, “Ndokweni ku mubanda gwangu ati mu la boni buti ndi li muzumini kwa Nyambe Mfumwetu. Mu keze mu kale a mubanda gwangu.” Kale ga tu tongomana mane na tu gola.<figure style="fig" file="SHJ_205wbt - Paul journey 2 [bwf-dark].indd" size="span" ref="15:36–18:22" /><verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi no Silasi mu ntolongo</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ijuba limwinya aa ka tu ja ku cibaka co malapelelo, kale twa shangana u muika go mwanakazi uju ka kwesi u moya go bulaguli bo bintu bya ku buso. Mi bamfumwe ka ba gwana lwini a masheleñi. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Kale ga umpilila Paulusi neswe twense na ja bu kugiliza nage, “Babo a bankosi mbaika ba Nyambe Sakapanga! Kame na ba keza ku mi gambaguza ubu mu botele uku jojesezwa!”<verse eid="ACT 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Ka tembekanga bulyao ubu ka tu shanganina bonse, mi Paulusi kale ga lunguka ku mojo. Kale ga zoka no ku jukukila gogo u moya ugu ka gu li kwakwe nage, “Mwizina lya Jesu u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe, u zwe kwakwe!” Aobulyo, u moya kale gwa zwa kwakwe.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Bamfumwe, aa se ba la boni buti insepo jabo jo ku gwana a masheleñi ji la mani, kale ba kwata Paulusi no Silasi no ku ba twala ku cibaka co magulikizo buti ba ka ligambilile ku babusisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Kale ba ba twala ku baatuli no ka ba ta buti, “Baba a bankosi Majuda, mi ba sa tembeka a bantu ba mo muno mu munzi. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Kame ba kwesi uku ziga a bantu buti ba tende i bintu ibi ta gu zuminini u mulao gwetu twe Maloma uku bi tenda.”<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />A bantu a bangi kale ba gwanana no ku tatika uku lwisa ba Paulusi no Silasi. Mi a baatuli kale ba lugwila a bantu buti ba ba ñatagwile i bizwato byabo no ku ba lwapagula no ndupwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Aa se ba la mani uku ba lwapagula, kale ba ba tula mu ntolongo mi kale ba lugwila u mumameli go ntolongo buti a ba mamele lwini. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Aa sa la lugwilwa bulyao, kale ga ba nginika mu kampetu ka mukati no ku atika a matende gabo mu bishamu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbishamu ka ba conkomonanga no ku nginikamo a matende buti u muntu a kangwe uku jenda no ku lendela.</char></note><figure style="fig" alt="Paul and Silas in the Philippi prison" file="wa03976b.jpg" size="col" loc="Act 16: 23-28" ref="16:23-24">Paulusi no Silasi mu ntolongo</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Akati ko masiku, Paulusi no Silasi kale ba tatika uku lapela no ku zimbila Nyambe inimbo a mapantiti bamwinya na ba ba tegeleze. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Aobulyo, kale kwa ba no ku ukuta lwini ko cibaka conse mane no nsumpo jo ntolongo kale ja ukuta-ukuta jonse. I bigalo byo ntolongo kale bya galuka mi a mawenge kale ga shumunuka ku mapantiti bonse, no ku gwila ansi. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />U mumameli go ntolongo kale ga buka mi kale ga bona i bizi byo ntolongo buti mbya ku galuka. Kale ga inda a kafulo buti a li yage gemwini, kakuli se ka gaja buti a mapantiti ba la lendeli. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Kono Paulusi kale ga kumba nage, “Igwe, u leke uku li yaga! Twense mo tu li mo muno!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />U mumameli go ntolongo kale ga tuma a bantu buti ba ka inde a mamuni mi kale ga ngina wangu mu ntolongo bu tutuma no ka gwila afuwi no Paulusi no Silasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Kale ga ba buza no ku ba kumbila buti, “Bakwangu, mbuti ndi botele uku tendela izo ndi jojeswe?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Abo kale ba mu taba buti, “U zumine bulyo ku Mfumu Jesu mi kuti no jojeswe, igwe mane no luasi lwako lonse.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Kale ba mu gambaguza ijwi lya Nyambe mane no luasi lwakwe lonse. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Gago a masiku, u mumameli go ntolongo, kale ga ba inda no ka ba sanza a nkubalo jabo. Aobulyo, kale ga kolobezigwa no luasi lwakwe lonse. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Kale ga ba twala ku njugo jakwe no ka ba wa i bilyo mi kale ga jangala lwini kakuli na ga zumina kwa Nyambe, ige no luasi lwakwe lonse.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Aa na bwaca, a baatuli kale ba tuma u tupaso ku mumameli go ntolongo ka mu ta buti, “U lukulule ba Paulusi no Silasi.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />U mumameli go ntolongo kale ga ta Paulusi buti, “A baatuli ba la ndi ti buti ndi mi shumunune mu ka li jile. Cwale mu zwe mu ntolongo. Mu jende nenja.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Paulusi kale ga ta u tupaso buti, “Na ba tu kabila akati ko bantu uku ta ba la tu zekisi, mane no ku tu tula mu ntolongo. Aa se ba la kangwi uku tu gwanina u mulandu, ncinzi aa se ba shaka buti tu zwe mu buzinda? Ta be zi buti tu li Maloma? Bulyao kame nyaa! Abo ba keze ba tu zwisemo.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />U tupaso kale twa ka lugula bulyao ku baatuli buti, Paulusi no Silasi maloma. A baatuli aa ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba joga lwini <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Kale ba keza kwa Paulusi no Silasi keza ku ba kumbila buti ba ba kwatile. Kale ba ba zwisa mu ntolongo no ku ba kumbila buti ba zwe mu munzi gwabo. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Aa se ba la zwi mu ntolongo, kale ba ja kwilapa lya Lidiya mi kale ba ka gwananako no bazumini. Paulusi no Silasi, kale ba ba gongoza. Aa se ba la mani, kale ba ba lagana no ku fundukamo.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi mwilonga lya Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Paulusi no Silasi kale ba ita mu minzi ja Amfipolisi no Apoloniya mi kale ba ka sika mu munzi gwa Tesalonika u mu ka ku li injugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Ko bu ka sholelele, Paulusi kale ga ngina mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda. Mi lyo Nsabata no lyo Nsabata mu masunda go tatwe kale ga gambagula nabo byo Mañolo. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Ka ba tansulwila no ku ba bonisa buti u Mushaligwa ka botele uku penga no ku buka ku zwa ku bafu, mi kale ga ta nage, “Joju Jesu ndi mi gambaguza byakwe nde Mushaligwa.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />A Majuda bamwinya kale ba zumina, mi kale ba gwanana no Paulusi no Silasi. A bankosi bo Magelike a bangi aba ka ba jogete Nyambe kale ba zumina nabo, mane no banakazi bamwinya aba ka ba kutikigwa lwini.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Kono a Majuda bamwinya, kale ba fwila Paulusi no Silasi u muna. Kale ba gwanika a kagugi ko bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju, bantembeka. Kale ba tatika inkondo mi kale ba zimbuluka injugo ja Jasoni ku shaka Paulusi no Silasi buti ba ba zwisikize ku bantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Aa se ba la kangwi uku ba gwanamo, kale ba kokela Jasoni no bazumini bamwinya, ku ba twala ku bakulu bo munzi. Kale ba ja bu tenda ijaba na ba kumbagana buti, “Paulusi no Silasi aba ba tembekite mu malonga gonse, na ba keza no mu munzi gwetu keza ku tembeka, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />mi Jasoni na ga ba tambula mwilapa lyakwe, na ba shwaaguza i milao ja Sesale u mfumu mukulu go Maloma. Na ba ta buti, nkwali u mfumu jumwinya a kugigwa Jesu.”<verse eid="ACT 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />A bajendesi no bantu bonse kale ba ba no ntongausi mi kale ba nyegela lwini. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Kale ba indikiza Jasoni no bagenze buti ba zwise a masheleñi go ku li lifulula, mi kale ba manisa intaba no ku ba lukulula.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi no Silasi mu munzi gwa Bbeleya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Gago a masiku, a bazumini kale ba fundula Paulusi no Silasi buti ba je kwa Bbeleya. Aa ba ka sika, kale ba ka ngina mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />A bantu ba mu munzi gwa Bbeleya, ka ba kwesi a magano ku ita a bantu ba mu munzi gwa Tesalonika. Kale ba tegeleza bu jangele ku bintu ka ba ziga ba Paulusi no Silasi. Mwijuba-mwijuba ka ba shakisisa mu Mañolo buti ba bone izo mbobo ku kalile. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Ko ku tenda bulyao, u bungi bo Majuda kale ba zumina mane no bungi bo banakazi no bankosi bo Magelike.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Kono a Majuda bamwinya ba mu munzi gwa Tesalonika aa ba shugwa buti, Paulusi ndijwi lya Nyambe a tandaza mu munzi gwa Bbeleya, kale ba jako no ka shonga-shonga a bantu buti ba lwise Paulusi no Silasi. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />A bazumini kale ba twala Paulusi kwikamba lyewate, kono Silasi no Timoteya kale ba sigala mwa Bbeleya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Aba na ba bandika Paulusi, kale ba mu twala mane na ba ka mu sisa mu munzi gwa Atene. Aa se ba bogola, Paulusi kale ga ba lagana buti, Silasi no Timoteya ba mu welangile wangu.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa tandaza mu munzi gwa Atene</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paulusi aa ka si lindile Silasi no Timoteya bulyao mu munzi gwa Atene, kale ga li shugwa u bubi ku mojo aa bona i bibumbantu ibi ka ba lapela ubu ka bi ngiile mu munzi. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Kale ga ja mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda no ka gambagula no Majuda mane no bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda aba ka ba jogete Nyambe, na ba ka ja bu gwana bonse a nkanza no mu bibaka byo magulikizo.<verse eid="ACT 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Kale ga li gwana no bantu aba ka ba lizigite lwini byo mukalilo go bintu ibi bili mwilonga no mijojelo jo bantu, aba ka ba kugigwa bo tugugi twa Epikule<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A bantu aba ka ba umpilila umuzigi u munene ka kugigwa Epikule uju ka ziga buti, injangalo nce cintu co butokwa mu bumi. Ndege sa tatika i cikolo mu munzi gwa Atene ka 300 BC na sini ku bonigwa Jesu. </char></note> no Sitoiki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baba mbantu aba ka ba zumina buti uku jangala lwini nkubi, mi no ku nyegelanga lwini nkubi. </char></note>. Kale ba tatika uku li kanana nage, na ba li buza mwalyabo nabo, “Mbinzi a gaba-gaba joju unkosi?” Bamwinya mane ka ba ta buti, “Ga sa gambagula byo mizimu jo bazwa-malonga.” Kakuli Paulusi kame ka ba tandaza a majwi a malotu ga Jesu no mbuko jo bafu.<verse eid="ACT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Kale ba mu inda no ku mu twala ku cibaka i cinene co magwananino go bantu ca gogo u munzi ici ka ci kugigwa Aleopago. Kale ba mu ta nabo, “Ngo tu gambaguze tu shugwe nenja i bintu ibi u ziga? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Mbiya kwetu, kame tu shaka uku bi ziba!” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />A bantu ba mu munzi gwa Atene mane no bazwa-malonga, ka ba shaka lwini uku jonena inako jabo a ku gambagula no ku tegeleza ku bintu i biya.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Cwale Paulusi kale ga zimana akati ko nkongani jo manduna ja Aleopago no ku ba gambaguza nage, “Inwe mwe bankosi ba mu munzi gwa Atene, kale nda nangula buti mu li bazumini wawa ku bazimu. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Kakuli aa ka ndi kwesi uku jenda-jenda mu munzi gwenu na ndi lolesa nenja i bibumbantu byenu ibi mu lapela, na nda bona u lutala lumwinya lo ntala jenu aa ku ñoletwe buti, ‘<char style="sc">Kwa Nyambe uju ta zibaali</char>.’ Jojo Nyambe mu lapela, uju ta mu zekelele, ndege ndi mi gambaguza byakwe.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />“Nde Nyambe uju sa bumba ilonga no bintu byonse ibi bi limo, kakuli nu Mfumu gwa kwigulu no ansi, ta kali mu matempele aga na ba jaka a bantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Mi ta zundi uku tusigwa cimwinya ku zwa ku bantu kakuli takuli ici a bulite. Ndege a wa u bumi ku bantu no bintu byonse. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Ku zwa ku muntu genke gwe tanzi, na ga leta a bantu bonse aba ba li mu malonga gonse. Na ga ba wa uku jaka mwilonga lyonse no ku ba koshagwila a maninja go bibaka aa ba botele uku jaka no manako go ku joja kwabo.<verse eid="ACT 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />“Nyambe ka shaka buti a bantu bo malonga, ba mu shake, buti bunga ba la gola uku mu gwana kakuli tali nkule a ka li no bantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Kakuli ndege a tu jojesa buti mane tula gola uku ukuta no ku bako. Aba ba gola lwini uku kaba i milya, se ba kaba u mulya gu ta buti, ‘Tu li bane.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Mi kakuli tu li bana Nyambe, ta tu botele uku gaja buti Nyambe ngwa ku koza i cibumbantu ici na ba bumba a babumbi a butale bwa gauda, kampa ici na ba fula a butale bo cilivela kampa ebwe ko bukwala no nzibo jo buntu.<verse eid="ACT 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />“Ku kale, Nyambe ka lekelele a bantu uku joja ubu ka ba shakila kakuli ta ka be zi ubu ka ba botele uku mu lapelela. Kono aano sa la lugwila wawa a bantu bonse ba mu malonga gonse buti ba leke i bitendantu i bimangoju byabo no ku sigulukila kwakwe. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Kakuli ndege e zi ijuba ili na atule a bantu ko nkosi uju na ga shala. Na ga wa i cijuliko ca bulyao ku bantu bonse ko ku mu busa ku mu zwisa ku bafu.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Aa se ba shugwa byo mbuko jo bafu, kale ba seka kono bamwinya kale ba mu ta nabo, “Twa sa shaka buti no bi tu gambaguze kame lumwinya u lusiku.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Paulusi kale ga lekelao mi kale ga zwa mukati kabo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Kono bamwinya kale ba zumina ibi ka gamba mi kale ba mu umpilila. Kwa ba na ba zumina, nko ka li unkosi ka kugigwa izina lya Dayonisiyasi, uju ka li jumwinya go bajendesi bo cibaka co magwananino ca Aleopago. No mwanakazi gwezina lya Damalisi, mane no bamwinya a bangi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa gwanana no ba Akwila no Pulisila</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Aa se bi la mani byebyo, Paulusi kale ga zwa mu munzi gwa Atene no ku ja mu munzi gwa Kolinte. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Kale ga ka gwanamo unkosi gwezina lya Akwila uju ka zwa kwilonga lya Ponto. Nage nko ku sika ka sika mu munzi gwa Kolinte no mukazi gwakwe gwezina lya Pulisila, na ba ka zwila kwilonga lya Italiya kakuli u mfumu go Maloma Kilaude, sa ta buti a Majuda ba zwe mu munzi gwa Loma. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Paulusi ka li musumi go matente mi kale ga kala nabo, kakuli nabo ka ba li basumi bo matente.<verse eid="ACT 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Lyo Nsabata no lyo Nsabata, Paulusi ka gwanaalanga mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda na jeleka uku sigulula a Majuda no Magelike. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Silasi no Timoteya aa se ba la siki na ba ka zwila kwilonga lya Masedoniya, Paulusi kale ga gongolekeza uku tandaza ijwi, na lugwila a Majuda no Magelike buti Jesu nde Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Kono a Majuda aa se ba la mu shwaaguzi no ku mu nyungulula, kale ga zukutula i bizwato byakwe mu bunyegezi no ku ba ta buti, “Ta ndi si kwesi u mulandu kwenu, uju na li fwile ni ntaba jakwe. Ku zwa aano se ndi la mi leka ndi ka tandaze a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Mi Paulusi kale ga ba leka no ku ja kwilapa lya Titiyasi Jasitasi uju ka zumine kwa Nyambe mi ta ka li Mujuda. Uju ka jakile ambali no njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilisipo u mujendesi go njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda kale ga zumina ku Mfumu Jesu mane no luasi lwakwe lonse. Mi u bungi bo bantu ba mu munzi gwa Kolinte aba na ba shugwa ibi ka tandaza Paulusi kale ba zumina mi kale ba kolobezigwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />A masiku ge juba limwinya, Paulusi kale ga bona i cibonwa. Kale ga bona u Mfumu Jesu na mu ta buti, “U leke uku joga, gongolekeza uku gamba mi u leke uku ombelela! <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Negwe ndi kele mi takuli u muntu na ku lwise no ku ku kubaza, kakuli ndi li kwesi a bantu a bangi mo muno mu munzi!” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Paulusi kale ga kala mu munzi gwa Kolinte u mwaka mukatumbi no myezi ja 6 na ziga a bantu ijwi lya Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Kono Galiyo aa ka li mubusisi gwelonga lya Akaya, a Majuda kale ba gwanana mi kale ba lwisa Paulusi no ku mu leta mu nkuta jo mubusisi. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Kale ba mu ta buti, “Joju unkosi kame a indikiza a bantu uku sebeleza Nyambe, ku leka ubu gu co u mulao gwetu.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Paulusi aa se ka shaka uku taba buti a li lamwine, Galiyo kale ga ta a Majuda aba ka ba lwisa Paulusi nage, “Mu ndi tegeleze mwe Majuda, ka li na mulandu go bitendantu i bimangoju na ga tenda na mu ndi gambaguza, na ndi mi tegeleza. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Kono aa mu li buzagula bulyo byo majwi no mazina mane no byo mulao gwenu go Cijuda, mu bi libonene mwebeni. Kakuli ime ta ndi atulangi a mataba ga bulyao.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Aobulyo Galiyo kale ga ba ta buti ba zwe mu nkuta.<verse eid="ACT 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />A bantu kale ba kwata Sositene u mujendesi go njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda no ku mu kabila mu nkuta kono Galiyo ta na ga bi twalikiza ingana.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa bogola kwa Antioki gwa mwa Siliya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paulusi kale ga kala a majuba a mace bulyo mu munzi gwa Kolinte mi kale ga lagana a bazumini bo bankosi no banakazi no ku lutila kwilonga lya Siliya mi Akwila no mukazi gwakwe Pulisila kale ba mu sindikiza. Na sini ka lutila kungi kale ga kala mu munzi gwa Senkileya, mi Paulusi kale ga ka li kuluza inshuki kebaka lyo nkuluwizi sa kuluwiza Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Aa ba ka sika mu munzi gwa Efese, Paulusi kale ga ka lekamo ba Akwila no mukazi gwakwe Pulisila mi kale ga ka ngina mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda no ka gambagula nabo. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Kale ba mu kumbila buti a kale nabo inako inde, kono kale ga kana. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Paulusi aa ka ba lagana, kale ga ba kuluwiza no ku ba ta buti, “Kuti na ndi ka bogole ati Nyambe na shaka.” Aa sa la ba ti bulyao kale ga ngina mu bwato u bunene no ku zwa mu munzi gwa Efese. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Kale ba ka ja mu munzi gwa Sesaleya. Ku zwao kale ga ja no ka potela a bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema. Aa sa la mani ku li bona nabo, kale ga bogola no ku ja ku munzi gwa Antioki.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul sails from Achaia to Syria" file="wa03983b.jpg" size="span" loc="Act 18:18-22" copy="Wade" ref="18:18-22">Paulusi aa luta ku zwa mwa Akaya ku ja mwa Siliya</figure><verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Aa sa la mani a majuba mu munzi gwa Antioki, kale ga koshonkanya a malonga ga Galatiya no Filijiya akati na ja bu gongoza a bazumini.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolosi aa ja mu minzi ja Efese no Kolinte</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Unkosi jumwinya go Mujuda uju ka kugigwa izina lya Apolosi, gwa mu munzi gwa Alekizandiliya, mwilonga lya Egepita, kale ga sika mu munzi gwa Efese. Ka li muntu ka zekelele a majwi ga Nyambe aga ka ga ñoletwe mi ka li mugambi wawa. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Sa zigigwa inzila jo Mfumu Jesu, mi ka gamba ko nzundamo no ku ziga bya Jesu nenja, no ku kezi bulyo byo nkolobezo ja Joani. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Ba Pulisila no muntu gwakwe Akwila, aa ba tegeleza Apolosi ubu ka gambila ko bundume mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, kale ba mu itula ku njugo jabo no ka mu tansulwila nenja inzila ja Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolosi aa se ka shaka uku ja ku minzi ja mwilonga lya Akaya, a bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Efese kale ba mu lagana ko majwi go ku mu gongoza. Kale ba ñolela no bazumini ba mu minzi ja Akaya buti ba mu tambule nenja. Aa sa la ka sikiko, kale ga ka tusa lwini a bantu aba na ba zumina ko cisemo ca Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ka genisa no ku gola a Majuda bonse aba ka ba li kanana nage onse aa ka ba mu gwana nanga mpakati ko bantu kampa na kele genke, na ba tansulwila ku zwililila mu Mañolo buti Jesu nde Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi mu munzi gwa Efese</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolosi aa ka sili mu munzi gwa Kolinte, Paulusi kale ga koshonkanya akati kelonga mi kale ga ka sika mu munzi gwa Efese u mu na ga ka gwana a bazumini bamwinya. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Kale ga ba buza nage, “Se mu tambula u Moya go Kucena aa se mu zumina?” Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Inga, ka tu sini uku shugwa buti nko gu li u Moya go Kucena.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Paulusi kale ga ba buza nage, “Kanti ni nkolobezo nzi na mwa kolobezigwa?” Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Ni nkolobezo ja Joani.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Paulusi kale ga ta nage, “Inkolobezo ja Joani ka ji li jo nsiguluko ku zwa ku bitendantu i bimangoju. Kame ka gambaguza a bantu buti ba zumine kwoju ka si keza mwishule lyakwe mi ndi Jesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Aa ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba kolobezigwa mwizina lyo Mfumu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Paulusi aa sa la ba tuli a maganja, u Moya go Kucena kale gwa keza kwabo mi kale ba gamba i mishobo ji andene-andene mi kale ba gamba ko buboni. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Ka ba botele uku ba a bankosi be kumi no bo bile.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Paulusi kale ga inda i myezi jo tatwe mu munzi gwa Efese na janga mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, na tandaza ko bundume, na ba gambaguza byo mubuso gwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Kono bamwinya kale ba kana, na ba shwaaguza akati ko bantu bonse ibi ka gamba Paulusi byo nzigo jo Nzila ja Jesu. Ige kale ga ba leka, mi kale ga ka ja no bazumini no ka ziga mwijuba-mwijuba mu njugo inene jo malizigilo ja Tilano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Kale kwa tendaala bulyao a myaka jo bile buti mane a Majuda bonse no Magelike aba ka ba joja bonse mwilonga lya Asiya, kale ba shugwa ijwi lyo Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nyambe sa wa Paulusi inguzu jo ku tenda a mamakazo ga komokwisa, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />buti mane nanga ntutaulo no tusila utu ka litusisanga Paulusi, aa ka ba tu kambikanga a balwele, ka ba lwaluka ku malwele gabo mi i myoya i mimangoju ka ji zwa kwabo.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />A Majuda bamwinya ka ba ja bu zwisa i myoya i mimangoju ku bantu aba ka ji tembeka, na ba jeleka uku litusisa izina lyo Mfumu Jesu. Na ba ta buti, “Mwizina lya Jesu uju a tandaza Paulusi, twa sa mi lugwila, mu zwe!” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Aba ka ba tenda bulyao, ka ba li bantu ba 7, aba ka ba li bana bo mupulisiti u mukulu go Mujuda uju ka kugigwa Sikeba. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />U lusiku lumwinya aa ka ba jeleka uku tenda bulyao u moya u mubi kale gwa ba taba nago, “Jesu ndi li mwi zi mane no Paulusi ndi li mwi zi. Cwale inwe ndinwe bani?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Jojo unkosi ka kwesi u moya u mubi, kale ga ba shotokela no ku ba gola bonse. Kale ga ba kaba mi kale ba tiga mu cisense ku zwa mu njugo bu shoka a malowa.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />A Majuda no Magelike bonse aba ka ba jakite mu munzi gwa Efese, kale ba shugwa byebyo i bintu mi kale ba joga lwini. Kale ba kutika izina lyo Mfumu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />U bungi bo bantu aba na ba zumina, kale ba keza ku li lugula ibi na ba tenda byonse, akati ko bantu. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Bonse aba ka ba tendanga a mabibo, kale ba leta a mabuka gabo no ku ga tenta a bantu bonse na ba lolelele. Aa ba gwanika impalo jo masheleñi go mabuka gonse aga na ba tenta, kale ga sika a 50,000 go buwaya-waya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isheleñi lyonke lyo muwaya-waya ka li kwana uku lifa u mubeleki ejuba mutumbi.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Ko ku tenda bulyao, ijwi lya Nyambe kale lya janduluka lwini no ku kula mu nguzu.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Aa se bi la mani ku tendaala byebyo, Paulusi kale ga gaja uku ja ku munzi gwa Jelusalema. Kale ga itila mwilonga lya Masedoniya no mwilonga lya Akaya. Paulusi kale ga ta kame buti, “Ndi li botele u ka pota ku munzi gwa Loma kame.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Kale ga tuma ba Timoteya no Elasito kwilonga lya Masedoniya, a batusi bakwe bo bile, mi ige kale ga sigala a majuba a mace mwilonga lya Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inkondo ja mu munzi gwa Efese</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Mwa jejo inako kale kwa ba ne nkondo inene kebaka lyo nzigo jo Nzila ja Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Unkosi ka kugigwa Demetiliyasi, uju ka li mufuli go butale bo cilibela, ubu ka ba tulanga mu tempele ja nyambe go mwanakazi Atemisi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atemisi mu mushobo go Cigelike kono mu mushobo go Ciloma, ndi Diyana ka ba mu kuganga. Mu bone no mwa 19:27,28,34,35. </char></note> ka gwana lwini a masheleñi aga ka wanga a babeleki bakwe. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Kale ga kuga a bagenze aba ka ba tenda u musebezi gonke nage. Kale ga ba ta buti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:25">“Bakwangu, mpa ku fula no ku bumba-bumba i bibumbantu tu jojela no ku gwana u lubono. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Kono mu liwene no ku shugwa buti joju Paulusi, a li kwesi uku sigulula a bantu mo muno mu munzi gwa Efese mane no bantu belonga lyonse lya Asiya, buti i bifulantu no bibumbantu ba li bumba-bumbila a bantu ta li mbintu. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Cwale se ku li li u bujoge sini ku njoneko je zina lyo mpisinisi jetu bulyo, kono kame no tempele ja nyambe gwetu u munene Atemisi kuti ji shwauke. Mi nage wawa nyambe go mwanakazi uju a lapelwa mwilonga lya Asiya lyonse mane no mu malonga gonse, u bumfumu bwakwe kuti na bu shwauke.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Aa ba shugwa gago a majwi, kale ba nyegela lwini mi kale ba tatika uku kugiliza nabo, “Diana go Baefese, munene!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Kale kwa ba no nkondo mu munzi gonse, mi a bantu kale ba tigilila ku njugo jo mazanino. Kale ba kwata Gayusi no Alisitako, aba ka ba jendanga no Paulusi ba kwilonga lya Masedoniya mi kale ba ba twala momo mu njugo. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulusi ka shakite uku ja ku bantu a bangi, kono a bazumini kale ba mu binda. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />A bajendesi bamwinya ba mwilonga lya Asiya, bagenze ba Paulusi kale ba mu tumina indagano buti a leke ku ja koko ku njugo jo mazanino.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Momo mukati, a bantu bonse kame ka ba kwesi uku kumbagana, i bintu bi andene-andene, mi a bantu kale ba ba ne nkokani. Bamwinya mane ta ka be zi buti mbinzi ka ba kalilemo. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />A Majuda kale ba timbila Alekizanda a buso no ku mu ta buti a toloke ici ci la leti bulyao. Alekizanda kale ga zimika iganja mwigulu ku ba bonisa buti ba ombelele. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Kono a bantu aa ba ziba buti Mujuda, kale ba tenda lwini ijaba inako inde na ba tanga buti, “Atemisi go Baefese munene!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />U muñoli go nkuta jo munzi, kale ga ba ombeleza mi kale ga ba ta nage, “Mwe bantu ba mu munzi gwa Efese, izo nkwali uju tezi buti u munzi gwa Efese ngogo gu babalela i tempele ja nyambe gwetu u munene Atemisi mane ne cibumbantu cakwe cebwe lyo kucena ili na lya gwa kwigulu? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Ko ku ta buti takuli u muntu uju a gola uku kana byebyo i bintu, mu ombelele mi mu leke uku tukwilanga i bintu. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Mu la leti baba a bankosi ko kuno mi takuli ici ba la ibi mu njugo jo malapelelo kame takuli ici ba la gambi ku shwauza nyambe gwetu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atemisi ka li nyambe go mwanakazi uju ka ba lapela a bantu ba mu munzi gwa Efese.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />“Ati Demetiliyasi no bagenze a bafuli no babumbi a ba a sebeza nabo ba li kwesi intongausi kwa baba a bantu, a makuta nko ga li no baatuli nko ba li, ba ba twaleko. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Kono ati nko bi si li bimwinya ibi mu si tongauka, kuti na bi manine mu nkuta. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Mu liwene buti kale twa ngina mu bukababu kebaka lyo nkokani jo nkondo ji la tendaali shunu, mi takuli ubu na tu bi shampwile.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Aa sa la gambi bulyao, kale ga ta a bantu buti ba mwagale.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi mwa Masedoniya no <optbreak />mwilonga lyo Magelike</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ijaba lyo bigambo byo ku lwisa Paulusi aa se li la mani, Paulusi kale ga kuga a bazumini bonse. Kale ga ba lagana ko majwi go ku ba gongoza mi kale ga ja kwilonga lya Masedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Kale ga ja bu ita mu minzi na ja bu ba gongoza ko majwi a mangi, mi kale ga jenda bulyao mane na ka ngina mwilonga lyo Magelike. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Paulusi kale ga kala mwilonga lyo Magelike i myezi jo tatwe. Aa se ka shaka uku ja kwilonga lya Siliya, kale ga shugwa buti a Majuda kame ka ba mu ingila buti na ba mu yage aa na je kwikamba lyewate. Kale ga gaja uku bogola kwa Masedoniya.<verse eid="ACT 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Sopatele mwana Payalasi, gwa mu munzi gwa Bbeleya, Alisitako no Sekunda ba mu munzi gwa Tesalonika, kale ba mu bandika. Gayusi gwa mu munzi gwa Debbe, Timoteya, Tikiko no Tilofimo ba kwilonga lya Asiya kale ba mu bandika nabo. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Kono abo kale ba li tangiza no ka tu lindila mu munzi gwa Tilowasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Iswe kale twa ngina mu bwato u bunene no ku luta iwate ku zwa ekamba lyo munzi gwa Filipiya aa se ku la mani u Mukiti go Binkwa Ta bi Umelwe. Kale twa ka li gwana no bagenzetu mu munzi gwa Tilowasi mi kale twa ka kalamo a majuba ga 7.<figure style="fig" file="SHJ_215wbt - Paul journey 3 [bwf-dark].indd" size="span" ref="18:23–21:17" /><verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi mu munzi gwa Tilowasi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Lyo nsunda kale twa gwanana no bazumini bonse ba mu munzi gwa Tilowasi ku lya u mulalilo go Mfumu Jesu. Paulusi kale ga tandaza a bantu inako inde kakuli kame ka gaja uku funduka mwijuba ili na li nungeko. Kale ga ba tandaza bulyao ku twala akati ko masiku. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Kame ka tu gwananine mu kampetu ka egulu lyo njugo jimwinya umu ka ga li a malambi a mangi aga ka ga jakila. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Unkosana ka kugigwa Yutiko, kame ka kele mwififitele lyo njugo na sukula. Paulusi aa ka kwesi uku tandaza bulyao inako inde, Yutiko kale ga gwila ansi ku zwa ku njugo ja tatu ja egulu lyo majugo ga mwinya, mi kale ba ka mu tola bu fwite. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Paulusi kale ga suka mi kale ga mu kwata no ku mu li zegeka. Kale ga ta a bantu buti, “Mu leke uku joga, mumi!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Kale ba lija ku bogola bonse mu njugo u mu ka ba li no ka li taila u mulalilo go Mfumu Jesu antu-onke. Kale ga ba tandaza bulyao mane ijuba na li ñatula, mi kale ga ba lagana no ku funduka. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />A bantu kale ba twala Yutiko ku munzi gwakwe na joja mi kale ba jangala lwini.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi no bakulu bo bazumini <optbreak />ba mwa Efese</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Iswe kale twa leka Paulusi mi kale twa ngina mu bwato u bunene ku luta ku ja mu munzi gwa Asosi u mu ka tu botele u ka li gwana nage, kakuli ige no matende na ga jenda. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Paulusi aa sa la tu gwani mu munzi gwa Asosi, kale twa ngina nage mu bwato no ku ja mu munzi gwa Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Mwijuba na lya nungako, kale twa ja bu zimbuluka i cikuli ca Kiyosi, mi ijuba ili na lya nungako kale twa luta iwate ku lutila mu cikuli ca Samosi. Mi mwijuba ili na lya nungako, kale twa ka sika mu munzi gwa Mileta.<verse eid="ACT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paulusi aa ka si li mu munzi gwa Tilowasi, sa gaja buti na leke ku ita mu munzi gwa Efese buti na leke ku tagama lwini mwilonga lya Asiya kakuli kame ka welangile ku munzi gwa Jelusalema buti na ka sike mwijuba lyo Mukiti go Pentekota. <verse eid="ACT 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Aa sa la siki mu munzi gwa Mileta, kale ga kuga a bajendesi a bakulu bo bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Efese buti ba keze kwakwe.<verse eid="ACT 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Aa se ba la gwanani, Paulusi kale ga ba ta buti, “Mwense mu li zekelele nenja ubu na nda jojela nenwe, mu majuba gonse aga ka ndi kele nenwe ku zwa mwijuba na nda sika mwilonga lya Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Na nda sebeleza Nyambe mu bugomba mane ime ku lilanga amwinya, kebaka lyo mijeleko i minene jo Majuda aba ka ba ingilanga buti ba ndi talule. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Kono mwense mu li zi buti, byonse byebyo ta bya la ndi kangwisa uku mi tandaza i bintu byonse ibi ka bi mi botele. Ka ndi tandaza no ku mi ziga akati ko bantu, no mu majugo. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Ka ndi nanguza a Majuda mane no Magelike buti ba zokele kwa Nyambe mu nsiguluko no ku leka i bitendantu i bimangoju buti ba be no nzumino mwa Mfumwetu Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />“Cwale aano se ndi la ja kwa Jelusalema ko ku kutika ubu gu ndi tela u Moya go Kucena mi neme ta ndi zi ibi na bi ka tendaale kwangu. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Bulyo buti, mu munzi no munzi, u Moya go Kucena gwa sa ja bu ndi nanguza buti intolongo no makababu bi li ndi shiamine. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Nangaceciba bulyao, ta ndi gaji buti ubumi bwangu bu li kwesi intuso kwangu, mi ta ndi kwesi intaba nabo. Ici ndi shaka, nku maninina u musebezi ugu sa ndi tuma Mfumwangu Jesu, go ku tandaza a majwi a malotu go cisemo ca Nyambe, buti ndi ka sike ku mamaninino go ntandano jangu.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Cwale ndi li zi buti mwense inwe na nda ja bu tandaza u mujojelo u mulotu go mubuso gwa Nyambe, ta mu si ndi boni kame. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Mi nda sa mi gambaguza shunu buti, ta ndi si kwesi u mulandu a muntu gense uju na li fwile. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Kakuli ta na nda sita-sita uku mi gambaguza byo bu a shakila Nyambe bonse.<verse eid="ACT 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />“Mu tonde no ku ligunga. Mu jendese nenja a bantu bonse ba Nyambe sinagwe mulisani a lisa nenja u mugona gwakwe. Kakuli ngo musebezi na gwa mi wa u Moya go Kucena. Mu unele a bazumini ba Nyambe, aba sa li gulila ko malowa ga Mwane. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Kakuli ndi li zi buti aa se ndi la mi leki kuti na ku gwanaale a bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju, aba na ba jone a bazumini. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Mane no mukati kenu, kuti na ku gwanaale a bantu aba na ba futagule a majwi a malotu ga Nyambe, buti ba gwane a bazumini aba ba ba umpilila. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Mu ba libambe, mu zibe buti myaka jo tatwe na nda inda na ndi mi nanguza mwense, a kamwi no masiku mane amwinya ka ndi lilanga kebaka lyo ku mi unela.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Cwale nda sa mi kumbilila kwa Nyambe buti, a mi unele keejwi lyo cisemo cakwe, ili li gola uku mi gongoza no ku mi wa a majobo go ku jobola i bintu ibi na bya lukisezwa a bantu bonse aba na ba cenesegwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />“Ta nda la lumbila u lubono lo bizwato kampa a masheleñi go muntu. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Kono mwense mu li zi buti, ka ndi li muntu a li tendela i bintu ndemwini. Ka ndi sebeza ko maganja gangu, ku li gwanina ibi ka ndi shaka no ku tusangako bagenzangu. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Na nda mi bonisa mu bintu byonse buti ko ku sebeza bulyao, tu li botele uku tusa aba ta ba li goleli. Na tu gaja a majwi sa gamba Mfumwetu Jesu aa sa ta buti, ‘Imfwijaguzi inene mu ku wa ji gwanaala, ku ita mu ku tambula.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Paulusi aa sa la ti bulyao, kale ga tongama nabo bonse, no ku lapela. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Bonse kale ba lila lwini mi kale ba mu kwata no ku mu sonsona. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Kakuli bonse se ka ba li shugwile inse ko majwi gakwe aa ka ba ta buti, nela ta ba si mu boni kame. Mi kale ba mu sindikiza kwikamba buti aka longame mu bwato.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa ja kwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Aa se tu la li tai nabo, kale twa lutila mu cikuli ca Koso. Ijuba na lya nungako, kale twa ka sika kwa Lode. Aa na twa zwamo, kale twa ja mwa Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Kale twa gwana u bwato ka bu ja kwa Fonisiya mi kale twa longamamo. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Aa se ka tu wene i cikuli ca Sipela, kale twa ci timbila ku monsho mi kale twa ka fugikila ekamba lya Taya mwilonga lya Siliya, u mu ka ba botele u ka longolela i bintu ka bu longete u bwato.<verse eid="ACT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Kale twa zwa mu bwato mi kale twa gwana a bazumini. Kale twa kala nabo insunda. Babo a bazumini kale ba bona ko Moya go Kucena buti, Paulusi a leke ku ja ku munzi gwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ku mamaninino go nsunda, kale twa funduka ku ja kwikamba, mi a bazumini bonse ku indilila bulyao a banakazi no banuke, kale ba tu sindikiza kwikamba. Aa tu ka sika kwikamba, kale twa tongama no ku lapela, <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />mi kale twa li lagana. Iswe kale twa ngina mu bwato mi abo kale ba bogola ku munzi gwabo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Aa na twa zwa mu munzi gwa Taya, kale twa ka fugikila u bwato mu munzi gwa Tolemaisi, u mu na twa ka gwana a bazumini bo bankosi no banakazi. Kale twa li zuminiza nabo no ku li buzagula a malongwe mi kale twa kala nabo ijuba mukatumbi. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ijuba ili na lya nungako, kale twa ja mu munzi gwa Sesaleya. Kale twa ka sikila mu njugo ja Filipi, uju ka li mutandazi go majwi a malotu ga Jesu. Ka li jumwinya go bankosi ba 7 aba na ba shaligwa uku tailanga a bantu i bilyo. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Jojo unkosi ka kwesi a bana bone bo bakazana aba ka ba sini ku sesigwa, mi ka ba kwesi impo jo buboni.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Aa se ku la iti a majuba a mace, kale kwa sika unkosi ka kugigwa izina lya Agabbusi, na ka zwila kwilonga lya Judeya. Ka li muboni gwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Kale ga inda u lukaku lwa Paulusi no ku lu li shumina gemwini ku matende no maganja. Mi kale ga ta nage, “U Moya go Kucena mbuti gu co buti, ‘A bajendesi bo Majuda, ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, kuti na ba shumine u mwini lukaku lolu bulyaa no ku mu wa mu nguzu jo bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Aa se tu la shugwi bulyao, iswe no bazumini ba momo mu munzi, kale twa kumbila Paulusi buti a leke ku ja ku munzi gwa Jelusalema.<verse eid="ACT 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Kono Paulusi kale ga taba nage, “Ncinzi mu toloka aa mu lila? Mwa sa ndi shugwisa u bubi ku mojo! Ime ndi li litukiseze uku shuminigwa mu munzi gwa Jelusalema mane no ku fwa kebaka lyo Mfumu Jesu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Aa se tu la boni buti ta zumini uku bindigwa, kale twa li kalila mi kale twa ta buti, “Ku tendaale ubu a shakila Nyambe.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa sika mu munzi gwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Aa se bi la mani byebyo, kale twa litukiseza u lujendo lo ku ja kwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />A bazumini bamwinya ba mu munzi gwa Sesaleya, kale ba tu sindikiza, mi kale ba tu twala kwilapa lyo nkosi ka kugigwa Munasoni uku ka tu botele u ka kala. Ka li jumwinya go bazumini betanzi uju ka zwa mu cikuli ca Sipela. <verse eid="ACT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Aa se tu la ka siki mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, a bazumini bo bankosi no banakazi kale ba tu tambula nenja.<verse eid="ACT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Mwijuba ili na lya nungako, Paulusi kale ga ja ka bona Jakobo mi kale twa ka ja nage. Kale twa ka gwana buti a bakulu bonse bo bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema nko ka ba li. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Aa sa la mani uku ba zuminiza, Paulusi kale ga ba lugwila i bintu byonse ibi sa tenda Nyambe ku bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda, ko ku bi nunga-nunga nenja, aa ka ja bu ba tandaza.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Aa se ba la shugwi byebyo, kale ba lumba Nyambe. Mi kale ba ta Paulusi buti, “Mukwetu, ngo tegeleze. A Majuda aba se ba zumine se mbangi wawa, mi bonse se ba li zundamine u mulao gwa Mushe. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Kono a bazumini bo Majuda ba mo muno mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, se ba shugwa buti igwe gwa sa ja bu ziga a Majuda aba ba joja mu malonga go bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda buti, ba leke uku kutika i milao ja Mushe. Na ba shugwa kame buti gwa sa ba binda uku twala banabo ku mukanda kampa uku umpilila i mijojelo jo bizilantu byetu. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Mbuti sa ka tu tendele aa so la siki? Kakuli a Majuda kuti ba shugwe wangu buti u la siki.<verse eid="ACT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />“Iswe kame tu shaka buti u tende ubu sa ka tu ku tele. Nko ba li a bankosi bone mo muno aba na ba zumina buti ba ngine mu busele bo ku li cenesa antu-onke negwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />U ka je nabo mu tempele u ka li cenese nabo mi u ka life uju sa ka ka ba kulule inshuki. Ko ku tenda bulyao, a bantu bonse kuti ba zibe buti i bintu ka ba shugwanga ibi ko ja bu ziga, ta li mbyaconse no ku ta buti negwe u li kutikite u mulao.<verse eid="ACT 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />“Mi a bazumini aba ta ba li a Majuda, ba li botele uku tenda i bintu ibi se tu ba ñolela mwiñolo umu se tu ba nanguza buti, ba zile i bilyo byo bitagilo bi wegwa ku bibumbantu byo bazimu, ba leke ku lya inyama jo ku ikisa no malowa, ba leke ku lya no nyama jo bipagu byo ku sinigwa ku bikolo-kolo, ba zwe ku cise.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Mwijuba ili na lya nungako, Paulusi kale ga ka ja ku tempele no babo a bankosi bone. Kale ba ka tatika uku li cenesa mi kale ba lugwila a bantu ijuba na ba mane uku li cenesa no ku wa i bitagilo, ku mana inkuluwizi jo majuba go ku li cenesa kwabo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa shuminigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />A majuba ga 7 aa se ka ga shaka uku mana, a Majuda aba ka ba zwa kwilonga lya Asiya kale ba bona Paulusi mu tempele. Kale ba indikiza a bantu ka ba li momo buti ba kwate Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Kale ba kugiliza nabo, “Mwe bantu ba Isilaele, mu keze mu tu tuse! Uju ndo nkosi a ja bu ziga a bantu mu malonga gonse buti ba lwise a bantu ba Isilaele no mulao gwa Mushe bulyao mane kame na ga leta a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda, bo Magelike mu tempele, ku jona-jona injugo jo kucena ja Nyambe.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />(Kale ba gamba bulyao kakuli se ba bona Tilofimo gwa ku munzi gwa Efese na jenda nage mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, mi kale ba gaja buti Paulusi bunga sa ngina nage mu tempele.)<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Kale kwa ba ne nyungani mu munzi gonse mi a bantu bonse kale ba gundumukila kwa Paulusi no ku mu kwata. Kale ba mu kokolola ku mu zwisa mu tempele mi kale ba gala i bizi wangu-wangu.<verse eid="ACT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Aa se ka ba shaka uku mu yaga, kale kwa tumigwa a bantu ku mujendesi u mukulu go masole go Maloma ka mu ta buti, “Ni nyungani ji li mu munzi gwa Jelusalema.” <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Ige kale ga inda a bajendesi bamwinya a bakulu bo masole no ku tigililako. A bantu aa ba bona u mujendesi go masole no masole bakwe, kale ba leka uku kaba Paulusi.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mi u mujendesi u mukulu go masole kale ga keza kwa Paulusi, kale ga mu kwata no ku lugwila a masole buti ba mu shumine ko mawenge gobile. Kale ga buza izina lyakwe buti ndini no ku ta buti ncinzi na ga tenda. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Bamwinya mukati ko bantu kale ba taba bu kumbagana i bintu bi andene-andene mi u mujendesi u mukulu go masole kale ga kangwa uku shugwilisa nenja u bupaki kebaka lyejaba. Kale ga ta buti Paulusi a twaligwe mu njugo ji gongwele jo masole buti ba ka mu galilemo. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Aa se ka ba kokelele a malyatilo go njugo, a masole kale ba nanuna Paulusi kebaka lyo ku joga a bantu buti mane ba mu ba tape, kakuli a bantu se ka ba nyegele lwini. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />A bantu kale ba ba umpilila na ba kumbagana buti, “A yagigwe! A yagigwe!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa gamba ku Majuda</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />A masole aa se ka ba shaka uku nginika Paulusi mu njugo, kale ga gamba ku mujendesi u mukulu go masole nage, “Gwa sa ndi zuminina buti ndi gambe negwe cimwinya?” U mujendesi u mukulu kale ga mu buza nage, “U li zi uku gamba i Cigelike?<verse eid="ACT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />“Ta li ndigwe Muegepita julya sa shaga inkondo no kagugi kakwe ko bantu bo bayagi aba ka ba sika a 4,000, mi sa ja nabo mu mangusu?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulusi kale ga taba nage, “Inga, ime ndi li Mujuda na nda bonenwa mu munzi ugu gu jite impuwo gwa Talese gwa mwilonga lya Silisiya. Nda sa ku kumbila u ndi zuminine ndi gambe no baba a bantu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />U mujendesi u mukulu go masole kale ga mu zuminina. Paulusi kale ga zimana a malyatilo no ku ta a bantu buti ba ombelele. A bantu aa se ba la ombeleli, kale ga gamba nabo mu mushobo go Ciebelu nage.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Bakwangu nenwe mwe bajendesi belonga lyetu, mu ndi tegeleze ndi mi gambaguze ibi na bya tendaala.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />A bantu aa ba shugwa Paulusi na gamba mu Ciebelu, kale ba ombelela lwini. Paulusi kale ga gamba nage, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Ime ndi li Mujuda na nda bonenwa mu munzi gwa Talese gwa mwilonga lya Silisiya. Kono mo muno mu munzi gwa Jelusalema momo na nda kulila. Mi Gamaliele ndege ka li muzigi gwangu u munene. Na ga ndi ziga nenja i milao ji besetu mi ka ndi gongolekeze uku kutika Nyambe sinagwe ndinwe.<verse eid="ACT 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />“Na nda pengisa a baumpilili bo nzigo ja jeji i Nzila jo Mfumu Jesu buti ba fwe, na ndi shumina a bankosi no banakazi no ku ba nginika mu ntolongo, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />u mupulisiti u mukulu, no bajendesi a bakulu bonse bo nkuta, ba la gola uku paka buti ibi ndi gamba mbyaconse, kakuli mbabo se ba ndi wa a mañolo buti ndi twale ku bakwetu bo Majuda ba mu munzi gwa Damaseka. Kale nda ka ja buti ndi ka shumine a bazumini no ka ba leta bu shuminwe mu munzi gwa Jelusalema buti ba keze ba bangisigwe.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa sukulula byo nsiguluko jakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“A kamwi aa ka ndi li mu lujendo bulyao mi se ka ndi kokelele mu munzi gwa Damaseka, kale nda bona u lumuni lu besa ku zwa kwigulu mi ituba lyalo kale lya ndi munika. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Kale nda gwila ansi mi kale nda shugwa ijwi ili ka li ndi ta buti, ‘Saule! Saule! Ncinzi u ndi pengisiza?’<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />“Kale nda mu buza buti, ‘Ndigweni Mfumwangu?’ Ige kale ga ndi taba nage,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">“ ‘Ndime Jesu gwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta, uju u pengisa.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />A ba ka ndi jenda nabo, kale ba bona u lumuni kono ta na ba shugwilisa ijwi lyo muntu ka gamba neme.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />“Kale nda mu buza buti, ‘Mfumwangu, ncinzi u shaka buti ndi tende?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">“Kale ga ndi ta buti, ‘Zimana u ka sikilile mu munzi gwa Damaseka mi kuti no ka gambaguzwe byonse ibi u botele uku tenda.’<verse eid="ACT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />“Aba ka ndi jenda nabo, kale ba ndi kwata kwiganja no ku ndi jendesa ku ndi twala mu munzi gwa Damaseka. Kale ba tenda bulyao kakuli ta ka ndi si wene kebaka lyetuba na lya ndi zima a mensho. <verse eid="ACT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Mu munzi gwa Damaseka, mo ka li u muzumini go nkosi ka kugigwa Ananiyasi, mi ka kutika u mulao gwa Mushe. Ka kutikigwa ku Majuda bonse ba mu munzi gwa Damaseka. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Kale ga keza ku ndi zimana kumbali no ku ndi ta buti, ‘Saule mukwangu, tonda mi u bone kame.’ Aobulyo, kale nda tonda kame mi kale nda gola uku mu bona.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />“Ananiyasi kale ga ndi ta buti, ‘Nyambe uju ka ba lapela basukuzetu, na ga ku shala buti u zibe ibi a shaka, no ku bona Uju a Lulikile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uju a Lulikile. Gogu u mugambilo ndi Jesu gu ta.</char></note> mi u shugwe ibi a gamba. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kuti no be umpaki gwakwe ku bantu bonse, ko bintu na gwa shugwa no ku bona. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Cwale u leke ku nangisa, zimana u kolobezigwe mi u sanzigwe ku bitendantu i bimangoju byako ko ku kuga ezina lyakwe.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Aa se ndi la bogoli ku munzi gwa Jelusalema, aa ka ndi lapela mu tempele, kale nda bona i cibonwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Kale nda bona u Mfumu Jesu mi kale ga ndi ta buti, ‘Welanga! U zwe mo muno mu munzi gwa Jelusalema kakuli a bantu ta ba ku tegeleze aa so ko ba gambaguze byangu.’<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />“Ime kale nda mu taba buti, ‘Mfumwangu, a bantu bonse ba li ndi zi buti ndime ka ndi ja bu ita mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda gonse na ndi ja bu inda a bantu aba ka ba zumina kwako, na ndi ba kaba no ku ba tula mu ntolongo. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Mane naa ka ba yaga umpaki gwako Setefani, neme mpo ka ndi li, na ndi shakite neme buti a yagigwe. Ndime ka ndi mamela i bizwato byo bankosi aba ka ba mu yaga.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Bitendantu 7:58</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />“Mi u Mfumu Jesu kale ga ndi ta buti, ‘Zwamo bulyo, kakuli kuti na ndi ku tume u kule ku malonga go bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />A bantu kale ba mu tegeleza ku twala aa sa la gambi bulyao. Kale ba tatika uku kumbagana nabo, “U mu yage bulyo! U muntu gwa bulyao, ta botele uku joja, a zwe mwilonga.” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Kale ba tenda ijaba lwini mane kale ba jabula no bizwato byabo no ku sukumwina isukwe mwigulu.<verse eid="ACT 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">U musole u mukulu go Muloma <optbreak />aa buzagula Paulusi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />U mujendesi u mukulu go masole kale ga ta a masole buti, ba twale Paulusi mu njugo ji gongwele. Kale ga ba ta buti ba mu lwapagule. No ku ta buti ba mu buzagule buti ba zibe buti ncinzi a bantu aa ka ba mu tendela ijaba bulyao. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Aa se ka ba shaka uku mu kaba, Paulusi kale ga ta u mujendesi go masole nage, “Izo u mulao gu la zuminina uku lwapagula u Muloma uju ta la gwaninwa nanga mulandu?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />U mujendesi go masole aa sa la shugwi bulyao kale ga lugwila u mujendesi u mukulu go masole nage, “Mbuti so ko tendele? Joju unkosi Muloma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />U mujendesi u mukulu go masole, kale ga ja kwa Paulusi no ka mu buza nage, “Ndi lugwile, u li Muloma?” Paulusi kale ga mu taba nage, “Ee, ndi li Muloma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />U mujendesi u mukulu go masole kale ga ta nage, “Ime na nda lifa a masheleñi a mangi buti ndi be u Muloma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Kono Paulusi kale ga mu ta buti, “Kono ime ndi li Muloma wawa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Aba ka ba shaka uku mu kaba, kale ba gena mi kale ba mu leka. U mujendesi u mukulu go masole kale ga joga aa bona buti a la shumini u Muloma.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa zekisigwa mu nkuta</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Ijuba na lya nungako, u mujendesi u mukulu go masole, kale ga ta a mapulisiti a bakulu mane no manduna bonse bo nkuta buti ba keze ba gambe ibi ka ba shangeza Paulusi a Majuda. Kale ga leta Paulusi no ku mu zimika mukati kabo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulusi kale ga lolelela a bajendesi bonse bo nkuta no ku ta buti, “Bakwangu, ndi li li shugwile nenja ku mojo gwangu mane ku leta no shunu-aano kakuli se ndi la joja ubu a shakila Nyambe.”<verse eid="ACT 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />U mupulisiti u mukulu Ananiyasi aa shugwa bulyao, kale ga ta a bantu aba ka ba zimene kumbali no Paulusi buti ba mu kabe ku kanwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Kono Paulusi kale ga mu ta buti, “Nyambe kuti na ku kabe negwe, nanga no kozete imota lyo ku lomba no mubala go ku tuba! U li muatuli gwa buti igwe? Ndigwe u shaka ku ndi atula ko mulao kono kame ndigwe u shwauza u mulao ko ku ta a bantu buti ba ndi kabe!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Aba ka ba zimene ambali no Paulusi kale ba mu ta nabo, “Igwe gwa sa shwauza bulyao u mupulisiti u mukulu gwa Nyambe?”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paulusi kale ga ba ta buti, “Bakwangu ta ka ndi zi buti ka li mupulisiti u mukulu, kakuli mbuti ku ñolelwe buti, ‘U leke ku gamba a majwi a mamangoju ku muntu gense uju a mi jendesa.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Lujendo 22:28</ref>.</char></note> ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Paulusi ko ku zekelela buti a bantu bamwinya mu nkuta ka ba li Bafalisi mi bamwinya ka ba li Basaduki, kale ga kugiliza nage, “Bakwangu, ime ndi li Mufalisi mane no basukulu bonse Mbafalisi. Kame ndi zekisigwa kebaka lyo nsepo jangu jo ku ta buti kuti na ku be ne mbuko jo bafu.”<figure style="fig" alt="Paul before the council in Jerusalem" file="dn00511b.jpg" size="span" loc="Act 23:1-8" copy="Dunham" ref="23:1-8">Paulusi a nkuta mwa Jelusalema</figure><verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Aa sa la gambi bulyao, kale kwa ba ne nkokani mukati ko Bafalisi no Basaduki, mi kale ba kangwa uku shugwana. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Kakuli a Basaduki kame ka ba zumina buti, takuli imbuko jo bafu, no ku ta buti takuli a mañiloi mi takuli i myoya jo bafu ji joja. Kono a Bafalisi abo ka ba bi zumina byonse byebyo.<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Kale kwa ba ne jaba inene lyo nkokani mi a bazigi bamwinya bo mulao aba ka ba li Bafalisi kale ba zimana no ku kanana wawa nabo, “Ta tu la gwani u mulandu kwa joju u muntu, aa ku shaka bunga moya kampa ndi ñiloi na lya gambagula nage!” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Inkokani kale ja nenea lwini mi u mujendesi u mukulu go masole kale ga joga mi kale ga gaja buti bunga a bantu kuti ba ñatagule Paulusi ku mu tenda i bituntula. Kale ga ta a masole buti ba mu inde mukati kabo no ka mu tula mu njugo ji gongwele jo majojelo.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Gago a masiku u Mfumu Jesu kale ga keza ku li bonaaza kwa Paulusi no ku mu ta buti, “Paulusi, U leke ku joga! Ubu so gambila byangu mu munzi gwa Jelusalema mbobo no ka gambile byangu no mu munzi gwa Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Majuda aa ba ingila uku yaga Paulusi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Aa na bwaca a Majuda bamwinya kale ba gaja buti ba yage Paulusi. Kale ba zumininana no ku li konka buti ba leke uku lya i cilyo kampa uku nywa i cinywantu mbwita na ba yagile Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Ka ba li bankosi aba ka ba itilila a makumi gone aba na ba zumininana bulyao. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Kale ba ja ku mapulisiti a bakulu no bajendesi ka ba ta buti, “Na twa li konka buti ta na tu lye i cilyo uku na tu sini ku yaga Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Cwale inwe no baatuli bonse bo nkuta mu kumbile ku mujendesi u mukulu go masole buti a lete Paulusi mu nkuta, na mu tenda sinagwe kame mu shaka uku buzagula bimwinya a ntaba jakwe. Iswe tu li litukiseze uku mu yagila mu nzila na sini ku sika a nkuta.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Kono mwana nciye gwa Paulusi go nkosana aa shugwa gogo mutendelo, kale ga ja ku njugo ji gongwele jo masole no ka nginamo ka gambaguza Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Paulusi kale ga kuga u mujendesi jumwinya u mukulu go masole, no ku mu ta buti, “U twale joju unkosana ku mujendesi u mukulu, kakuli nko ci li ici a shaka uku mu lugwila.”<verse eid="ACT 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Ige kale ga mu inda no ku mu twala ku mujendesi u mukulu go masole no ku ta buti, “U mupantiti gwezina lya Paulusi a la ndi kumbili buti ndi ku letele joju unkosana kakuli a li kwesi ici a shaka uku ku lugwila.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />U mujendesi u mukulu go masole kale ga kwata jojo unkosana kwiganja no ku ja nage kumbali mi kale ga mu buza nage, “Ncinzi u shaka uku ndi lugwila?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Jojo unkosana kale ga mu lugwila nage, “A Majuda na ba zumininana buti ba kumbile Paulusi kwako buti no mu twale ku nkuta ijona na ba tenda sinagwe kame ba shaka ka shakisisa nenja a ntaba jakwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Kono igwe no leke ku zumina kakuli nko ba li a bankosi bo makumi gone aba na ba mu bikamine buti ba mu yage. Na ba li konka buti ta na ba lye i cilyo kampa uku nywa i cinywantu ku twala aa na ba yagile Paulusi. Mbulyo ba lindile ubu so ko no ba tele. Cwale no leke uku zumina.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />U mujendesi u mukulu go masole kale ga ta jojo unkosana buti a bogole mi kale ga mu ta buti, “U leke uku lugwila u muntu buti u la ndi lugwili cimwinya!”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa twaligwa kwilonga lya Sesaleya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />U mujendesi go masole kale ga kuga a masole bo bile aba ka ba mu landa ku citulo no ku ba ta buti, “Mu litukise, mu gwanike a masole ba 200 no bankosi bo makumi ga 7, aba ba zekelele uku paama a mishana jo bambizi bo ku muna, mane no ba 200 aba ba jenda ansi bo nkwengo, na mu nanuke ko nako ja 9 jo masiku ku twala Paulusi kwilonga lya Sesaleya. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Mu shake no bambizi bo ku muna aa sa ka na paame Paulusi, na mu mu twale ku mubusisi Felekisi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />U musole u mukulu kale ga ñola iñolo li ta buti,<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Ime nde Kilaude Lisiyasi,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 23:26">Nda sa ku ñolela igwe gwe mubusisi u kutekea Felekisi, u joje nenja! <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Jojo u muntu Majuda na ba mu kwata mi se ka ba shaka uku mu yaga, kono kale nda keza no masole keza ku mu lamwina, kakuli na nda ziba buti Muloma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Ko ku shaka uku ziba ici na ga fosa, kale nda mu twala mu nkuta jabo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Mi kale nda ka gwana buti mbulyo ka ba mu shangeza i bintu byo mulao gwabo. Kono ta na kwa gwanigwa u mulandu ugu ka botelwe uku yagilwa kampa uku tulilwa mu ntolongo. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Aa se ndi la zibisigwa buti a Majuda kame ba shaka uku mu yaga kale nda gaja buti ndi mu tumine wangu kwako. Ndi la ti no bashangezi bakwe uku leta intongausi jabo jo bintu ba mu shangeza kwako.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />A masole aa se ba la tumigwa bulyao, kale ba inda Paulusi gago a masiku no ku mu twala ku munzi gu kugigwa Antipatili. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Aa na bwaca, aba ka ba jenda no matende kale ba bogwela ku njugo jabo ji gongwele uku ka ba zwa, mi kale ba leka a masole aba ka ba paamite a bambizi bo ku muna buti ba ka mu sikilize. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Aa se ba la ka mu sikisi kwilonga lya Sesaleya, kale ba ka wa u mubusisi Felekisi iñolo, mane no ka lekako Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />U mubusisi aa sa la mani uku bala iñolo, kale ga buza Paulusi buti mwilonga libo a zwa. Paulusi kale ga mu taba nage, “Mwilonga lya Silisiya.”<verse eid="ACT 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Felekisi kale ga mu ta buti “Kuti na ndi gambagule intaba jako aa sa ka na ba sike a bashangezi bako.” Mi kale ga ta buti ba mu mamele na kele mu munzi go mfumu Eloda.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Felekisi aa zekisa Paulusi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Paulusi aa sa la ka mani a majuba ga 5 mu munzi gwa Sesaleya, Ananiyasi uju ka li mupulisiti u mukulu kale ga mu umpako na jenda no bakulu bo nkuta jo Majuda mane no Tetuliyasi uju ka zekelele u mulao. Kale ba gambaguza u mubusisi ibi na ga fosa Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />U mubusisi uju ka kugigwa Felekisi kale ga tuma a bantu buti ba ka inde Paulusi. Aa sa la siki, Tetuliyasi kale ga tatika uku gamba nage, “Twa sa litumela kwako gwe mubusisi kakuli u la tu jendesa nenja mi mane na twa kala inako inde bu liketete. Ko bujendesi u bulotu bwako gwa sa tendela ilonga lyetu i bintu i bingi. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Mu bibaka byonse byelonga lyetu, tu la litumela kwako Felekisi gwe muntu-awa. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ko ku sa ku koteza, nda sa ku kumbila ko cisemo cako buti u tu tegeleze mu nako imfuwi bulyo.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />“Na twa bona buti, joju unkosi ni ntembeka, uju a ja bu shaga inkondo ku Majuda mu bibaka byonse. Nde mujendesi u mukulu go kagugi ko bantu ka ba zwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta, aba ba zumina kwa Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Ga sa shwaaguza no tempele jetu, mpaa na twa mu kwata no ku mu shumina mi ka tu shaka ku mu atula ko ku umpilila ubu gu co u mulao gwetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Kono u mujendesi u mukulu go masole Lisiyasi, kale ga keza ku mu tu tapa ko nguzu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 7.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />no ku ta buti a keze kwako mane neswe bulyao. Cwale u mu li buzagwile gwemwini buti u li shugwile negwe i bintu tu mu tongauka buti mbyaconse.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />A Majuda bamwinya kale ba gamba ku gongolekeza nabo a bintu byonse ibi a la gambi Tetuliyasi, buti mbobo bi kalile.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa li gambilila mu nkuta ja Felekisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />U mubusisi kale ga ta Paulusi buti a gambe. Ige kale ga taba nage, “Ndi li zi buti so li kwesi i myaka i mingi no busa le lino ilonga no ku atula a mataba, mi ndi li jangele aa ndi gamba ku li lamwina ku bintu ba ndi ambika buti negwe u li shugwile. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ku sini ku ita a majuba ga 12 ku zwa aa na nda jila mu munzi gwa Jelusalema ku ka lapela. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Aba ba ndi zekisa ta ba la ndi gwana ndi li kanana no bantu mu tempele, kampa uku ja bu shaga inkondo mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda kampa mu munzi. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Mi ta ba goli uku ku sunda u bupaki bo bintu ibi ba ndi ambika.<verse eid="ACT 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />“Nanganceciba, ndi la zumina buti ndi Nyambe gu basukuzetu ndi lapela ko kuba u muumpilili go nzigo jo Nzila jo Mfumu Jesu, iji ba ta buti nja manya. Ndi la zumina i bintu byonse ibi bi jendelela no mulao ne bi na bya ñolegwa mu mabuka go baboni ba Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Neme ndi Nyambe ndi sepete ubu ba mu sepele nabo mi ndi li lindile bu sepete buti kuti na ku be no mbuko jo bantu ba lulikile no babi. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Mi nda sa li gongoza inako jonse buti u mojo gwangu gu kale nenja kwa Nyambe no ku bantu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Aa se ndi la ka kali i myaka i mingi ku malonga a mangi, kale nda ka bogola kwa Jelusalema ku leta a matuso ku bakwangu a bampale no keza ku wa i bitagilo kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Na nda li cenesa ku ja ko bu ka gu tela u mulao aa ba ndi gwana mu tumpetu to tempele na ndi tenda bulyao. Takuli a bantu a bangi aba ka ba kele neme, mi takuli ici ka ndi tembeka. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Kono nko ba li a Majuda bamwinya ba mwilonga lya Asiya, mbabo ka ba botele uku ba mo muno mu nkuta, buti ba zeke neme a bintu ibi ba ndi ambika. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Kampa baba ba limo muno mu nkuta jako ba gambe u mulandu ugu na ba ndi gwanina aa na ba ndi zekisa mu nkuta jabo. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Icintu conke na nda gamba mu nkuta jabo nca ku ta buti, ‘Kuti na ku be ne mbuko jo bafu.’ Bunga nce cintu ndi botele uku zekisezwa bulyo aano shunu buti u ndi atule.”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Felekisi uju ka zekelele nenja byo nzigo jo Nzila jo Mfumu Jesu, kale ga timbila intaba ku majuba ga keza. Kale ga ta nage, “Lisiyasi u mujendesi u mukulu go masole aa na sike, kuti na ndi lole intaba jenu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Kale ga ta u mujendesi go musole buti a mamele Paulusi. Mi kale ga mu ta buti ba leke ku mu shumina mi ba zuminine a basele bakwe u keza ku mu tusanga ku bintu a bulite.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Aa se ku la iti a majuba a mace, Felekisi kale ga keza kame no mukazi gwakwe Dulusila uju ka li Mujuda. Kale ga tuma a bantu buti ba ka kuge Paulusi buti ba gambagule nage. Paulusi kale ga ba gambaguza byo nzumino mwa Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Paulusi aa se ka gambaguza u mubusisi byo ku joja u bumi bu botete, no ku ligunga mane no byo nkatulo iji ji keza, Felekisi kale ga joga mi kale ga ta Paulusi buti, “Nela, u lekelao shunu. Kuti na ndi ku kuge kame aa na ndi gwane inako.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Ku zwao Felekisi se ka kuganga Paulusi na ba gambagula na gajanga buti bunga Paulusi kuti a mu we a masheleñi mu buzinda buti a manise intaba jakwe.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Aa se ku la iti i myaka jo bile, Posiyasi Fesitasi kale ga ba u mubusisi ku jobola Felekisi. Kono Felekisi ko ku shaka uku jangaza a Majuda, kale ga leka Paulusi mu ntolongo bulyao.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi mu nkuta ja Fesitasi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Kale kwa ita a majuba go tatwe ku zwa Fesitasi aa na ga sikila mu munzi gwa Sesaleya, ku zwao kale ga ja ku munzi gwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />A mapulisiti a bakulu no bajendesi a bakulu bo Majuda kale ba gwanana no keza kwa Fesitasi keza ku mu gambaguza i bintu ibi na ga ba fosekeza Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Kale ba kumbila Fesitasi buti a ba tende nenja ko ku zumina buti Paulusi a bogozwe kwa Jelusalema kanti kame ka ba gajite uku mu bikamina mu nzila buti ba mu yage. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Kono Fesitasi kale ga ba taba nage, “Paulusi a li botele uku kala tanzi mu munzi gwa Sesaleya mi ime nge nde ku bogolako aano. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Mu leke a bajendesi benu ba ka je neme ati Paulusi nko ci li ici na ga fosa na mu ka mu zekisezeko.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesitasi kale ga kala nabo a majuba ga 8 kampa ge kumi mi kale ga bogola kwa Sesaleya. Mwijuba ili na lya nungako, Fesitasi kale ga kala mu cikalo cakwe co bumfumu mi kale ga ta a bantu buti ba lete Paulusi mu nkuta. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paulusi aa sa la siki, a bajendesi bo Majuda aba ka ba zwa ku munzi gwa Jelusalema kale ba zimana no ku mu shangeza i bintu i bingi ibi ta ka ba kwatile u bupaki.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Kono Paulusi kale ga li gambilila nage, “Ta na nda tenda i cintu i cimangoju co ku sa kutika u mulao go bakwangu a Majuda mi ta na nda fosekeza i tempele kampa Sesale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Cwale Fesitasi ko ku shaka uku jangaza a Majuda, kale ga buza Paulusi nage, “U la shaka uku ja ku munzi gwa Jelusalema buti ndi ka ku zekisezeko?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Kono Paulusi kale ga taba nage, “Se ndi li zimene mu nkuta ja Sesale, u mu ndi botele uku zekisezwa. Takuli ici na nda fosekeza a Majuda sinagwe aa u zekelele negwe bulyao. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Ati i bintu na nda tenda bi li botele u lufu, ta ndi kani uku fwa. Kono ati i bintu ba ndi shangeza mbya manya, takuli uju a gola uku ndi tambika ku bantu aba ba ndi zekisa buti ba ka ndi yage. Nda sa li kumbilila buti intaba jangu ji twaligwe ku nkuta ja Sesale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Fesitasi aa sa la gambaguli no bagenze bo nkuta, kale ga gamba nage, “U la li kumbilili uku twala intaba jako ku nkuta ja Sesale, kuti no jeko!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fesitasi aa gambagula no mfumu Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Aa se ku la iti a majuba a mace bulyo, u mfumu Agilipa kale ga sika no Bbelenisi mwa Sesaleya keza ku bona Fesitasi <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Mu majuba ka ba si kele, Fesitasi kale ga gambaguza u mfumu Agilipa intaba ja Paulusi. Kale ga mu ta nage, “Nkwali u mupantiti go nkosi mu ntolongo uju sa lekamo Felekisi. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Aa na nda ja ku munzi gwa Jelusalema, a mapulisiti a bakulu no bakulu bo Majuda kale ba ndi kumbila buti ndi mu atule a bintu ka ba mu shangeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Kale nda ba ta buti u mulao go Ciloma ta gu wi u muntu u mulandu uku na sini uku zeka. A li botele uku wegwa a kaito ko ku zeka no bashangezi bakwe buti a li lamwine gemwini ku milandu ba mu shumina kajo.<verse eid="ACT 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />“Aba ka ba mu shangeza aa se ba la siki ko kuno, ta na nda jona inako. Kale nda ba ta buti intaba na ji gambigwe ijuba na li nungeko. Kale nda ta buti Paulusi a letigwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Aa se ba zimana buti ba gambe, kale ba kangwa uku gamba ici na ga fosa Paulusi ici ka ndi gajite uku shugwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Kono Paulusi mbya nkosi uju sa fwa uju ka kugigwa Jesu ka gamba buti mumi mi kame ka ba li kanana ko ku ja ubu ka ba zuminine. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Aa se ndi la kangwi uku shakisisa intaba ubu na ja jendela kale nda buza Paulusi buti a la shaka uku ja ku munzi gwa Jelusalema ka zekelako i bintu ka ba mu shangeza. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Kono Paulusi kale ga kana mi kale ga li kumbilila buti aka zekele intaba jakwe ku mfumu u mukulu Sesale. Kale nda ta u musole buti a mu mamele ku twala aa na ndi te buti a twaligwe kwa Sesale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agilipa kale ga ta Fesitasi nage, “Nda sa shaka uku mu li shugwila neme jojo nkosi.” Fesitasi kale ga mu taba nage, “Kuti no mu li shugwile ijona.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa gambagula no mfumu Agilipa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Mwijuba ili na lya nungako, Agilipa no Bbelenisi kale ba keza ku ngina ko bumfumu mu nkuta. Mi a bajendesi a bakulu bo masole no bantu a bakulu ba mu munzi gwa Sesaleya, kale ba ba bandika. Fesitasi kale ga ta a bantu buti ba lete Paulusi mu nkuta. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesitasi kale ga ta nage, “Gwe mfumu Agilipa mane nenwe mwe bantu mu kele neswe shunu, mu li mu wene joju unkosi! A Majuda bonse ba sa mu tongauka, na ba letanga intongausi jabo kwangu mu munzi gwa Jelusalema mane no mu munzi gwa Sesaleya, na ba indikile buti ta botele uku joja. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Kono ime na nda bona buti takuli ici na ga tenda ici a botele uku fwila, kono kakuli kame ka shaka u ka zekela intaba jakwe kwa Sesale, ime na nda zumina buti a twaligwe mu munzi gwa Loma.<verse eid="ACT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />“Kono ta ndi kwesi nenja u bupaki momu mu ntaba mi takuli ibi ndi botele uku ñolela u mfumu u mukulu Sesale. Mpaa ndi la mu leti kwako wawa Agilipa mane nenwe mwense. Buti aa so la shakisisi nenja intaba neme ndi zibe ubu sa ka ndi ñolele. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kakuli ndi la gaja buti ta ku botele uku tuma ipantiti ku munzi gwa Loma uku takuli u bupaki bweñolo li sunda ibi na ga fosa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa li gambilila kwa Agilipa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Cwale Agilipa kale ga ta Paulusi nage, “Twa sa ku zuminina uku li gambilila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:1">Paulusi kale ga zimika iganja mwigulu no ku tatika uku gamba nage, <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Gwe mfumu Agilipa, ndi li jangele aa ndi zimene shunu no ku wegwa inako jo ku taba no ku li lamwina ku bintu ba ndi shangeza a Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Ndi li zi buti igwe u li zekelele nenja i bizo no mijojelo jo Majuda. Cwale nda sa ku kumbila buti u ndi tegeleze ko mojo gonke.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“A Majuda bonse ba li ndi zekelele nenja ku zwa ku bwanuke bwangu, kame ba li zi u bumi bwangu bwetanzi mukati ko bakwangu u mu na nda kulila mane no mu munzi gwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Na ba ndi ziba mu nako inde, mi ba la gola uku paka ati ba la shaka, ba la gola uku zumina buti na nda joja sinagwe Mufalisi, uju ka gongolekeze kwe bi ka ba zumina. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Kono aano se ndi la zekisigwa shunu kakuli se ndi li zumine ku nkuluwizi iji sa kuluwiza Nyambe ku basukuzetu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Mi ni nkuluwizi iji ga sepete a maasi ge kumi no go bile ga Isilaele, mi a kamwi no masiku ga li zundamine uku sebeleza Nyambe, mi kuti na ga bone jejo inkuluwizi ji vumbilizwa. Mi igwe gwe mfumu Agilipa, mbebyo ba ndi zekiseza a Majuda byebyo. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Cwale ncinzi inwe mwense aa mu kangwa uku shugwilisa buti Nyambe ga sa busa a bafu?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Ime wawa ka ndi gajanga no ku tenda ubu ka ndi golela bonse uku lwisa a bazumini aba ka ba zumina mwizina lya Jesu gwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Kale nda tenda bulyao mu munzi gwa Jelusalema mi mane ko ku wegwa inguzu ku zwa ku mapulisiti a bakulu na nda tula a bazumini a bangi mu ntolongo, mi aa ka ba ba atwilanga u lufu no ku yagigwa, neme ka ndi zuminanga buti mbobo. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />U bungi bo nako ka ndi janga mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda na ndi bangisa a bazumini mane no ku ba indikiza buti ba shwauze bya Jesu. Ka ndi lulilwe lwini buti mane se ka ndi janga no ku minzi ja kungi jo bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda ka ja bu ba pengisa.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Ijuba limwinya, gwe mfumwangu Agilipa, aa ka ndi li mu lujendo lo ku ja ku munzi gwa Damaseka, ko nguzu na nda wegwa ku zwa ku mapulisiti a bakulu, <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />a kamwi aa ka ndi kwesi uku jenda bulyao, gwe mfumu Agilipa, kale nda bona u lumuni lu zwa kwigulu lu munika lwini, ku ita ituba lyejuba aa ka tu jendela no bagenzangu. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Kale twa gwila ansi twense mi kale nda shugwa ijwi ka li gamba mu mushobo go Ciebelu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">U bungi bo mabuka go Cikuwa mu mushobo go Cialamaiki na ba ga kopisa. Kono gogo u mushobo, gwa sa shaka uku li koza no mushobo go Ciebelu.</char></note> ka li ndi ta buti, ‘Saule, Saule, ncinzi u ndi pengisiza? Mbugelo! To botele uku ndi lwisa!’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Cigelike kame ku ta buti mbukababu kwako no kushisha uku laa itende lyako ku muwayo!</char></note><verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />“Kale nda buza neme, ‘Ndigweni mfumwangu?’ Ige kale ga ndi taba nage,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:15">“ ‘Ndime Jesu uju kwesi uku pengisa. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Cwale u zimane kakuli ndi la li bonaazi kwako ku ku shala buti u be u muika gwangu no mpaki buti u je bu gambaguza bamwinya byo bintu u la boni mane ne bi na ndi ku sunde ku majuba ga keza. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Kuti na ndi ku lamwine ku bakwako a Majuda mane no ku bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda. Nda sa ku tuma kwabo <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />buti u ka ba sunde ubu ba botele uku zwila mu kansindwe no ku ja mwituba, no ku ba zwisa mu nguzu ja Satani no ku sigulukila kwa Nyambe, buti ba tambule inkwatilo jo bitendantu i bimangoju no cibaka mukati ko bantu na ba cenesegwa ko nzumino mwangu.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Cwale gwe mfumu Agilipa, aa se ndi la boni bulyao kale nda kangwa uku shwauza i cibonwa ka ci zwa kwigulu. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Kale nda tandaza tanzi ku bantu ba mu munzi gwa Damaseka mane no ba mwa Jelusalema no ba mwilonga lya Judeya, mane no ku bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda. Ka ndi ba tandaza buti ba sigulukile kwa Nyambe no ku leka i bitendantu i bimangoju byabo no ku bonisa u bumi u bulotu. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Mbyebyo na ba ndi kwatila a Majuda mu tumpetu to tempele no ku jeleka buti ba ndi yage. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Kono Nyambe na ga ndi tusa mane ku leta shunu, mi ndi li zimene aano ku paka ku bantu bonse aba ba kwesi u lubono no bampale. Mi ibi ndi ziga ta bi shwaaguzi ibi se ba bona a baboni ba Nyambe mane ne bi sa gamba Mushe. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Buti u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe kuti na penge no ku ta buti ndege na be gwe tanzi uku buka ku zwa ku bafu no ku leta ituba ku bakwakwe a Majuda mane no bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Paulusi aa ka si gamba bulyao, Fesitasi kale ga kugiliza lwini nage, “Paulusi, so la pakumuka wawa! I bintu na gwa li ziga, se bi la ku pakumukisa!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Paulusi kale ga mu taba nage, “Fesitasi gwe muntu-awa, ta ndi pakumuki, mbyaconse ndi gamba, ta li mbya manya. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Ndi li zi buti u mfumu Agilipa a li zekelele i bintu ndi gamba mi ndi li lukuluwite uku gamba nage, kakuli ta na bya tendelwa mu buzinda. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Agilipa gwe mfumu, izo u la zumina ibi na ba bona no ku gamba a baboni ba Nyambe? Ndi li zi buti u la bi zumina.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agilipa kale ga taba Paulusi nage, “Kame u gaja buti u la gola uku ndi indikiza uku ba u muntu a zumine kwa Jesu mu nako imfuwi bulyo?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulusi kale ga mu zola nage, “Mu nako imfuwi kampa inde, intapelo jangu kwa Nyambe nkuta buti igwe mane no bantu bonse aba ba ndi tegeleze mu zumine ubu ndi zuminine, ku zwisako bulyo jeji impambo ndi shuminwe kajo.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />U mfumu Agilipa mane no mubusisi Fesitasi no Bbelenisi mane na ba ka ba kele nabo, kale ba zimana. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Kale ba zwa mu nkuta no ka li gambaguza mwalyabo nabo, “Joju nkosi takuli ici na ga fosa ici a botele uku yagilwa kampa uku tulilwa mu ntolongo.”<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agilipa kale ga lugwila Fesitasi nage, “Joju unkosi ka botele uku shumununwa no ku zwisigwa mu ntolongo kali ta na la li kumbilili u ka zekela intaba jakwe ku mfumu u mukulu Sesale.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa luta iwate ku ja ku munzi gwa Loma</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Inako aa se ji la siki jo ku luta iwate ku lutila kwilonga lya Italiya, Paulusi no mapantiti bamwinya kale ba wegwa ku mujendesi go masole bo mfumu go Maloma Sesale, uju ka kugigwa Juliyasi. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Kale twa jendelela no Alisitako uju ka zwa mu munzi gwa Tesalonika, gwa mwilonga lya Masedoniya. Kale twa ngina mu bwato u bunene ubu ka bu zwa kwa Adalamiti ubu ka bu botele uku ja bu ita mu makamba gonse gelonga lya Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Ijuba na lya nungako, kale twa ka fugikila ekamba lya Sidoni mi Juliyasi ko cisemo cakwe kwa Paulusi, kale ga mu zuminina buti a ka bone a basele bakwe buti ba ka mu we ku bintu ibi ka bulite. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Kale twa fugula ku zwa mwa Sidoni, mi kakuli ta ka tu zuga nenja u bwato kebaka lyo nkuli ka ji tu kakite, kale twa ku kumba kumbali no cikuli ca Sipela. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Kale twa luta iwate ku itilila ilonga lya Silisiya no Pamfiliya mi kale twa ka fugikila ekamba lya Mila, u munzi gwa mwilonga lya Lisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Momo u mujendesi go masole kale ga gwana u bwato u bunene bwa ku munzi gwa Alekizandiliya gwa mwilonga lya Egepita ubu ka bu ja kwilonga lya Italiya mi kale ga tu longamo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Kale twa inda a majuba a mangi na tu zuga mu bukababu kebaka lyo ku kakigwa ku nkuli kono kale twa ka sika afuwi no munzi gwa Kinido. Kale twa kangwa uku fugika kebaka lyo nkuli. Aobulyo kale twa zuga ku ja kumbali no cikuli ca Kileta mi kale twa ci kukumba bulyao mane na tu ka sika kwiko lya Salumoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Kale twa ja bu zuga bu kukumba i cikuli bulyao mu bukababu mane na tu ka sika a cibaka ci kugigwa a Mafugikilo a Malotu, afuwi no munzi gwa Laseya. <verse eid="ACT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Na twa jona lwini inako mi uku zuga mwiwate se ka bu li bujoge kebaka lyo nkuli, kame ne Juba lyo nkwatilo jo bitendantu i bimangoju se ka li manite. Paulusi kale ga ba nanguza nage,<verse eid="ACT 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Bakwangu, ime ndi liwene buti u lujendo lwetu lo ku zwa aano, se lu la jogesa. Kuti ku be no ku jonekelwa ko bintu tu indite no bwato mane no ku bumi bwetu bulyao.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Kono u mujendesi go masole kale ga tegeleza kwe bi ka gamba u mwini bwato mane no muzugi go bwato. Kale ga kangwa uku tegeleza kwe bi ka gamba Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Mi kakuli ikamba u mu ka ba fugikile ta ka li li ilotu uku fugikamo u bwato a mweo, u bungi bo bantu kale ba gaja buti ba zwemo no ku li kuluwiza buti ba ka fugikile kwikamba lya mu munzi gwa Fonikisi ku twala u mweo aa na gu mane. Ndi kamba ka li li mwiko lya mu cikuli ca Kileta ka li kalile ku bugwe-juba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kalili ikamba ilotu uku fugikilamo a mato a mweo kakuli momo ta ku ungili inkuli lwini.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inkuli inene aa ji fukuka ewate</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Inkuli ja ku mbogela aa se ji la tatiki uku unga, kale ba gaja buti kuti ba jende nenja. Kale ba nanuna i miala jo makwanato iji ka ji zunzumikite u bwato. Mi kale ba tatika uku zuga bu kukumba kumbali no cikuli ca Kileta. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Aobulyo, inkuli inene kale ja fukuka ku zwa ku buzwe-juba, ku unga na ji zwa mu cikuli. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />U bwato kale bwa kabigwa ku nkuli mi kale bwa kangwa uku tunguluza uku ka ji zwa inkuli. Cwale kale twa kangwa co ku tenda, mi u bwato kale bwa kukiswa ku nkuli.<verse eid="ACT 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Kale twa ka gwana intuso aa na twa ka li gwana tu li kumbali no cikuli i cinunu ci kugigwa Kauda, kale twa gola uku kwata a kato a kanunu mi kale twa ka kokela ko bukababu wawa ku bwato buti ka leke ku koshoka ku zwa ku bwato u bunene. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />A bazugi kale ba ka kokela ku bwato u bunene, mi kale ba zinga i miala kwitusi lyo bwato u bunene ko ku joga buti inkuli mane ji timbile u bwato e bwetete lya Silitisi. Kale ba susa iseili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka gamwinya makwanato ga ñoletwe momu mu ntimana aa ejwi.</char></note> inene lyo bwato mi kale ba tatika uku kukiswa ku nkuli bulyo.<verse eid="ACT 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Inkuli kale ja unga lwini bu shanshuwite mi mwijuba ili na lya nungako kale ba tatika uku showela mwiwate i bintu bimwinya ibi ka ba longete. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Ijuba na lya nungako, kale ba showela bimwinya byo bisebeliso byo bwato mu menzi. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kale twa inda a majuba a mangi uku ta tu boni ijuba mane no ntungwezi inkuli na ji unga lwini. Kale twa sika a ku maninwa no nsepo jo ku joja.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />U bungi bo bantu aa se ba la indi a majuba a mangi uku ta ba li i bilyo, Paulusi kale ga zimana mukati kabo no ku ba ta buti, “Bakwangu, ka li na mu la shugwi ibi ka ndi gamba ku matatikilo buti tu leke ku fugula ku zwa mwa Kileta, ta na tu la bi no bobu u bukababu mane no ku jonekelwa ko bintu bulyao. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Kono nda sa mi kumbila buti mu be no bundume kakuli takuli nanga genke uju sa ka fwe, mbwato bulyo sa ka bu jonauke. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Kakuli a masiku ga shunu, iñiloi lya Nyambe uju ndi li gwakwe noju ndi sebeleza li la kezi ku ndi zimana ambali <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />mi li la ndi ti buti, ‘Paulusi u leke ku joga, kakuli nkono ka sike kwa Sesale no ka zimana mu nkuta jakwe, mi Nyambe ko cisemo cakwe kuti a mi jojese mwense bulyao igwe na ba u jenda nabo bonse.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Cwale, mu be no bundume. Kakuli ndi li zumine kwa Nyambe mi ndi la zumina buti kuti ku tendaale ubu a la ndi teli. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Nanganceciba, kuti na tu bombokele mu cikuli cimwinya.”<figure style="fig" file="SHJ_225wbt - Paul to Rome [bwf-dark].indd" size="span" ref="27:1–28:14" /><verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">U bwato u bunene aa bu jonauka</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Akati ko masiku go bu 14 na tu penga bulyao mwiwate lya Adiliya, a bazugi bo bwato kale ba gaja buti bunga se ka ba kokelele ekamba. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Kale ba shonjela i miala uku ka ku shuminwe a mabwe mu menzi buti ba bone u bunokele mi kale ba gwana buti mbunokele bo milyatilo ja 120. Aa se ku la iti inako imfuwi, kale ba ji shonjela lyabili mu menzi mi kale ba gwana buti se mbunokele bo milyatilo ja 90. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Kale ba joga buti inkuli kuti ji ba timbile a mabwe aga ka ga li ekamba. Aobulyo kale ba shonjela i miala jone ja kwitusi lya ku mashule go bwato iji ka ba shumine a makwanato a manene buti ga ka kwanate a mabwe no ku zunzumika u bwato no ku lapela buti ijuba li ñatule.<verse eid="ACT 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />A bazugi bo bwato kale ba shaka buti ba lendele mu bwato. Kale ba sezumwina a kato a kanunu mu menzi na ba tenda sinagwe kame ba shaka ka shumina i miala ku makwanato ku zunzumika u bwato u bunene kwitusi lya ku buso. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Kono Paulusi kale ga ta u mujendesi go masole no masole bamwinya nage, “Baba a bazugi ba si zwa mo muno mu bwato, nela ku la mani mwense mu la fwi.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Aobulyo a masole kale ba koshagula i miala ka ji nungite a kato a kanunu ku bwato u bunene no ku ka leka ka kuka no menzi.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />A maca-siku, Paulusi kale ga indikiza a bantu bonse buti ba lye i bilyo. Kale ga ba ta nage, “Kebaka lyo nkalilwa, se mu li indite a masunda go bile ta mu li i bilyo. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Nda sa mi kumbila buti mu lye cimwinya buti mu joje. Kakuli takuli nanga ndushuki lonke sa ka lu nyukuke ku mitwi jenu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Paulusi kale ga inda u buobe, no ku litumela kwa Nyambe bonse na ba mu lolelele, mi kale ga tatika uku bu komagula na lya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Bonse kale ba gongola i myojo mi kale ba lya i bilyo. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Twense ka tu li bantu ba sika a 276 ka tu longamite momo mu bwato u bunene. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Aa se ba la mani ku lya bonse, kale ba shonjela a masaka go bweke mu menzi buti u bwato bu ubilwe.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Ijuba aa se li la ñatuli, ta na ba zekelela buti mwilonga libo umu se ka ba li. Kono kale ba bona iko li kwesi ikamba lyebwetete, aa ka ba shaka u ka fugikila u bwato ati ka ba gola. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Kale ba koshagula i miala ka ji nungite ku makwanato aga ka ga zuzumikite u bwato no ku ga leka mwiwate. Kale ba shumununa i miala ka ji shumine inzego mi kale ba nanuna iseili lya ku buso bo bwato no ku tunguluza kwikamba. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />A makupezi kale ga timba u bwato lwini mi kale bwa cinka itusi mwibwetete ili ka li tumukite kace u kule kanunu ne kamba. Aobulyo kale bwa kakatila. Itusi lya ku mashule kale lya papauka kebaka lyo bushanshu bo makupezi.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />A masole kale ba li gambaguza mwalyabo buti ba yage a mapantiti bonse buti ba leke uku shamba no ka kantuka buti ba ande. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Kono u mujendesi go masole kale ga shaka buti a jojese Paulusi. Kale ga ba kanisa uku tenda bulyao. Kale ga ta a bantu bonse aba ka ba gola uku shamba buti ba shotaukile mu menzi no ku shamba ku ja ekamba. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Kono bamwinya kale ba lapama a maala no a biala byo maala go bwato ibi na bya papauka. Ko ku tenda bulyao twense kale twa ka kantukila ekamba bulyao.<figure style="fig" alt="Shipwrecked on the island of Malta" file="wa03995b.jpg" size="span" loc="Act 27:33-44" ref="27:39-44">U bwato aa bu papauka a cikuli ca Melita</figure><verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi mu cikuli ca Melita</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Aa se tu la joji no ku kantuka twense ka sika ekamba, kale twa ziba buti mpa cikuli ci kugigwa Melita ka tu li. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />A bantu ka ba sumpite momo mu cikuli kale ba tu tambula ko cisemo mi kale ba tu kolezela u mulilo kebaka lyo mizumbi jo mvula ka shoka no ku tontola.<verse eid="ACT 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulusi kale ga nanuna iñata lyo bisanzu ka bi bunzi ambali. Aa ka bi tula a mulilo, kale kwa zwa ijoka mu bisanzu ili na lya shugwa u kuya ko mulilo, mi kale lya mu zinga kwiganja lyakwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />A bantu ba momo mu cikuli aa ba bona ijoka li zela kwiganja lya Paulusi, kale ba ta nabo, “Joju u muntu a li botele uku ba u muyagi wawa, kakuli no ku a la andi ku menzi, a bazimu aba ta ba shali u muntu, nku kana ba kana buti a joje.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Kono Paulusi kale ga li li meja, ku li mejela mu mulilo kono ta na ga kubala. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />A bantu ka ba gaja buti kuti a zimbe kampa uku fwa wangu-wangu, kono aa se ku la iti inako kale ba bona buti takuli ici ci tendaala, kale ba gaja buti Paulusi ka li ka nyambe-gana.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Afuwi no ao mpo ka lu li u lugwa lo mubusisi gwa ceco i cikuli gwe izina lya Pabbuliyasi. Nage kale ga tu tambula nenja mi kale twa kala nage a majuba go tatwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Isi ba Pabbuliyasi ka li mulwele gwe elenge no mupugo go malowa. Paulusi kale ga ja mu njugo no ka mu lapelela ko ku mu tula a maganja egulu mi kale ga mu oza. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Mi a balwele bamwinya ba momo mu cikuli kale ba keza kwa Paulusi mi kale ga ba oza bonse. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Aa se ku la tendaali bulyao, kale ba tu kutika lwini no ku tu wa ibi ka tu shaka mi aa se ka tu funduka, kale ba tu wa i bintu byo ku litusisa mu lujendo.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa ka sika mu munzi gwa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Aa na kwa mana i myezi jo tatwe kale twa ngina mu bwato u bunene ubu ka bu zwa ku munzi gwa Alekizandiliya ubu ka bu kwesi i cibumbantu kwitusi lya ku buso ici ka ci zimanina i mizimu jo bile jo majovu iji ka ji kugigwa Kasitole no Polakisi. Na bwa inda u mweo gonse na bu fugikitwe momo mu cikuli. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Kale twa ka sika mu munzi gwa Silakusi no ka kalamo a majuba go tatwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Aa na twa zwamo, kale twa zuga ku ja mu munzi gu kugigwa Lejiyamu. Ijuba ili na lya nungako, inkuli kale ja fukuka iji ka ji unga ku zwila ku mbogela mi kale ja tu timba mu majuba gobile bulyao mane na tu ka sika mu munzi gwa Puteole. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Momo kale twa ka gwana a bazumini bamwinya mi kale ba tu kumbila buti tu kale nabo. Aa na kwa mana insunda kale twa ka sikilila mu munzi gwa Loma.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul arrives at Rome" file="wa03998b.jpg" size="span" loc="Act 28:11-14" ref="28:11-14">Paulusi aa sika mu munzi gwa Loma</figure><verse eid="ACT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />A bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Loma se ka ba shugwile buti nkeza tu keza. Kale ba jenda u lujendo u lule ku tu cengamina mane na ba keza ku tu gwana mu munzi gwa Apiyasi u mu kakuli i cibaka ka ci kugigwa Magulikizo go Tatwe. Paulusi aa ba bona, kale ga litumela kwa Nyambe mi kale ga gongola.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi mu munzi gwa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Aa tu ka sika mwa Loma, Paulusi kale ga zumininwa uku kala genke mu njugo mi kale ba mu wa u musole uju ka mu mamela.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Aa se ku la iti a majuba go tatwe, Paulusi kale ga kuga a bajendesi a bakulu bo Majuda ba mwa Loma buti a gambagule nabo. Aa se ba la gwanani, Paulusi kale ga ba ta nage, “Bakwangu, no ku ta na nda fosekeza a bakwangu bo Majuda kampa uku shwaaguza i bizilantu byo mijojelo jo cizo na ba tu lekela basukuzetu ba ku nkulu-katanzi, na ba ndi shumina mu munzi gwa Jelusalema no ku ndi leta ko kuno. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />A babusisi bo Maloma na ba ndi zekisanga mi na ba jelekanga buti ba ndi shumununange kakuli na ba bona buti ta ka ndi kwesi u mulandu ka gu botele u lufu. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Kono a Majuda a bakulu ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema kale ba kana ubu ka ba atwila intaba a babusisi, ime kale nda li kumbilila buti u mfumu u mukulu Sesale a keze a shugwe no ku atula intaba jangu. Ime wawa ta ndi kwesi ibi ndi shangeza a bakwangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Mpaa ndi la mi kugi buti ndi mi bone no ku gambagula nenwe. Kakuli mbulyo ndi shuminwe kebaka lyo ku zumina ku Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe uju ba sepete a bantu belonga lya Isilaele.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />A bakulu bo Majuda ba mwa Loma kale ba mu taba nabo, “Ka tu sini uku tambula a mañolo aga ga zwa kwilonga lya Judeya aga ga ñoletwe byako. Mi takuli jumwinya go bakwetu uju na ga zwako uju na ga sukulula byako. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Kono neswe kame tu shaka uku shugwa ubu u zuminina kakuli tu li zi buti a bantu bo malonga gonse ba sa ta buti a kagugi ko bantu ba zumina ku bintu u ziga, ta ka kele nenja.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Kale ba zumininana no Paulusi ejuba ili ka ba botele uku gwanana nage. Lelyo ijuba a bantu a bangi kale ba keza koko ku njugo ka kalanga Paulusi, mi ku tatika a masiku-siku ku twala a matengu, Paulusi kale ga ba gambaguza byo mubuso gwa Nyambe, no ku jeleka uku ba sigulula ko ku ba lugwila bya Jesu buti nde Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe no Mujojesi. Kale ga ba tansulwila ibi bi ñoletwe mu mulao gwa Mushe no mu mabuka go baboni ba Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Bamwinya kale ba zumina kwe bi ka gambagula Paulusi, kono bamwinya kale ba kana uku bi zumina. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Kale ba li kanana mwalyabo. Ko ku sa shugwana kale ba tatika uku gundumuka mi Paulusi kale ga mana ko ku ba ta buti, “U muboni gwa Nyambe Isaya sa gamba ku basukuzetu ko Moya go Kucena mi ta sa oma aa sa ta nage,<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />‘U je kwa baba a bantu ba gogu u mushobo u ka ba te buti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Kuti na mu tegelezange wawa kwijwi lyangu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">kono ta na mu li shugwilisange.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Kuti na mu bonange wawa i bintu ndi tenda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">kono ta na mu bi bonisisange.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Mba ciulu, mi ta ba shugwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">sinagwe ta ba kwesi a matwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Ta ba wene sinagwe mbaofu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Buti ba leke uku bona i bintu-awa ko mensho gabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">no ku shugwa initi ko matwi gabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Kakuli aa sa ka ba bone no ku shugwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">mane ba sigulukile kwangu mi mane ndi ba oze.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isaya 6:9-10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Cwale kame ndi shaka buti mu zibe buti, se ni nako jo njojeso ja Nyambe jo ku jojesa a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda. Mi abo kuti na ba tegeleze!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Aa sa la gambi bulyao, a Majuda kale ba zwao bu li kanana lwini mwalyabo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 29.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Paulusi kale ga kala i myaka jo bile mwa Loma na joja mu njugo jo ku lifela, mi ka tambula a bantu bonse aba ka ba keza ku ku mu bonanga. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Inako jonse Paulusi ka kwesi uku tandaza ko bundume no ku ziga a bantu byo mubuso gwa Nyambe no byo Mfumu Jesu u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe, mi takuli u muntu uju ka gola uku mu kanisa.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>